# chapter3.rpyc:34
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_862f4d83:

    # "I spend the next day in something of a daze, struggling to keep my wits about me."
    "第二天，我整个人都有些恍惚，费了好大劲才勉强保持清醒。"

# chapter3.rpyc:35
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0ab25933:

    # "I’ve not been sleeping well since Merel arrived in my life, and it’s starting to take its toll on my mind and my body."
    "自从梅蕾尔闯进我的生活，我就没睡过好觉，身心都开始吃不消了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:36
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4fb5a185:

    # "I wander through the work day in a haze, though I don’t, to my credit, make another mistake with Mrs van Dijk’s order."
    "一整天工作都浑浑噩噩。好在，这次没再弄错范戴克太太的单子。"

# chapter3.rpyc:37
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a2eba19f:

    # "I don’t dare to: not after she scolded me yesterday."
    "昨天才被训过，我可不敢。"

# chapter3.rpyc:41
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2e7be68a:

    # "I’m able to bring Mrs van Dijk her Darjeeling and her vanilla sponge, as she requested, but I’m less successful with my other orders."
    "她要的大吉岭茶和香草海绵蛋糕，我都端对了。可其他单子就没这么顺利。"

# chapter3.rpyc:42
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_15360c36:

    # "I get Earl Greys mixed up with black coffees, and I very nearly drop an apple tart into the lap of a young girl with bunches."
    "我把伯爵茶和黑咖啡搞混，还差点把苹果挞掉到一个扎着双马尾的小女孩腿上。"

# chapter3.rpyc:43
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_39ff5089:

    # "I have a few near misses when it comes to serving one family an array of cakes arranged neatly on little plates: carrot cake, coffee cake, and these teeny-tiny éclairs."
    "给一家人端蛋糕时，也接连出了几次险情。胡萝卜蛋糕、咖啡蛋糕，还有小小的闪电泡芙，全都整齐地摆在各自的小盘子里。"

# chapter3.rpyc:44
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3975eb20:

    # "I manage to drop a tray laden with several delicate teacups rather spectacularly when I bring them into the kitchen for my father to clean."
    "把几只精致的茶杯送去厨房给爸爸洗时，我更是直接摔了托盘，动静相当惊人。"

# chapter3.rpyc:45
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f8b0db6b:

    # "Fortunately, I don’t drop the tray in the café itself, where everybody can see me..."
    "幸好没摔在咖啡馆里面，没让所有人看见……"

# chapter3.rpyc:46
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fb29ae32:

    # "But unfortunately, I do manage to drop the tray near the kitchen’s entrance, in earshot of everybody sitting at the tables outside."
    "可惜也没好到哪去。就摔在厨房门口，外面坐着的客人全都听得见。"

# chapter3.rpyc:47
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cd890358:

    # "The damage isn’t too bad — I only break two of the teeny-tiny teacups — but I still scold myself for my clumsiness."
    "损失倒不算严重，只打碎了两只小茶杯。可我还是忍不住骂自己笨手笨脚。"

# chapter3.rpyc:48
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ae62af95:

    # "What is wrong with me?"
    "我到底怎么了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:49
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e7ded809:

    # "After that little mishap, I’m determined to get through the rest of the day without any further incidents..."
    "出了这点岔子后，我下定决心，今天剩下的时间绝不能再出事……"

# chapter3.rpyc:58
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_53ab876e:

    # "But it’s not that simple."
    "可没那么简单。"

# chapter3.rpyc:60
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b8b8fbed:

    # "Somehow, I find myself tripping over my own feet shortly after I finish sweeping up the bits of broken china from the kitchen floor."
    "刚把厨房地上的碎瓷片扫干净没多久，我不知怎么又绊到了自己的脚。"

# chapter3.rpyc:62
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_42cf83e5:

    # "I’ve not been back in the café for much more than two minutes, and I’m already making a fool out of myself."
    "回到店里才两分钟左右，居然就又开始出丑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:63
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7875b519:

    # "I know I’m not the most coordinated of people, but I didn’t think I was this comically clumsy!"
    "我知道自己动作不算协调，可也不至于笨到像演滑稽戏吧！"

# chapter3.rpyc:65
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_778027c5:

    # "I gasp as I fall, my eyes squeezing shut, as I prepare myself for impact."
    "跌下去时，我惊叫一声，紧紧闭上眼睛，准备迎接撞击。"

# chapter3.rpyc:69
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_426ad3bd:

    # "I’m fully expecting to hit the ground with a sick thud..."
    "本以为会狠狠摔到地上，发出令人牙酸的一声闷响……"

# chapter3.rpyc:83
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6421541f:

    # W "Whoopsy-daisy! That could’ve been bad, wahaha~"
    W "哎呀，小心！这一下可差点摔惨了，哇哈哈～"

# chapter3.rpyc:87
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f8d4f1a7:

    # "But the impact never comes."
    "可预想中的撞击并没有来。"

# chapter3.rpyc:88
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_952f00b4:

    # "Instead, I feel a curious sensation around me, warm and reassuring."
    "取而代之的，是一种温暖又安心的奇妙触感。"

# chapter3.rpyc:89
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1e557078:

    # "There are arms around my waist and a supportive hand against the small of my back."
    "手臂环住我的腰，一只手稳稳托在后腰上。"

# chapter3.rpyc:90
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f68b389f:

    # "Could that be...?"
    "难道是……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:91
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_72570581:

    # Merel "Hey, Nienke. Are you doin’ alright there?"
    Merel "喂，妮恩克，还好吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:92
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_69125667:

    # Nienke "Oh, um..."
    Nienke "啊，嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:93
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3141a5c3:

    # "My saviour is there, her muscular arms twined about me. She’s smiling, her red eyes bright, as she holds me to her."
    "救我的人就在眼前，结实的双臂环着我。她把我扶在怀里，笑着，红眼睛明亮。"

# chapter3.rpyc:94
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d4f4f237:

    # "She looks utterly unperturbed by what happened, but as for me..."
    "对刚才的事，她似乎一点都没慌。至于我……"

# chapter3.rpyc:95
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9ff9d860:

    # Merel "Nienke? You’re not sayin’ very much. Is something the matter?"
    Merel "妮恩克？怎么不说话？哪里不舒服吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:96
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e965e0c1:

    # "As for me..."
    "至于我……"

# chapter3.rpyc:97
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0a6768b9:

    # Merel "Nienke...?"
    Merel "妮恩克……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:98
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a5e037cc:

    # "I-I can’t stop blushing...!"
    "我、我的脸怎么都不肯退红……！"

# chapter3.rpyc:99
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fe6471cc:

    # "Merel is so close to me I can smell her."
    "梅蕾尔离得那么近，我都闻得到她的气味。"

# chapter3.rpyc:100
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_caa0068f:

    # "She smells faintly of my shampoo — of hibiscus and honey — but there’s something faintly grassy underneath it."
    "隐约有我洗发水的香气，木槿和蜂蜜，底下还藏着一点青草的味道。"

# chapter3.rpyc:101
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a4cd4f05:

    # "It’s a refreshing sort of smell: one which reminds me of a warm summer’s day. The scent of her is addling my senses. My stupid face won’t stop flushing."
    "很清爽，让人想到暖洋洋的夏日。她身上的气息把我的感官都搅乱了，这张不争气的脸，怎么还在发烫。"

# chapter3.rpyc:105
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a2dac835:

    # "My stupid heart won’t stop pounding, either. I’m terrified that Merel will be able to hear me, since we’re so close together."
    "不争气的心也一直怦怦直跳。我们靠得这么近，我真怕她听见。"

# chapter3.rpyc:106
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4d03c7dd:

    # "I look up at her shyly, waiting for her to comment on my flushed face and my elevated heart rate..."
    "我羞怯地抬眼望她，等着她拿我的脸红和心跳开玩笑……"

# chapter3.rpyc:107
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f0919df5:

    # Merel "Are you alright, Nienke? Did the fall startle you?"
    Merel "妮恩克，你没事吧？刚才吓到了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:108
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3b58f6c7:

    # "But, to my immense relief, she doesn’t tease me. She smiles at me instead, her expression so gentle it feels like a fist around my heart: fingers squeezing down hard."
    "可让我大大松了口气的是，她没有逗我，只是冲我笑。那神情温柔得像一只手，紧紧攥住了我的心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:109
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f6ffa7ec:

    # "There’s something familiar about Merel’s smile which unlocks long-forgotten memories."
    "她的笑容里有种熟悉的东西，打开了尘封已久的记忆。"

# chapter3.rpyc:110
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_820e42d3:

    # "I think I remember this. It feels familiar."
    "我好像记得。这样的感觉很熟悉。"

# chapter3.rpyc:111
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_407654c6:

    # "Did she hold me like this once before, a long time ago?"
    "很久以前，她是不是也这样扶过我？"

# chapter3.rpyc:112
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b0de18ba:

    # "It must have been very long ago now since that was the last time we (supposedly) spent any time together. It’s been years, but..."
    "一定已经很久了。毕竟按她所说，上一次相处，还是那么多年前的事。可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:116
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_23b22a84:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, no, um..."
    Nienke "啊、啊，没有，那个……"

# chapter3.rpyc:127
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_63e270f7:

    # "I draw away from Merel, my heart still pounding. Shyly, I adjust the hem of my dress and look away, my arms folded."
    "我从梅蕾尔怀里退开，心跳依然很快。有点不好意思地理好裙摆，抱起胳膊，把脸转到一边。"

# chapter3.rpyc:128
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e870f0d9:

    # Nienke "I’m...{w} al-alright. I was a bit startled, but you don’t need to worry about me."
    Nienke "我……{w}没、没事。是吓了一下，不过你不用担心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:130
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_98f26641:

    # Merel "You sure?"
    Merel "真的？"

# chapter3.rpyc:132
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_11a92b13:

    # Merel "You seemed like you were in some pain when you tripped. You didn’t twist your ankle, did you?"
    Merel "刚才绊倒时，你看着好像很疼。没扭到脚吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:134
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_297654c2:

    # Nienke "N-No, um... I’m alright. I can walk just fine, see?"
    Nienke "没、没有，嗯……我没事。走路好好的，你看？"

# chapter3.rpyc:136
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2028573c:

    # "I turn about in a neat little circle to prove this, the hem of my skirt billowing, while Merel smiles."
    "为了证明，我利落地转了个小圈，裙摆随之扬起。梅蕾尔笑了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:138
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_47462c34:

    # Merel "Well, alright. If you say so, your highness."
    Merel "那好吧，殿下，你说没事就没事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:140
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_adf7f475:

    # Merel "Now, shall we get back to work?"
    Merel "现在，我们继续工作？"

# chapter3.rpyc:143
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_73839ba9:

    # Nienke "R-Right...!"
    Nienke "好、好……！"

# chapter3.rpyc:145
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7dc657a6:

    # "I’m afraid I might sound overly eager, but I’m keen to try and seize this sliver of normality."
    "答得可能太急了，可我实在想抓住这点恢复正常的机会。"

# chapter3.rpyc:147
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d3fbeca1:

    # "I hope, if I can get back into the swing of things, it’ll quell the fluttering in my heart."
    "希望回到工作的节奏里，就能压住心里的悸动。"

# chapter3.rpyc:148
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ea38c49b:

    # "Maybe it’ll stop me from feeling so anxious..."
    "也许就不会这么不安……"

# chapter3.rpyc:149
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3a0fec45:

    # "And, with some luck, maybe I’ll finally stop blushing."
    "运气好的话，脸也总算能不红了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:164
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5dfe20e1:

    # Merel "Phew! I’m glad that’s finally over!"
    Merel "呼！可算结束了！"

# chapter3.rpyc:165
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0e1a2edb:

    # "Merel sighs with relief once the very last of today’s customers exit Fleur de Lys."
    "今天最后一位客人离开百合花后，梅蕾尔如释重负地叹了口气。"

# chapter3.rpyc:167
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a6016aed:

    # "She stretches, her chest shifting as she raises her arms (I try not to stare at her, and I think I mostly succeed) and says..."
    "她抬起胳膊伸懒腰，胸前也跟着起伏。我努力不盯着看，应该基本做到了。接着，她说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:169
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_98f1df8a:

    # Merel "I feel like we were pretty busy today. Wasn’t today way more packed than usual?"
    Merel "今天好忙啊。是不是比平时人多多了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:179
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_825306e2:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, um... I think so...?"
    Nienke "啊，嗯……好像是吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:181
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dd8f3d42:

    # Nienke "It gets like that sometimes, I guess. We have busier days and quieter ones. There isn’t always a reason for it. It just happens."
    Nienke "偶尔会这样。有的日子忙，有的日子清闲，也不一定有什么原因，就是赶上了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:183
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ad8983e8:

    # Merel "Yeah, that makes sense. I guess you can’t really control these things, but geez! I’ve been on my poor feet for ages!"
    Merel "嗯，也对。这种事确实管不了。可是天哪，我这可怜的两只脚，都站多久了！"

# chapter3.rpyc:184
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ee096ecb:

    # Merel "I think it’d be nice to sit down for a bit..."
    Merel "真想坐下来歇一会儿……"

# chapter3.rpyc:187
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e199e8bc:

    # Merel "Or, I know! Maybe we could go out to the field again?"
    Merel "啊，对了！要不再去田野那边？"

# chapter3.rpyc:189
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_eb2d7aff:

    # Merel "It seems like a nice place to sit and smell the roses — literally!"
    Merel "那儿很适合坐着享受一下生活，闻闻玫瑰花香。是真的闻花香哦！"

# chapter3.rpyc:191
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e857c0a3:

    # Merel "There’s a whole load of flowers out there. They’re real pretty!"
    Merel "那边花可多了，漂亮得很！"

# chapter3.rpyc:193
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0cc323a3:

    # Nienke "They are, yes, but I don’t believe any of those flowers are roses."
    Nienke "是很漂亮，不过我想，那些应该都不是玫瑰。"

# chapter3.rpyc:195
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8c145a5e:

    # Merel "They ain’t?"
    Merel "不是吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:197
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_64fd175f:

    # Nienke "I don’t think so. I know a fair bit about flowers, because of my terrariums, and most of the flowers by the windmill are primroses."
    Nienke "应该不是。我养玻璃花园，对花还算了解。风车附近那些，大多是报春花。"

# chapter3.rpyc:199
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_00796104:

    # Merel "Well, ain’t they a type of rose? They do have ‘rose’ in the name, after all!"
    Merel "可它不是叫“primrose”嘛？名字里有“rose”，不也算一种玫瑰？"

# chapter3.rpyc:201
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_655d36f2:

    # Nienke "Not quite. They’re a different genus altogether..."
    Nienke "不算。它们根本不是同一个属……"

# chapter3.rpyc:203
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_50e614d2:

    # Merel "A different what?"
    Merel "同一个什么？"

# chapter3.rpyc:205
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e21fa9f2:

    # Nienke "...Never mind."
    Nienke "……算了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:207
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e43135a9:

    # "I’m plenty tired myself, after spending a busy day tending to customers, and I don’t want to get stuck into complicated subjects like botany with Merel."
    "忙着招待了一整天客人，我也累得够呛，不想再跟她讨论植物学这种复杂话题。"

# chapter3.rpyc:209
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ed9ff295:

    # "I don’t understand a lot of it myself, even though I have read a few books on gardening, and there’s rather a lot of long words to wrap my mouth around."
    "虽然读过几本园艺书，我自己也有很多不懂的，还有一堆拗口的长词。"

# chapter3.rpyc:210
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_018c2347:

    # "Like Merel, I think I just want to relax."
    "跟梅蕾尔一样，我只想放松一下。"

# chapter3.rpyc:212
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5518fc63:

    # Nienke "We can go for a walk later, if you like. It would feel almost like a waste not to, since it’s such a nice day..."
    Nienke "你想的话，晚点可以出去走走。天气这么好，不出去好像也挺浪费……"

# chapter3.rpyc:214
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a0458a27:

    # Nienke "But before that, we need to get this place cleaned up — and we should get changed, too. I don’t want to go wandering around the streets in a maid’s outfit."
    Nienke "不过得先打扫干净，再换衣服。我可不想穿着女仆装在街上晃。"

# chapter3.rpyc:216
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f5da685c:

    # Merel "Wahaha! That’s fair, I s’pose — though it seems like somethin’ of a shame."
    Merel "哇哈哈！也是。不过，总觉得有点可惜呢。"

# chapter3.rpyc:218
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9764d0de:

    # Nienke "Explain."
    Nienke "怎么说？"

# chapter3.rpyc:220
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_84bcde86:

    # Merel "Well, I though it would’ve been self-evident. You look so cute in that maid’s dress, it seems like a pity you don’t wear it more often!"
    Merel "这不是明摆着的吗？你穿女仆裙这么可爱，不多穿一会儿，太可惜啦！"

# chapter3.rpyc:222
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ff857b84:

    # Nienke "And why would I do something like that? I have no desire to make a spectacle out of myself."
    Nienke "我为什么要那么做？我又不想出风头。"

# chapter3.rpyc:224
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6dd663c4:

    # Nienke "You might like courting attention, but I can’t say the same for myself."
    Nienke "你可能喜欢引人注意，我可不喜欢。"

# chapter3.rpyc:228
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6f73f625:

    # Merel "Alright, alright! Try’n keep your bloomers on, Nienke! I’m just sayin’ you look cute as a maid. I’m tryin’ to compliment you here!"
    Merel "好好好！别急嘛，妮恩克！我只是说你穿女仆装很可爱，想夸你呢！"

# chapter3.rpyc:230
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f6ea4ed8:

    # Nienke "Well, don’t. Talking about somebody’s appearance against their will is like sexual harassment."
    Nienke "那就别夸。不顾本人意愿，随便评论外貌，都跟性骚扰差不多了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:233
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8345ec38:

    # Merel "Harassment?!"
    Merel "骚扰？！"

# chapter3.rpyc:235
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2e6ff214:

    # "Merel rejoins, her red eyes wide in faux surprise."
    "梅蕾尔睁大红眼睛，故作惊讶地反问。"

# chapter3.rpyc:237
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_16140857:

    # Merel "I don’t see it. I ain’t harassin’ you, Nienke! In fact, you’re the one who had your hands all over me during my first day workin’ in the café!"
    Merel "哪有啊！妮恩克，我可没骚扰你！倒是第一天上班时，你的手一直在我身上摸来摸去！"

# chapter3.rpyc:239
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5306c8a2:

    # Nienke "O-Only because you asked me to!!! You couldn’t do up the zip of your dress, remember?"
    Nienke "那、那是因为你叫我帮忙！！！你自己拉不上裙子拉链，忘了吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:241
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_54a0a236:

    # Merel "Yeah, I remember, but don’t think I didn’t notice that your hands lingered a liiiiittle too long against my back."
    Merel "记得呀。可别以为我没发现，你的手在我背上停得有那——么一点久。"

# chapter3.rpyc:242
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c4c925db:

    # Nienke "N-No, they didn’t...!"
    Nienke "才、才没有……！"

# chapter3.rpyc:244
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4d4842d6:

    # Merel "Yes, they did! You can’t fool me, Nienke! I can see riiiiiiiight through you, wahaha~"
    Merel "就有！妮恩克，你骗不了我。我早就把你看得透——透的了，哇哈哈～"

# chapter3.rpyc:246
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1a2dbeea:

    # Merel "You might’ve gotten a bit older, but you’re still terrible at hiding your feelings. I know you way too well!"
    Merel "虽然长大了一点，你还是不会藏心事。我太了解你啦！"

# chapter3.rpyc:250
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7b7fc480:

    # Nienke "A-And I {i}barely{/i} know {i}you!{/i} You’re still a stranger to me, you dummy! N-Now, let’s stop talking about this. We need to start working!"
    Nienke "可、可我{i}根本{/i}不了解{i}你{/i}！对我来说，你还是陌生人，笨蛋！好、好了，别说这些，该干活了！"

# chapter3.rpyc:252
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8fd7fba4:

    # Elowen m "My my?"
    Elowen m "哎呀，这是怎么了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:253
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_83c3d5c9:

    # "My mother looks at me askance, her head tilted. She’s just exited the kitchen, and now she surveys the two of us, an amused smile on her lips."
    "妈妈歪着头，看了我一眼。她刚从厨房出来，此刻望着我们两个，嘴边挂着忍俊不禁的笑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:255
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_14aa77f5:

    # Elowen m "What is going on here? You look rather flushed, Nienke, dear — and you were making quite a racket, too."
    Elowen m "出什么事了？妮恩克，亲爱的，你的脸怎么这么红？刚才还闹出了好大的动静。"

# chapter3.rpyc:256
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_641f574e:

    # Elowen "Merel isn’t teasing you, is she?"
    Elowen "梅蕾尔没在逗你吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:258
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_98509601:

    # Nienke "N-No, she’s not! Nothing’s wrong: nothing at all. I’m just fine!"
    Nienke "没、没有！什么事都没有！我好得很！"

# chapter3.rpyc:260
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8a8d5939:

    # Elowen "Really? Are you sure?"
    Elowen "真的？确定吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:262
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_988e2e03:

    # Merel "I dunno. You still look pretty flushed, wahaha~"
    Merel "不知道耶，你脸还挺红的，哇哈哈～"

# chapter3.rpyc:264
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1f1bf2cb:

    # Nienke "A-And whose fault is that, exactly?!"
    Nienke "那、那到底是谁害的？！"

# chapter3.rpyc:266
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8f0a3ef4:

    # Merel "Gee, I dunno! I really have no idea, wahaha~"
    Merel "哎呀，不知道！完全不知道呢，哇哈哈～"

# chapter3.rpyc:270
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7641bab4:

    # Nienke "I’m sure you don’t."
    Nienke "你当然不知道。"

# chapter3.rpyc:271
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_834fe8d4:

    # "I retort, with a roll of my eyes."
    "我翻了个白眼，回敬她。"

# chapter3.rpyc:273
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_94e6a4b9:

    # Nienke "Now, let’s get to work. We have a lot to do before we can leave."
    Nienke "好了，干活吧。想出门，还有一堆事得做。"

# chapter3.rpyc:275
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a74dfd19:

    # Merel "Hehe. Alrighty, then. I’ll get right to it, ma’am!"
    Merel "嘿嘿，好的，女士！我这就去！"

# chapter3.rpyc:284
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_23e37df0:

    # "And so, after that little conversation, the two of us get to work, aided by my mother."
    "这段小插曲过后，我们俩开始干活，妈妈也一起帮忙。"

# chapter3.rpyc:285
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_be1b21a9:

    # "We finish wiping down the floors, the tables, and the windows in good time, and by the time we’re done, dinner is ready."
    "地板、桌子、窗户，很快都擦干净了。忙完时，晚饭也已经准备好。"

# chapter3.rpyc:286
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e8168d2f:

    # "We eat together in the kitchen before Merel and I depart, closing the door behind us with a thud."
    "我们在厨房一起吃过饭，然后我和梅蕾尔出门，身后的门砰地关上。"

# chapter3.rpyc:291
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0173e5a0:

    # "I’d like to say that I’m looking forward to my excursion with Merel..."
    "真想说，我很期待这次和她出游……"

# chapter3.rpyc:292
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c621cbc5:

    # "But I’m not sure, all of a sudden, if I really want to spend more time than is strictly necessary with her."
    "可忽然又拿不准，除了不得不相处的时间，我到底还想不想多陪她。"

# chapter3.rpyc:293
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d13c0b28:

    # "She’s been getting on my nerves."
    "她一直弄得我心烦意乱。"

# chapter3.rpyc:294
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_05321547:

    # "I don’t want to let her get the better of me, though, and I don’t want her to know just how much her teasing has flustered me."
    "但我也不想让她占上风，更不想让她知道，自己那些逗弄究竟让我有多慌张。"

# chapter3.rpyc:295
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_08019206:

    # "I can endure her company. I-I’m sure it’ll be fine!"
    "跟她待在一起，我忍得住。肯、肯定没事！"

# chapter3.rpyc:296
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_53cd7b82:

    # "I’ve been dealing with her all day. A few more hours won’t kill me..."
    "整天都应付过来了，再多几小时也不会要命……"

# chapter3.rpyc:297
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2414ef09:

    # "Or, at least, I hope it doesn’t."
    "至少，希望不会。"

# chapter3.rpyc:305
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fba42876:

    # "Both Merel and I change out of our maid outfits, and then we go for a wander."
    "我和梅蕾尔都换下女仆装，出去散步。"

# chapter3.rpyc:306
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_82c2d5c7:

    # "I avoid Alpenrose’s main shopping street (I don’t want to risk running into Hendrik again) and instead make a beeline for the village outskirts."
    "我避开阿尔彭罗瑟的主商店街，不想再冒险撞见亨德里克，直接朝村外走。"

# chapter3.rpyc:307
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d3af0f8d:

    # "I want to go to the field again, where all of the flowers are. I want to look at the windmills, and the trees in the distance..."
    "想再去那片开满花的田野，看看风车，看看远处的树……"

# chapter3.rpyc:308
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_deff4cf1:

    # "And, if we stay out long enough, I might like to see the stars, too."
    "如果待得够晚，也想看看星星。"

# chapter3.rpyc:309
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9ce433a6:

    # "The stars are so small and far-away, and there’s so many of them. They’re scattered across a sea of dark blue: a reminder of just how huge this world is, and how little I know about it."
    "星星那么小，那么远，又那么多，散落在深蓝的海洋里，提醒着我：世界有多大，而我知道的，又有多少。"

# chapter3.rpyc:310
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_db3151d0:

    # "Sometimes, looking up at the sky makes me feel small: insignificant, even..."
    "有时候，抬头看天，会觉得自己很渺小，甚至微不足道……"

# chapter3.rpyc:311
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6733ce2b:

    # "But I think there’s something soothing about that."
    "可这样的感觉，也有让人安心的地方。"

# chapter3.rpyc:312
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cfa32241:

    # "It serves as a nice reminder that no matter how all-consuming my worries might seem in the moment, they’re really rather insignificant in the grand scheme of things."
    "它提醒我，无论眼下的烦恼看起来多么铺天盖地，放进整个世界里，其实都不算什么。"

# chapter3.rpyc:322
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b0dac5fa:

    # "The stars haven’t come out just yet, though. The sky overhead is slowly turning reddish-pink: faint and almost ethereal."
    "不过，星星还没出来。头顶的天空正慢慢染上淡淡的粉红，朦胧得有些不真实。"

# chapter3.rpyc:323
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f2571046:

    # "There’s something relaxing about that, too. The last vestiges of the sinking sun make me feel at ease."
    "这也让人放松。落日最后一点余晖，渐渐安抚了我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:324
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_297a0d0d:

    # "It’s cosy, I guess: a little like a mother’s loving embrace."
    "很温暖吧，像妈妈充满爱意的拥抱。"

# chapter3.rpyc:325
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e9180ecc:

    # "That might be a sentimental way of looking at things, but I guess I’m a sentimental person. It must be because I like reading so much."
    "这样想或许有点多愁善感，可我本来就是这样的人。大概因为太爱读书了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:326
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5f46373e:

    # "I’m especially fond of fairytales: stories of fair princesses who endure hardship, but who are always able to emerge victorious."
    "尤其喜欢童话：美丽的公主历经磨难，却总能迎来胜利的故事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:327
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0bb93e8f:

    # "Speaking of hardship..."
    "说起磨难……"

# chapter3.rpyc:338
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ca807cf9:

    # "I cast my mind back to what occurred in the café earlier, when I tripped and Merel came to my defence."
    "我又想起今天店里的事。我绊倒了，梅蕾尔及时护住我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:339
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3f7bb3cd:

    # "I was so caught up in the sensation of Merel’s hands on my own that it was hard for me to think of anything else."
    "当时只顾着感受她的双手，几乎没法想别的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:340
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5b1d52c1:

    # "A few thoughts are beginning to nag at me, however."
    "可现在，有几个念头开始萦绕不去。"

# chapter3.rpyc:341
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6fd02338:

    # "I think Merel has held me like that before."
    "她以前好像也这样扶过我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:345
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b6f7d4f2:

    # "This is why I asked Merel whether we could go for a walk. In part, I wanted to clear my head, but I’m also intrigued."
    "所以我才答应和她出来散步。一部分是想清醒一下，也有一部分，是好奇。"

# chapter3.rpyc:346
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bec157e1:

    # "I might be reading into this too much, but..."
    "也许我想得太多了，可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:362
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5d339122:

    # Nienke "Hey, Merel...?"
    Nienke "喂，梅蕾尔……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:364
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b4b60a1d:

    # Merel "Hmm?"
    Merel "嗯？"

# chapter3.rpyc:365
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4d96cb24:

    # "Merel glances at me, her choppy hair shifting about her cheeks."
    "她看向我，参差的发梢在脸颊边轻晃。"

# chapter3.rpyc:367
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3157f01a:

    # "The two of us have taken a seat amongst the tall grass, and Merel has been smiling faintly to herself as she luxuriates in the gentle brush of the breeze."
    "我们已经在高高的草丛间坐下。梅蕾尔享受着微风轻拂，嘴边一直带着浅浅的笑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:368
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_42cc3fd8:

    # "While I’ve been sat there, cross-legged, lost in thoughts, Merel has been fishing about amongst the tall grass for a means to distract herself."
    "我盘着腿出神时，她就在草丛里翻找，想给自己找点消遣。"

# chapter3.rpyc:371
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8f589966:

    # "She plucked a particularly tall strand of grass from amongst its neighbours, and was whistling with it, the sound thin and reedy, when I addressed her."
    "她拔了一根格外长的草叶。我叫她时，她正用草叶吹出细细的哨音，像小小的笛声。"

# chapter3.rpyc:373
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c5112242:

    # "She sets the blade of grass to one side, onto her lap, then offers me a small smile."
    "她把草叶放在膝上，冲我微微一笑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:374
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5152e843:

    # Merel "Is something wrong?"
    Merel "怎么啦？"

# chapter3.rpyc:376
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_737f41e6:

    # Nienke "I don’t know if anything’s wrong, per se. I just...{w} had a thought..."
    Nienke "也不算有什么事。只是……{w}想到了一点东西……"

# chapter3.rpyc:378
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_29721139:

    # Nienke "Or maybe it’s more like a memory?"
    Nienke "或者说，像是一段记忆？"

# chapter3.rpyc:380
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cd8b5265:

    # Nienke "I’m not sure how much I can recall of the past, but this seems... significant, somehow."
    Nienke "不知道自己还能想起多少以前的事，可这个……总觉得有点重要。"

# chapter3.rpyc:382
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a7803d56:

    # Merel "Oh, yes?"
    Merel "哦，是吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:384
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f760c518:

    # Nienke "Yes. Um..."
    Nienke "嗯，那个……"

# chapter3.rpyc:386
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0e010307:

    # Nienke "It might not be anything, I guess? I could always be mixing things up. That... seems to happen to me a lot."
    Nienke "也可能根本没什么。我也许又弄混了。这种事……好像经常发生。"

# chapter3.rpyc:388
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_54c47013:

    # Nienke "I don’t remember much about my past, like you know. I’ve told you that already, but..."
    Nienke "你知道，我记不清多少过去的事，也已经说过了。不过……"

# chapter3.rpyc:389
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c68db74a:

    # Nienke "When you held me earlier, in the café, I thought..."
    Nienke "刚才在店里，你扶住我的时候，我觉得……"

# chapter3.rpyc:391
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aaf58a0f:

    # Nienke "I feel like you’ve held me like that before, during walks in the woods. I would stumble, but you would always be there to support me."
    Nienke "以前去林间散步时，你好像也这样扶过我。我一绊倒，你总会在旁边接住。"

# chapter3.rpyc:392
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4c1eb720:

    # Nienke "I could feel secure when we were together, even though I was so small and slight, because you were with me."
    Nienke "哪怕我又小又弱，只要跟你在一起，就能放心，因为有你陪着。"

# chapter3.rpyc:394
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_03a102a8:

    # Nienke "You reassured me. I could always rely on you..."
    Nienke "你让我很安心。我总能依靠你……"

# chapter3.rpyc:396
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4459ba48:

    # Nienke "Or, at least, I think I could."
    Nienke "至少，我好像是这样觉得的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:398
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8c29e0e8:

    # Nienke "That...{w} sounds about right, at least, but am I mistaken?"
    Nienke "这……{w}听起来应该没错吧，还是我记错了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:400
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6fbf7321:

    # Merel "Nienke..."
    Merel "妮恩克……"

# chapter3.rpyc:401
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bf0463a3:

    # "Merel looks at me for a moment, seemingly lost for words."
    "梅蕾尔望着我，一时似乎不知道该说什么。"

# chapter3.rpyc:403
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_88939a1f:

    # "There’s a long pause, and then..."
    "沉默了好一会儿，然后……"

# chapter3.rpyc:407
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f641311d:

    # Merel "Hehe."
    Merel "嘿嘿。"

# chapter3.rpyc:409
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_82ced22a:

    # Merel "So, it’s finally coming back to you, huh?"
    Merel "所以，总算开始想起来了，是吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:411
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3eed9ee1:

    # "Merel looks pensive, her arms wound around her legs. There’s another pause, and then..."
    "她抱住双腿，若有所思。又停了一会儿，才说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:413
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_044134b6:

    # Merel "...Yeah, you’re right about that. I did always wind up lookin’ out for you when you lived in Mors Paravail."
    Merel "……嗯，没错。你还住在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔的时候，确实总是我护着你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:415
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c21f3a92:

    # Merel "I know I told you this the other night, but the other kids would pick on you a lot, mostly ’cause you were so small, an’ you had some airs and graces."
    Merel "前天晚上也说过，别的孩子经常欺负你。主要因为你个子小，又有点小姐架子。"

# chapter3.rpyc:419
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cbbebcf6:

    # Merel "I think you looked down your nose at the others a little: mostly when it came to the boys."
    Merel "你大概有一点看不上他们，尤其是那些男孩子。"

# chapter3.rpyc:420
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_01a5eb7c:

    # Merel "I’m sure Roan had a bit of a thing for you, actually, ’cause you were such a cutie."
    Merel "其实，我敢说罗安是有点喜欢你的，毕竟你那么可爱。"

# chapter3.rpyc:422
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1f46d942:

    # Merel "He kept tryin’ to get on your good side, but you weren’t having any of it."
    Merel "他老想讨你欢心，可你根本不吃那套。"

# chapter3.rpyc:423
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3d5596e7:

    # Merel "You used to turn your nose up at his efforts to win you over. You said you didn’t like boys, and you thought they were all loud and dirty, and Roan didn’t like that."
    Merel "他想方设法让你喜欢，你却爱理不理。还说不喜欢男孩子，觉得他们又吵又脏。罗安听了可不高兴。"

# chapter3.rpyc:425
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6f0b4bc6:

    # Merel "I think you must’ve broken his heart, ’cause he turned kind of nasty after that."
    Merel "大概被你伤了心吧，从那以后，就开始使坏。"

# chapter3.rpyc:426
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bf4e8d93:

    # Merel "He and his gang of boys banded together, and they used to harass you. They called you names, and stole your books, and threw things at you."
    Merel "他跟那群男孩凑在一起，专门骚扰你。骂你，抢你的书，还拿东西扔你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:428
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d22b4673:

    # Merel "Once, when we all went on a walk, Roan even tried to punt you into a load of stinging nettles!"
    Merel "有一次一起出去走，他居然想把你踹进一大丛刺荨麻里！"

# chapter3.rpyc:430
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_03969f3b:

    # Nienke "He did...?"
    Nienke "真的……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:432
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9b39fcd7:

    # Merel "He did! I was so mad, I wound up knocking him over into a cow pat, just to show him how much of an ass he was being!"
    Merel "真的！我当时气坏了，把他推了个跟头，正好倒进牛粪里，让他知道自己有多混账！"

# chapter3.rpyc:436
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c8a81aaf:

    # Merel "I felt a bit sorry for him in the beginning, I s’pose, ’cause you’d crushed his little heart under your teeny-tiny heel, but that was no way for him to carry on!"
    Merel "一开始，我是有一点可怜他啦。毕竟那颗小心脏，被你的小鞋跟踩得稀碎。可也不能这么撒野吧！"

# chapter3.rpyc:438
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5a23adb7:

    # Merel "He made you cry!"
    Merel "他把你都弄哭了！"

# chapter3.rpyc:440
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_52f07164:

    # Merel "He was a real louse, an’ I reckon he showed his true colours after you turned him down."
    Merel "真是个烂人。我看就是被拒绝以后，露出真面目了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:442
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3516660c:

    # Merel "If you ask me, you made the right decision. He had no business with you!"
    Merel "要我说，你拒绝得对。他根本配不上你！"

# chapter3.rpyc:450
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3c6ba55a:

    # "I sit there on the grass silently, digesting these stories as though they’re sugared biscuits."
    "我默默坐在草地上，像嚼着糖霜饼干一样，慢慢消化这些故事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:452
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0b545306:

    # "Merel’s telling them with enough passion that the stories feel especially vivid."
    "梅蕾尔讲得很投入，让那些往事格外鲜活。"

# chapter3.rpyc:454
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_48c33c7f:

    # "When I close my eyes, I can almost imagine that I’m a little girl again, trying to read while these obnoxious boys harass me..."
    "闭上眼睛，我几乎能想象自己又变回小女孩，正想看书，那些讨厌的男生却围着骚扰……"

# chapter3.rpyc:456
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_eef6ec65:

    # "But imagining is all I can do."
    "可也只能想象。"

# chapter3.rpyc:457
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f49b417e:

    # "I’m supposed to be the main heroine in these tales, but this girl doesn’t sound familiar at all. Merel might well be reciting a story to me: something which happened to a completely different person."
    "这些故事的主角明明应该是我，可那个女孩却一点都不熟悉。梅蕾尔简直像在给我讲故事，讲另一个人身上发生的事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:459
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f8ea1e70:

    # "I have no recollections of this Roan, no matter how many times Merel has told me about him. I don’t even recall what he looked like, though that might be for the best."
    "无论她提多少次，我都不记得罗安，连长相也想不起来。不过，也许忘了更好。"

# chapter3.rpyc:460
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f8dd9bfa:

    # "It sounds like he was pretty awful to me."
    "听着，他对我真的很坏。"

# chapter3.rpyc:470
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c1948328:

    # Merel "Roan was such an ass when we were kids. For all he claimed to like you, he sure turned on you pretty quick."
    Merel "小时候的罗安真是混蛋。口口声声说喜欢你，翻脸却比谁都快。"

# chapter3.rpyc:472
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_beecfe50:

    # Merel "I guess kids can be like that sometimes. They tend to lash out when they don’t get what they want, but he took it way too far."
    Merel "小孩子有时就是这样吧。得不到想要的，就乱发脾气，可他实在过分了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:474
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_094f4420:

    # Merel "I can’t say I liked him very much, but that’s alright. I was there for you, and I looked out for you when I could."
    Merel "反正我是不喜欢他。不过没关系，有我陪你，能护着的时候，我就护着。"

# chapter3.rpyc:476
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_03332946:

    # Merel "Roan sometimes got to you, but I was always there to scare him off, and to dry your tears."
    Merel "他有时还是能欺负到你，可我总会赶走他，替你擦眼泪。"

# chapter3.rpyc:478
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d3f8d9e5:

    # Merel "You didn’t hafta worry about a thing with me..."
    Merel "跟我在一起，你什么都不用担心……"

# chapter3.rpyc:480
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bdc184ab:

    # Merel "Or, at least, that’s what I hoped for, hehe!"
    Merel "至少，我是这么希望的，嘿嘿！"

# chapter3.rpyc:482
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_916811d9:

    # Nienke "And did Roan make me cry a lot?"
    Nienke "那他经常把我弄哭吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:484
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_68c4fc18:

    # Merel "He tried, the jerk, but I didn’t let him get away with anything. I cared about you too much for that."
    Merel "他倒是想，那个混蛋。不过我不会让他得逞。你对我那么重要。"

# chapter3.rpyc:486
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_92ec32cb:

    # Nienke "...I see."
    Nienke "……这样啊。"

# chapter3.rpyc:488
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c75783c3:

    # "I still don’t remember much of this, but I do have memories of taking shelter behind another girl’s back."
    "这些事，我还是大多想不起来。可躲在另一个女孩背后的记忆，却确实有。"

# chapter3.rpyc:489
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7a22a32e:

    # "Was that Merel?"
    "那是梅蕾尔吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:490
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_81dc32c8:

    # "I can’t imagine who else it might have been. She always was looking out for me. I wonder..."
    "想不出还能是谁。她一直都在保护我。那……"

# chapter3.rpyc:492
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f8a64a50:

    # Nienke "Then, were we very close friends?"
    Nienke "所以，我们以前是很要好的朋友？"

# chapter3.rpyc:494
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_91e23c14:

    # Merel "Of course we were..."
    Merel "当然啦……"

# chapter3.rpyc:496
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0f0960d2:

    # Merel "Or, at least, that’s how I saw it!"
    Merel "至少，我是这么觉得的！"

# chapter3.rpyc:498
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ebb0cfaa:

    # Merel "I dunno how you felt about me — maybe you just tolerated me, ’cause I was one of the only people in Mors Paravail who wasn’t on Roan’s side — but I definitely liked you."
    Merel "不知道你怎么看我。也许只是因为莫尔斯·帕拉维尔没几个人不站罗安那边，而我是其中之一，所以你才勉强容忍我。不过，我肯定喜欢你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:500
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_87e137e3:

    # Merel "You were my best friend, Nienke!"
    Merel "妮恩克，你是我最好的朋友！"

# chapter3.rpyc:502
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f108665d:

    # Nienke "Even though I was bullied a lot, and I always wound up crying?"
    Nienke "就算我经常被欺负，总是哭？"

# chapter3.rpyc:504
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d50052a5:

    # Merel "Even so! S’not like you cried for the sake of it. Roan kept goading you. He did {i}not{/i} take rejection well..."
    Merel "那也一样！你又不是没事找事才哭。是罗安一直刺激你，他{i}根本{/i}接受不了被拒绝……"

# chapter3.rpyc:506
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f4f6b2fe:

    # Merel "But part of me might’ve felt glad when he turned on you, even if that sounds awful."
    Merel "不过，有一小部分的我，也许还庆幸他跟你翻了脸。虽然这么说很差劲。"

# chapter3.rpyc:508
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7fa050c7:

    # Nienke "What were you glad about, exactly?"
    Nienke "你到底庆幸什么？"

# chapter3.rpyc:510
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f4397c31:

    # Merel "Weeeell, I was a little worried when Roan started to show an interest in you. I did wonder whether he’d be successful in winning you away."
    Merel "这——个嘛，他开始对你有意思时，我有点担心。怕他真能把你从我身边哄走。"

# chapter3.rpyc:511
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5e7152a4:

    # Merel "If he’d get into your good graces, an’ you’d no longer be interested in playing with me..."
    Merel "要是他讨了你欢心，你就不想再跟我玩了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:513
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e77dd574:

    # Nienke "But that clearly didn’t happen?"
    Nienke "但显然没有发生？"

# chapter3.rpyc:515
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e133dcd4:

    # Merel "Nope! You turned him down, an’ he got so mad he had to start acting like a louse about it."
    Merel "没有！你拒绝了他，他气得开始耍无赖。"

# chapter3.rpyc:519
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_84832620:

    # Merel "He turned against you, and he ruined any chances he might’ve had with you! I think he screwed himself over, more than anything..."
    Merel "跟你作对，把自己仅剩的那点机会也毁了！我看，最倒霉的还是他自己……"

# chapter3.rpyc:521
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a1856661:

    # Merel "But that meant I gotta have you all to myself, and I can’t pretend I didn’t enjoy that."
    Merel "不过这样一来，我就能独占你了。要说不开心，那肯定是假的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:523
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fd9cde1e:

    # Merel "I did like lookin’ out for you, though I also liked talkin’ to you, and just...{w} being with you, I guess."
    Merel "我喜欢保护你，也喜欢跟你聊天，还有……{w}待在你身边吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:525
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_75141af0:

    # Merel "I figured we’d always be together like that: best friends, you and I. It was what I wanted more’n anything else."
    Merel "我以为，我们会永远这样在一起，你和我，一直是最好的朋友。这比什么都让我向往。"

# chapter3.rpyc:527
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c59eb9a9:

    # Merel "I’ve always been pretty simple, and I figured that was enough to make me happy."
    Merel "我的想法一向简单，觉得这样就足够幸福了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:528
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cbc33bb1:

    # Merel "I liked just spendin’ time with you, Nienke. It was fun, even if I did wind up having to look out for you a lot."
    Merel "妮恩克，只要和你待着，我就很开心。哪怕总得照顾你，也一样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:530
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5766cfc0:

    # Merel "You’ve always been this scrawny little thing, hehe..."
    Merel "毕竟你一直都是瘦瘦小小的一只，嘿嘿……"

# chapter3.rpyc:533
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cd047dba:

    # Nienke "Hmph. Well, thank you for reminding me of all of my failings."
    Nienke "哼，谢谢你把我的缺点全提醒了一遍。"

# chapter3.rpyc:535
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f944ae38:

    # Merel "You’re welcome!"
    Merel "不客气！"

# chapter3.rpyc:539
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e6d31895:

    # Merel "That’s what I’m here for! I always tried to cheer you up, too, when you felt down too, though. That was my job!"
    Merel "我就是来做这个的嘛！不过，你心情不好时，我也总想办法逗你开心。这可是我的职责！"

# chapter3.rpyc:541
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b415faed:

    # Nienke "That sounds like a hassle, and friends shouldn’t regard their relationships as ‘work’. It makes it all sound so transactional."
    Nienke "听着好麻烦。朋友之间也不该把相处当成“工作”吧，弄得像交易似的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:545
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_85b91286:

    # Merel "Well, maybe it was, if you wanna be cynical about it. You turned to me for support, an’ I liked supporting you ’cause it made me feel like I was doin’ a good thing."
    Merel "嗯，你非要往那个方向想，也不是不行。你需要我的支持，我也喜欢支持你，因为觉得自己做了件好事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:547
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8b7dc7d7:

    # Merel "I liked being there for you, Nienke, no matter how you might feel about it now. It made me feel... I dunno, like I was wanted, I guess? It was nice..."
    Merel "不管你现在怎么想，妮恩克，我喜欢陪着你。那让我觉得……怎么说呢，自己是被需要的吧。感觉很好……"

# chapter3.rpyc:549
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2901951c:

    # "Here, Merel’s voice trails off. She sighs, her lips pursed, as she says..."
    "说到这里，梅蕾尔的声音低了下去。她抿着嘴叹气，接着说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:551
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_89c86483:

    # Merel "But it couldn’t stay that way forever."
    Merel "可惜，没法一直这样下去。"

# chapter3.rpyc:553
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c39e4b7d:

    # Merel "I could help you out when you were bein’ bullied, but when you got sick...?"
    Merel "被人欺负时，我还能帮忙。可你生病以后……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:555
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d8f4abc7:

    # "Merel’s eyes narrow. She clenches her hands into fists, then says..."
    "她眯起眼，把手攥成拳头。"

# chapter3.rpyc:556
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_68e6037c:

    # Merel "I couldn’t do a thing."
    Merel "我什么也做不了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:558
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6e2d78d4:

    # Nienke "Merel..."
    Nienke "梅蕾尔……"

# chapter3.rpyc:559
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b602a50b:

    # "My brow furrows, and I find myself mumbling..."
    "我皱起眉，低声问……"

# chapter3.rpyc:561
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_73b9967d:

    # Nienke "Did you really worry about me that much...?"
    Nienke "你真的那么担心我吗……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:563
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6c22c562:

    # Merel "Of course I worried about you! You almost {i}died,{/i} Nienke. You were in such an awful state, and nobody in Mors Paravail could help you!"
    Merel "当然担心！妮恩克，你差点就{i}死了{/i}！病得那么重，莫尔斯·帕拉维尔却没一个人能帮你！"

# chapter3.rpyc:565
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_27b1ac7b:

    # Merel "None of us knew what to do!"
    Merel "我们全都不知道该怎么办！"

# chapter3.rpyc:567
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e869a248:

    # Merel "The soothsayers looked over you, and they tried to help, but they had no effect at all. It was almost like your body was resistant to the idea of getting better. I was so, so scared."
    Merel "占卜师来看过，也想办法救你，可一点用都没有。你的身体好像就是不肯好起来。我真的、真的好害怕。"

# chapter3.rpyc:568
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1f627732:

    # Merel "You were in an awful state..."
    Merel "你当时的样子太糟了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:570
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5d9d1df7:

    # Merel "But I’m not sure how much about this you remember, or how much your parents told you."
    Merel "不过，不知道你还记得多少，也不知道你爸妈跟你说过多少。"

# chapter3.rpyc:571
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_31962028:

    # Merel "Can you recall any of this, Nienke?"
    Merel "妮恩克，你还想得起吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:573
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2dd9e02a:

    # Nienke "Hmm..."
    Nienke "嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:581
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bcdfee1d:

    # "I frown, racking my mind."
    "我蹙起眉，努力搜索记忆。"

# chapter3.rpyc:583
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d32da388:

    # "I remember bits and pieces of it, I suppose, but it’s pretty disjointed: a collage of hazy images pieced together in the most slapdash way."
    "也许还记得一点零碎的东西，可全都断断续续，像把模糊的画面胡乱拼在一起的拼贴画。"

# chapter3.rpyc:584
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3cff889e:

    # "I’m not sure if it’s that I can’t remember all of this fully, or whether I don’t want to. I was in a lot of pain and my head hurt, and I spent most of my time drifting."
    "不知道是记不完整，还是根本不愿记起。那时浑身疼，头也疼，大多数时候都昏昏沉沉。"

# chapter3.rpyc:586
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c6c3fba9:

    # "I was asleep half of the time, and even when I was awake, I felt so dazed and disoriented I kept drifting off; sinking into daydreams."
    "一半时间在睡觉，就算醒着，也迷糊得分不清方向，常常又飘远了，陷进白日梦里。"

# chapter3.rpyc:587
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_87ec2565:

    # "For a while, I was so feverish I didn’t recognise my own parents by my bedside."
    "有一阵子，烧得连床边的爸妈都认不出来。"

# chapter3.rpyc:589
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c5f747e0:

    # "I hardly even recognised myself. I think I might even have forgotten my own name."
    "连自己都不太认识了。我好像甚至忘记过自己的名字。"

# chapter3.rpyc:590
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8503a171:

    # "It was a long, protracted ordeal and, during that time, it feels like my mind began to fail me."
    "那是一场漫长的折磨。那段时间里，脑子似乎也渐渐不听使唤了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:592
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c0808d06:

    # "My thoughts from this time period are horribly muddled: so much so I can’t remember where the dream ends and the reality begins."
    "关于那时候的记忆，混乱得可怕。我分不清梦在哪里结束，现实又从哪里开始。"

# chapter3.rpyc:593
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9b5ebab1:

    # "If I hardly knew who I was during that time, it seems unlikely I’d remember anyone else either."
    "连自己是谁都快不知道了，又怎么能指望记住别人？"

# chapter3.rpyc:595
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_20585616:

    # Nienke "...I’m sorry, but I don’t remember much of anything."
    Nienke "……对不起，我几乎什么都不记得了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:597
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_be6ff43c:

    # Nienke "I remember that my head hurt, and I spent a lot of time in bed. I was very hot, and I ached, and I couldn’t eat much of anything — or drink much of anything, either."
    Nienke "只记得头很疼，一直躺在床上。身体烫得厉害，浑身都疼，吃不下东西，也喝不下多少水。"

# chapter3.rpyc:598
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_864f9ca5:

    # Nienke "I drifted a lot, and my thoughts were all mixed up. My dreams bled into my reality, and I didn’t recognise any of the people who came to see me."
    Nienke "总是迷迷糊糊，脑子里一团乱。梦和现实混在一起，来看我的人，我谁也认不出。"

# chapter3.rpyc:600
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c1cd5939:

    # Nienke "It was...{w} a little scary..."
    Nienke "那时候……{w}有点害怕……"

# chapter3.rpyc:611
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0fb3dddc:

    # Merel "Only a little?"
    Merel "只有一点？"

# chapter3.rpyc:613
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a33e6893:

    # Nienke "No, um... It was... more than a little scary, actually."
    Nienke "不，那个……其实，不止一点。"

# chapter3.rpyc:615
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_68ba20a0:

    # Nienke "I can try to put a brave face on it now, and maybe I can succeed. I mean, this was over a decade ago. At the time, however..."
    Nienke "现在可以装得勇敢些，也许还能装像。毕竟都十几年前了。可当时……"

# chapter3.rpyc:617
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bbc6eef3:

    # Nienke "I...{w} was just a kid..."
    Nienke "我……{w}只是个孩子……"

# chapter3.rpyc:619
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f7f74659:

    # Nienke "But, even then, I knew my condition was serious."
    Nienke "但就算那样，也知道自己病得很重。"

# chapter3.rpyc:621
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_29da0124:

    # Nienke "Even during that time, though I was so young... I think a part of me was afraid that I would really end up dying."
    Nienke "虽然年纪那么小，可心里某个地方……还是在怕，怕自己真的会死。"

# chapter3.rpyc:623
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a282f564:

    # Merel "Oh, Nienke..."
    Merel "妮恩克……"

# chapter3.rpyc:625
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c7b882ca:

    # "Merel exhales in tandem with me, her red eyes softening."
    "梅蕾尔和我一同呼出一口气，红眼睛变得柔和。"

# chapter3.rpyc:632
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aebf74c6:

    # "She reaches out, taking my hand between her own, then says..."
    "她伸手，把我的手握在双手之间，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:634
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_58bc25d5:

    # Merel "I can only imagine. I’ve never been that sick before. Hell, I hardly ever get sick in general. I’m pretty hardy, so it’s difficult for me to relate to..."
    Merel "我只能想象。我从来没病得那么重，平时甚至都很少生病。身体太结实，反而不太能体会……"

# chapter3.rpyc:636
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a7945295:

    # Merel "But it sounds like it would’ve been pretty freaking terrifying."
    Merel "可光听你说，就觉得一定吓人极了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:638
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0fbc2ff2:

    # Nienke "I’m sure it was, yes — when I was conscious enough to register what was happening to me, that is."
    Nienke "嗯，肯定很害怕。至少清醒得能知道自己遭遇了什么的时候，是这样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:642
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6a0ecaa8:

    # Nienke "Most of the time, I just slept. I guess it wasn’t so very difficult to endure, really, when I think about that."
    Nienke "大多数时候，我只是在睡觉。这样想来，好像也没那么难熬。"

# chapter3.rpyc:644
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_de6da4c8:

    # Nienke "That period of my life feels like one big, long blank — or maybe a big, long dream. I have a few memories, but..."
    Nienke "那段日子，像是一大片漫长的空白，或者一场很长很长的梦。还记得一点，可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:646
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_826ab26a:

    # Merel "Other than that, it’s all blurry?"
    Merel "除此之外，全都模模糊糊？"

# chapter3.rpyc:648
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_62db1497:

    # Nienke "...Yes, that’s right. I can’t even remember what my parents said to me at the time, much less anybody else."
    Nienke "……对。连当时爸妈跟我说了什么都记不清，更别说别人。"

# chapter3.rpyc:650
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1e04c59a:

    # Nienke "I was so sick, it felt like I was on my own. The sickness..."
    Nienke "病得那么重，感觉自己孤零零的。那场病……"

# chapter3.rpyc:652
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5b902957:

    # Nienke "It might sound strange, but I think it isolated me. It kept me trapped inside my head, which was full of pain and shadows."
    Nienke "听着也许奇怪，可它好像把我跟外面隔开了，把我困在自己的脑袋里。里面全是疼痛，还有影子。"

# chapter3.rpyc:654
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dab310f3:

    # Nienke "The shadows didn’t leave me alone, at least. They were always there. They whispered to me, and they said that I’d join them soon..."
    Nienke "至少，那些影子没离开过我。它们一直都在，跟我耳语，说我很快就会加入它们……"

# chapter3.rpyc:657
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6368431b:

    # "Here, I shudder. I move my hand away from Merel’s own (all of a sudden, it feels stifling), then wind my arms about my middle."
    "我打了个寒战，把手从梅蕾尔手里抽出来。忽然觉得握得有些闷，于是改为抱住自己。"

# chapter3.rpyc:658
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ec89289a:

    # "My fingers sink into my upper arms, my nails sharp as they bite through my clothes, and mumble..."
    "手指紧紧扣着上臂，指甲隔着衣服硌进皮肉。我低声说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:660
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a78cd410:

    # Nienke "But I didn’t want to join them. I knew, if I did that, I’d never be able to wake up again."
    Nienke "可我不想跟它们走。我知道，真去了，就再也醒不过来了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:662
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_01327fe8:

    # Nienke "I’m not sure how I knew that, since I was just a little girl, but there was this constant sense of danger."
    Nienke "那时还那么小，我也不知道自己怎么会明白。可危险的感觉，一直都在。"

# chapter3.rpyc:663
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9073c3f4:

    # Nienke "The shadows wanted to lull me into a false sense of security, so I had to fight against them. I couldn’t let them win. I had to be strong..."
    Nienke "那些影子想骗我放心，把我哄过去。我得跟它们对抗，不能让它们赢。我必须坚强……"

# chapter3.rpyc:665
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_98c15bfc:

    # Nienke "J-Just like you always told me to."
    Nienke "就、就像你总告诉我的那样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:667
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_99df840f:

    # Merel "Niene..."
    Merel "妮妮……"

# chapter3.rpyc:669
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0cb00e26:

    # "Merel’s eyes widen. She blinks, then says..."
    "梅蕾尔睁大眼睛，眨了眨，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:671
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e446d07b:

    # Merel "I did tell you to be strong, yes. I was always telling you that when the other children poked fun at you, and when you first fell ill."
    Merel "对，我确实说过，要你坚强。别的孩子取笑你时，还有你刚病倒的时候，我总这么说。"

# chapter3.rpyc:673
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e6acaf92:

    # Merel "I sat by your bedside, and I held your hand, and I told you that you could get through it."
    Merel "我坐在床边，握着你的手，告诉你，你一定撑得过去。"

# chapter3.rpyc:675
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_31139d66:

    # Merel "I told you that you would be alright. You just needed to keep fighting. Do you remember that?"
    Merel "我说，你会没事的，只要继续努力，不要放弃。这个，你记得吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:679
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d18c9ba3:

    # Nienke "I..."
    Nienke "我……"

# chapter3.rpyc:680
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_da78845f:

    # "I frown. It sounds vaguely familiar, but..."
    "我皱起眉。听着隐约熟悉，可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:682
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5e68309d:

    # Nienke "I might...{w} but everything from back then is so hazy, and it doesn’t help when I try to cast my mind back, either."
    Nienke "也许……{w}记得吧。但那时的一切都太模糊，越努力回想，也不见得有用。"

# chapter3.rpyc:684
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_61849959:

    # Nienke "Mostly, it just makes my head hurt."
    Nienke "大多只会让我头疼。"

# chapter3.rpyc:688
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2c62be15:

    # Merel "I see. I won’t labour the point, then. I don’t wanna upset you."
    Merel "明白了，那我就不追问了。我不想让你难受。"

# chapter3.rpyc:690
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c2a3700f:

    # Merel "I guess your parents didn’t tell you about everything that happened either, ’cause they were worried about you. They probably didn’t wanna unearth any bad memories..."
    Merel "你爸妈大概也是担心你，才没把一切都告诉你。不想再翻出那些难过的回忆吧……"

# chapter3.rpyc:692
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_19df1d8d:

    # Merel "But you must know you had to move from Mors Paravail, right?"
    Merel "不过，必须搬离莫尔斯·帕拉维尔的事，你知道吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:694
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e522d6e3:

    # Nienke "That’s right. My parents told me about it, when I first received your letter. They said that we’d all lived in Mors Paravail, though I don’t really remember it..."
    Nienke "知道。刚收到你的信时，爸妈说过。说我们以前全住在那里，虽然我不太记得……"

# chapter3.rpyc:696
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fbb5ab00:

    # Nienke "And they said we had to move to Alpenrose to get me treatment, when my condition worsened?"
    Nienke "后来我病情加重，为了治疗，才搬来阿尔彭罗瑟？"

# chapter3.rpyc:698
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_91374071:

    # Merel "That’s right. That’s why your parents left originally, though they said it was only a temporary arrangement."
    Merel "对。他们最初就是为这个离开的，不过当时说只是暂时。"

# chapter3.rpyc:699
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d5ff76aa:

    # Merel "They told my parents that they would return, to live among the rest of us elves once more. That was the plan..."
    Merel "还跟我爸妈说，以后会回来，重新跟大家住在一起。本来是这么打算的……"

# chapter3.rpyc:703
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e6fc4d97:

    # Merel "But they kept puttin’ it off, I suppose, because you were frail after your illness."
    Merel "可后来一直往后拖，大概因为你病过之后太虚弱了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:705
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_60959238:

    # Merel "You recovered, but your parents were worried about making you travel too far afield. They fretted over you, and I think they were afraid you might fall ill again."
    Merel "你虽然好了，他们却担心让你走太远的路。总为你操心，怕你又病倒。"

# chapter3.rpyc:707
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_647cbe98:

    # Merel "The physician said that your immune system would be weakened from your illness, and you might get sick all over again."
    Merel "医生说，这场病削弱了你的免疫力，可能还会再生病。"

# chapter3.rpyc:708
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d8d78572:

    # Merel "You had survived once, but at great cost. You were bedridden for over a month."
    Merel "你是熬过去了一次，可也付出了很大代价，在床上躺了一个多月。"

# chapter3.rpyc:709
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a463e379:

    # Merel "There was a chance it might happen again: a chance your parents didn’t want to take. They were afraid for you, I think, and about your future..."
    Merel "还有重来的可能，而你爸妈不愿冒这个险。他们担心你，也担心你的将来……"

# chapter3.rpyc:711
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4828a432:

    # Merel "So, in the end, they decided to stay right there, in Alpenrose. They made a new life for themselves — and for you, too."
    Merel "所以最后决定留在阿尔彭罗瑟。在这里重新生活，也让你重新开始。"

# chapter3.rpyc:713
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_da323112:

    # Merel "They stayed here for your sake, and they tried to get on with the locals despite being elves."
    Merel "他们是为了你留下的。身为精灵，还是努力跟当地人好好相处。"

# chapter3.rpyc:714
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_caab14e1:

    # Merel "I’m sure it was difficult for them, but they still did their best. They did it for your sake. I’m sure no sacrifice was too small for you, their beloved daughter."
    Merel "肯定不容易，可他们一直尽力去做，全是为了你。为了宝贝女儿，多小的一点付出，他们也不会嫌多余。"

# chapter3.rpyc:716
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a66806fc:

    # Merel "That’s what they said in their letters, at least."
    Merel "至少，信里是这么说的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:718
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_587211ca:

    # Nienke "Letters?"
    Nienke "信？"

# chapter3.rpyc:719
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1f83dd6f:

    # Merel "Oh, yes. You parents kept in contact with mine all of these years. They wrote to us, and they told us how you were doing; how they were getting along with their new neighbours."
    Merel "嗯。这些年，你爸妈一直跟我家保持联系。写信告诉我们你怎么样，跟新邻居相处得如何。"

# chapter3.rpyc:723
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fa20e99b:

    # Merel "They told us about opening the café, and about adopting Engelmund, and about life in Alpenrose."
    Merel "他们说过开咖啡馆，收养恩格尔蒙德，还有阿尔彭罗瑟的生活。"

# chapter3.rpyc:724
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_17875606:

    # Merel "They told us all about you, and I was so relieved when I heard you were alright."
    Merel "也说了好多你的事。听说你没事，我真的松了一大口气。"

# chapter3.rpyc:726
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_edfb39c1:

    # Merel "I’d been so, so worried, Nienke. I was afraid you really might have died. You were so sickly before you left Mors Paravail."
    Merel "妮恩克，我以前太担心了，真怕你死掉。离开莫尔斯·帕拉维尔之前，你病得那么虚弱。"

# chapter3.rpyc:728
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_32382709:

    # Merel "You lost so much of your colour, and so much of your spark."
    Merel "气色没了，精神也没了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:729
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6b76aea4:

    # Merel "You lost who you were, and I was afraid I’d never get you back."
    Merel "像连你自己都不在了。我好怕再也找不回你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:731
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5c9640f8:

    # Merel "I was sure you would die...{w} so you can imagine my relief when I heard that you were alright."
    Merel "我当时认定你会死……{w}所以，听见你好了，你能想象我有多庆幸。"

# chapter3.rpyc:733
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_639e6ce2:

    # Merel "I was so happy for you that I wept for joy. It was probably one of the best moments of my life..."
    Merel "高兴得都哭了。那大概是我这辈子最幸福的时刻之一……"

# chapter3.rpyc:734
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8366db13:

    # Merel "If we discount seein’ you again, of course. That ranks pretty highly up there too, hehe!"
    Merel "当然，再次见到你也算。这个也排得很靠前，嘿嘿！"

# chapter3.rpyc:738
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fa49b8e8:

    # "Merel laughs, but it’s without her usual brash enthusiasm. There’s something downcast about her expression; something almost haunted."
    "梅蕾尔笑了，却没有平时那股豪爽的热情。神情有些低落，甚至像还困在那场惊惧里。"

# chapter3.rpyc:740
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_88220726:

    # "Her eyes are half-lidded, and her lips are pursed."
    "她半垂着眼，嘴唇抿起。"

# chapter3.rpyc:741
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ec581354:

    # "She says that my recovery was a source of happiness for her, and I don’t doubt that, but..."
    "她说，我康复让她很幸福，我并不怀疑。可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:743
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6c7850ec:

    # Nienke "...If we were as close as you claim to be, then why did you take such a long time before you decided to see me again?"
    Nienke "……如果我们真像你说的那么亲近，为什么过了这么久，你才决定再来见我？"

# chapter3.rpyc:747
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5a97bf72:

    # Merel "That’s a good question. I was relieved, like I said, that you were alright — and believe me, I {i}did{/i} want to see you again."
    Merel "问得好。我说过，知道你没事，我很庆幸。相信我，我也{i}真的{/i}想再见你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:749
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0d67e6a9:

    # Merel "I was practically chompin’ at the bit."
    Merel "简直迫不及待。"

# chapter3.rpyc:751
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cc506a56:

    # Merel "The moment I heard you’d recovered, I asked my parents to write to your parents if I could visit you, so I could see you were alright with my own two eyes."
    Merel "一听说你康复，我就求爸妈写信问问，能不能让我来探望。我想亲眼确认你没事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:753
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_22f64760:

    # Merel "It was what I wanted more than anything in the world, but..."
    Merel "那时候，这就是我最想做的事。可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:755
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_21b54d5f:

    # Nienke "Despite that, you still didn’t come to visit me."
    Nienke "可你还是没来。"

# chapter3.rpyc:757
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_18c417fa:

    # Merel "I {i}couldn’t{/i} come to visit you. Your parents had a few...{w} reservations."
    Merel "是{i}不能{/i}来。你爸妈有一些……{w}顾虑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:759
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5d13ed9e:

    # Nienke "Reservations?"
    Nienke "顾虑？"

# chapter3.rpyc:763
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_71a7f0c2:

    # Merel "Mm. First, they said you were too weak, and they wanted to give you a while to recover properly, which was fair enough."
    Merel "嗯。起初说你太虚弱，想让你好好恢复一阵子，这也合理。"

# chapter3.rpyc:765
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6fa96e1a:

    # Merel "I figured you wouldn’t really be up to hangin’ around with me anyway, after recovering from an illness like that, so I was prepared to give you some space."
    Merel "刚从那么重的病里好起来，大概也没力气跟我玩，所以我愿意给你一点时间。"

# chapter3.rpyc:766
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_39e6f843:

    # Merel "I was prepared to wait."
    Merel "我愿意等。"

# chapter3.rpyc:768
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_89b661d4:

    # Merel "I figured you’d recover soon enough, and then we’d be able to see one another again, like we did before."
    Merel "想着你很快就会恢复，到时候，我们就能像以前那样见面了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:770
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ba65bff9:

    # Merel "I gave it a month, then two months, then three..."
    Merel "我等了一个月，两个月，三个月……"

# chapter3.rpyc:772
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_800a72cd:

    # Merel "But your parents still didn’t invite me over. They gave updates about how you were doing, and it seemed like you’d gotten better, but they never asked if I’d like to see you."
    Merel "可你爸妈还是没邀请我。他们会说起你的近况，听着已经好转，却从没问过我，想不想来看看你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:773
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_76ed92f3:

    # Merel "They hardly asked after me at all."
    Merel "甚至很少问起我的事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:774
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b418a798:

    # Merel "I thought that was weird, since your parents knew how close I was to you, so I asked again."
    Merel "我觉得很奇怪，他们明明知道我们有多好，所以又问了一次。"

# chapter3.rpyc:776
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_14f41f1b:

    # Merel "I wanted to know if you’d gotten better enough for me to see you, and do you know what your parents said?"
    Merel "我想知道，你是不是恢复得足够好了，可以见我了。你知道他们怎么说的吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:778
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9feddbea:

    # "I think I have a vague idea about what they might have said. It’s all caught up in my memories, or lack of memories."
    "我隐约猜得到答案。这一切都和我的记忆有关，或者说，和我失去的记忆有关。"

# chapter3.rpyc:780
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2bf7b06a:

    # "Merel never stopped thinking about me, even though I moved away from Mors Paravail."
    "即使我离开莫尔斯·帕拉维尔，梅蕾尔也从没停止想念我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:781
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5ac9ebdf:

    # "She hoped for my recovery every single day, and she read all of the letters my parents wrote to her family with wide-eyed eagerness, just like I have with Cornelia."
    "她每天都盼我康复，满怀期待地读着爸妈寄给她家的每一封信，就像我读科妮莉娅的信一样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:783
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8a33575a:

    # "She was desperate to hear from me; more anxious about me than anybody else."
    "她迫切想知道我的消息，比谁都牵挂。"

# chapter3.rpyc:784
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2c8b7ba8:

    # "She cared about me deeply and desperately, but despite that..."
    "她那么深、那么急切地在乎着我，可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:786
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_64316b19:

    # Nienke "...I presume they dissuaded you from coming here?"
    Nienke "……他们劝你别来，是吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:788
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_943641a4:

    # Merel "That’s right. Your parents told me that the fever had muddled your brain, and you hardly remembered any of your time in Mors Paravail. You couldn’t remember your old life or your old friends."
    Merel "对。你爸妈说，高烧烧乱了你的记忆，在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔的事几乎全忘了。不记得以前的生活，也不记得以前的朋友。"

# chapter3.rpyc:790
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_80f05fdd:

    # Merel "You’d forgotten about me..."
    Merel "你把我忘了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:792
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b28c19d6:

    # Merel "And your physician advised your parents not to meet with me — or anybody else from your past either."
    Merel "医生又建议他们，别让你见我，也别见其他过去认识的人。"

# chapter3.rpyc:793
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_26720b15:

    # Merel "They said your fever was so traumatic you’d probably forgotten a bunch of the past on purpose, ’cause dwellin’ on it would be too painful."
    Merel "说那场高烧给你留下的创伤太深，回想起来太痛苦，所以大脑可能主动忘掉了很多往事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:795
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_148b05ba:

    # Merel "It was a form of self-defence: one your brain was usin’ so you wouldn’t get overwhelmed by how close you’d come to dying."
    Merel "那是一种自我保护，免得你承受不住自己差点死去的恐惧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:797
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_72a6b9d3:

    # Merel "You’d forgotten everything, an’ the physician feared you’d wind up in an even worse state if I suddenly showed up at your side."
    Merel "你已经全忘了。医生怕我突然出现在身边，会让你变得更糟。"

# chapter3.rpyc:799
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_687c8f6e:

    # Merel "The time wore on, and your parents said maybe I could come’n visit once you’d settled down in Alpenrose, but I couldn’t go through with it."
    Merel "后来时间久了，你爸妈说，也许等你在阿尔彭罗瑟安顿好，我就能来。可我又不敢了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:800
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5e7e9da4:

    # Merel "I told myself I didn’t wanna see you again, if you still had no idea who I was. The thought was...{w} too painful..."
    Merel "我告诉自己，如果你还是不知道我是谁，那就不要再见了。光是想到……{w}就太难受了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:801
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f61e843c:

    # "Merel confesses, after a long pause, her shoulders trembling."
    "长久的停顿后，她终于说出口，肩膀微微颤抖。"

# chapter3.rpyc:803
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b38261fb:

    # "She sniffs (she isn’t going to cry, is she?), then says..."
    "她吸了吸鼻子——不会要哭吧？——接着说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:804
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1ea1f9c7:

    # Merel "Geez. Just listen to me. I must sound so selfish."
    Merel "真是的，听听我在说什么。我一定听着特别自私。"

# chapter3.rpyc:806
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6d0d3718:

    # Nienke "Why do you say that? I don’t think there’s anything selfish in worrying about your friend..."
    Nienke "为什么这么说？担心朋友，哪里自私了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:810
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d8b28562:

    # Merel "But I {i}am{/i} selfish, Nienke! I know I’m labouring the point a bit, but you almost died! You were really, seriously sick!"
    Merel "可我{i}就是{/i}自私，妮恩克！虽然一遍遍说这些，可你当时差点死了啊！是真的病得非常、非常重！"

# chapter3.rpyc:814
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_47d54394:

    # Merel "You’re the one who suffered the most from all of this: you and your parents. I can’t even imagine how worried they must’ve been."
    Merel "这件事里，受苦最多的是你，还有你爸妈。我都想象不出他们有多担心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:816
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_77fd0bfc:

    # Merel "I bet they were scared sick themselves, since you’re their daughter. They must’ve been beside themselves with worry..."
    Merel "你是他们的女儿，他们自己肯定也快吓病了，急得不知道怎么办……"

# chapter3.rpyc:818
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a0e04f9d:

    # Merel "Yet here I am, acting like I’m the victim, ’cause I wasn’t allowed to visit you. I felt like my whole world was comin’ to an end when we were parted, but your world nearly did end!"
    Merel "我却在这里，因为不被允许来见你，就把自己说得像受害者。分开时，我觉得天塌了，可你的世界是真的差点结束啊！"

# chapter3.rpyc:819
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_345d5c8e:

    # Merel "I shouldn’t’ve taken it so personal, and I shouldn’t be actin’ like I’m the one who suffered."
    Merel "我不该那么往心里去，也不该摆出一副最受苦的人的样子。"

# chapter3.rpyc:821
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_153f1265:

    # Merel "I missed you a lot, yeah, but I don’t have a right to act like this. I’m not bein’ fair. I shouldn’t be actin’ so self-pitying."
    Merel "是，我很想你，可我没资格这样。这不公平，我不该自怜自艾。"

# chapter3.rpyc:823
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cf48f8cf:

    # Merel "I should be happy that you recovered, but I still felt so awful that I couldn’t see you. I guess I couldn’t help it. I just missed you so much!"
    Merel "你康复了，我明明应该高兴。可见不到你，我还是难受得不行。就是控制不住，因为实在太想你了！"

# chapter3.rpyc:828
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c3af4807:

    # Nienke "Oh..."
    Nienke "啊……"

# chapter3.rpyc:836
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d0f5613c:

    # "I gasp, my eyes widening. I stare at Merel mutely, unsure of what to say."
    "我轻轻吸了口气，睁大眼睛，默默望着她，不知道该说什么。"

# chapter3.rpyc:837
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bc4df533:

    # "I had no idea that anybody from Mors Paravail missed me, maybe because I don’t remember anybody from Mors Paravail."
    "原来莫尔斯·帕拉维尔还有人在想我，我从来不知道。也许因为，那里的人我已经谁都不记得了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:842
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_21cb7e6b:

    # "I don’t know if I ever missed Merel myself. I don’t think I had a chance to miss her: not when she remained such a vague, cloudy figure in my mind’s eye."
    "不知道自己有没有想念过梅蕾尔。她在我脑海里只是模糊的一道影子，我大概连想念的机会都没有。"

# chapter3.rpyc:843
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ecffc16a:

    # "I couldn’t recall the first thing about her: not her name, nor her face..."
    "关于她，什么都记不起来。名字也好，脸也好……"

# chapter3.rpyc:845
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_048e36fa:

    # "But, though I forgot Merel, she remembered me."
    "可我忘记了她，她却记着我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:846
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_801c5d9f:

    # "She kept me close to her heart all this time, though it’s been over a decade since we last saw one another."
    "十几年没见，这些年，她一直把我放在心上。"

# chapter3.rpyc:848
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3e8660e7:

    # "She was thinking of me, though I wasn’t thinking about her..."
    "我没有想过她的时候，她也在想着我……"

# chapter3.rpyc:849
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9e430d19:

    # "And something about this knowledge fills my heart with a comforting warmth that makes my face flush."
    "得知这一点，一股温暖填满心口，舒服得让我脸颊发热。"

# chapter3.rpyc:851
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fd3fe9d5:

    # "Though I couldn’t remember Merel, I think part of me did miss her."
    "虽然不记得梅蕾尔，可心里某个地方，也许确实想念着她。"

# chapter3.rpyc:853
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_44cf08f9:

    # "I still remembered her, even if it was in bits and pieces."
    "毕竟，我还记得一点，哪怕只是碎片。"

# chapter3.rpyc:854
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e98c5765:

    # "I remembered somebody defending me, at least, even if I didn’t remember my saviour’s name or what they looked like."
    "至少记得，有个人保护过我。就算忘了名字，也忘了长相。"

# chapter3.rpyc:855
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b7fe2205:

    # "I remembered Merel coming to my defence during those years when we lived in Mors Paravail together, though only vaguely."
    "在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔一起生活的那些年，她站出来维护我的事，我还是隐约记着。"

# chapter3.rpyc:857
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_42f32bd7:

    # "I saw it all through a filter, as if I was staring at the bottom of a pool: watching the finer details undulate."
    "像隔着一层东西望向水底，细节都在水波里摇晃。"

# chapter3.rpyc:858
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cfef28ce:

    # "I could still recall, however vaguely, that Merel cared for me..."
    "可不管多模糊，我还是记得，她在乎我……"

# chapter3.rpyc:860
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1ad35aa6:

    # "And I think I missed her too."
    "我想，我也想念她。"

# chapter3.rpyc:862
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bc689c0d:

    # "I must have, else she wouldn’t have remained in my brain: only half-remembered, yes, but present nonetheless."
    "一定是的。不然，她怎么还会留在脑海里？记得不完整，可终究还在。"

# chapter3.rpyc:863
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_62be5dfa:

    # "All of this time, while I’ve been living in Alpenrose, I felt like something was missing."
    "在阿尔彭罗瑟生活的这些年，我一直觉得少了什么。"

# chapter3.rpyc:865
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9ab992e5:

    # "I didn’t know what I was searching for, but I had the feeling that I’d left something important behind."
    "不知道自己在找什么，却总觉得，把一件重要的东西遗落在了身后。"

# chapter3.rpyc:867
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_29092660:

    # "This feeling nagged at me: a curious sense of yearning which made my heart ache. I didn’t know why my heart ached, or what it wanted, but..."
    "那种感觉一直萦绕不去，像说不清的渴望，让心隐隐发疼。我不知道为什么疼，也不知道它想要什么。可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:878
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_63c3cd18:

    # Merel "It’s been years, but you’re still the same Nienke that I remembered."
    Merel "这么多年过去，你还是我记得的妮恩克。"

# chapter3.rpyc:880
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_80961b68:

    # Merel "You haven’t changed much at all. I still wanna protect you, but maybe that’s annoying?"
    Merel "没怎么变。我还是想保护你，不过，这样是不是很烦？"

# chapter3.rpyc:884
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_739a800b:

    # Merel "I know you’re not a little kid anymore, and I don’t wanna talk down to you. If you want some more distance, I can give it to you..."
    Merel "我知道你已经不是小孩子，也不想把你看低。你要是想多留一点距离，我可以退开……"

# chapter3.rpyc:886
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_da94c9a2:

    # Merel "But I just wanted you to know how happy I am I was able to find you again."
    Merel "只是想让你知道，能再次找到你，我有多高兴。"

# chapter3.rpyc:888
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f36556ab:

    # Merel "I...{w} was always thinking about you, y’know, and wondering how you were getting on. I fretted, ’cause you were such a small, shy little thing."
    Merel "我……{w}一直都想着你，想知道你过得怎么样。你从前那么小，那么怕生，我总放心不下。"

# chapter3.rpyc:890
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1dc77f8a:

    # Merel "I was afraid you wouldn’t be able to get by on your own..."
    Merel "怕你一个人应付不来……"

# chapter3.rpyc:892
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6dfd3e84:

    # Merel "So I’m glad to see you’ve been doing alright. It’s been a huge relief, even if you have been kind of mean to me."
    Merel "所以看见你过得不错，我很开心，真的松了口气。虽然你对我是有点凶。"

# chapter3.rpyc:894
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e9551e55:

    # Merel "In fact, I take back what I said!"
    Merel "不对，刚才的话我要收回！"

# chapter3.rpyc:897
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5584675c:

    # "Merel smiles at me, then pokes me in the cheek."
    "她冲我笑笑，戳了戳我的脸。"

# chapter3.rpyc:898
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0095b366:

    # Merel "You {i}have{/i} changed since you were a kid! You never used to be so snippy..."
    Merel "跟小时候比，你{i}还是{/i}变了！以前可没这么爱呛人……"

# chapter3.rpyc:900
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4d2f7244:

    # Merel "But maybe I deserve it, since I’ve gotten more annoying! I know I’ve been forceful — maybe a bit too forceful, actually..."
    Merel "不过，也许是我活该，谁让我变得更烦人了呢！我知道自己太主动，可能确实过了头……"

# chapter3.rpyc:902
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c7994345:

    # Merel "But that doesn’t change the way I feel about you. I really do like you {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Merel "可这不会改变我对你的心意。我真的很喜欢你{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# chapter3.rpyc:904
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c3af4807_1:

    # Nienke "Oh..."
    Nienke "啊……"

# chapter3.rpyc:906
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_26c2a52d:

    # "Once again, my heart flutters."
    "心又轻轻一颤。"

# chapter3.rpyc:908
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d0994120:

    # "I look at Merel, who looks back at me. Her red eyes are half-lidded, lined with a long sweep of fair lashes."
    "我看着梅蕾尔，她也看着我。红色的眼睛半垂着，长长的浅色睫毛围出柔软的弧线。"

# chapter3.rpyc:910
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_97eaf28d:

    # "Her lips curve upwards into a soft smile as she leans in. Her hands find my own, her fingers squeezing about mine."
    "她唇边漾起温柔的笑，靠近过来。双手找到我的手，手指轻轻收拢。"

# chapter3.rpyc:911
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c0b60c5f:

    # "Her eyes look very soft and gentle as she says..."
    "她眼神柔软，轻声问……"

# chapter3.rpyc:913
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6f382a06:

    # Merel "How about you? I hope my company’s not been too unbearably annoying, hehe."
    Merel "你呢？希望跟我待着，还没烦到受不了的地步，嘿嘿。"

# chapter3.rpyc:915
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1d1edc3c:

    # Nienke "Well, um..."
    Nienke "这个，嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:917
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_88b096ad:

    # "I swallow, abashed, my saliva thick inside my throat. I feel like I’ve been put on the spot, and I’m not immediately sure what to do."
    "我窘迫地咽了咽口水，喉咙发紧。像忽然被推到台前，一时不知道该怎么办。"

# chapter3.rpyc:918
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d625aca6:

    # "I’m afraid anything sincere I might say would be too sentimental..."
    "怕真心话一出口，就会显得太肉麻……"

# chapter3.rpyc:920
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_873f0ce4:

    # "But is there really anything wrong with being earnest?"
    "可坦诚一点，又有什么不好？"

# chapter3.rpyc:921
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d8ec69c1:

    # "I feel like I owe her my honesty, so..."
    "我觉得，至少该对她诚实。所以……"

# chapter3.rpyc:923
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cbaf2223:

    # Nienke "...Well. I did find you a little annoying in the beginning, when you first came here."
    Nienke "……嗯。刚来的时候，我确实觉得你有点烦。"

# chapter3.rpyc:927
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d52fef9c:

    # Nienke "I didn’t expect you to arrive here so suddenly, or that you’d want to share my bed. You invaded my personal space, and I can’t say I liked that..."
    Nienke "没想到你会来得这么突然，也没想到你非要跟我睡一张床。你闯进我的私人空间，我不喜欢这样……"

# chapter3.rpyc:929
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fb97a105:

    # Nienke "But I suppose I’ve become used to you."
    Nienke "不过，现在好像已经习惯你了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:930
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_74a07062:

    # Merel "What, like you can get used to a bad cold?"
    Merel "就像重感冒拖久了，也能习惯？"

# chapter3.rpyc:932
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_13461362:

    # Nienke "No, um, not quite like that. I thought that’s how it would be in the beginning, but I’m starting to think I was being a bit too hard on you."
    Nienke "不，嗯，不是那个意思。一开始是那么想的，可现在觉得，我对你大概太苛刻了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:934
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_08eaa195:

    # Nienke "You really aren’t that bad, and I know you mean well, so..."
    Nienke "你其实没那么糟，我也知道，你是好心。所以……"

# chapter3.rpyc:936
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_79818914:

    # Nienke "I suppose I like you too...{w} J-Just a little bit."
    Nienke "我想，我也有点喜欢你……{w}只、只有一点点。"

# chapter3.rpyc:938
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8c20b779:

    # Merel "Just a little bit, eh?"
    Merel "只有一点点，是吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:939
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_26281ff9:

    # "Merel echoes, her tone gentle and her smile sweet. She squeezes my hand with her own, then says..."
    "她温柔地重复，笑得很甜。又握了握我的手，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:942
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_857c966e:

    # Merel "Well, I’ll take it. For a while, I was worried that you seriously disliked me, which would be a tragedy!"
    Merel "好，那我就收下这点啦。有一阵子，真怕你讨厌我。那可就太惨了！"

# chapter3.rpyc:944
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9e099ed8:

    # Nienke "It would...?"
    Nienke "太惨……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:946
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d25c5506:

    # Merel "Of course. I was looking forward to seeing you again; especially since it’s been such a long while. I wanted to see how you’ve been."
    Merel "当然。这么久没见，我一直盼着重逢，想亲眼看看你过得好不好。"

# chapter3.rpyc:950
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_84deaf7f:

    # Merel "I know I ain’t gonna be everybody’s cup of tea. I can be a little too pushy, and maybe I don’t always think about the things I say."
    Merel "我知道，不是所有人都受得了我。有时太强势，说话也不总是过脑子。"

# chapter3.rpyc:952
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_98905225:

    # Merel "You didn’t seem to mind that when we were kids, but that was ages ago. You looked up to me, an’ I think you wanted me to protect you."
    Merel "小时候你不介意，可那已经是很久以前的事了。那时你仰慕我，我想，也希望我保护你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:953
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c17a73ec:

    # Merel "You didn’t mind that I could be kinda loud and bossy, so long as I kept the others away..."
    Merel "只要能把别人赶开，你就不在意我有点吵、又爱指使人……"

# chapter3.rpyc:955
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_16206932:

    # Merel "But a lot can change since then."
    Merel "可这么多年，很多事都可能变。"

# chapter3.rpyc:957
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_43565019:

    # Merel "I wasn’t sure if I mattered all that much to you, even: not like you matter to me. I was... pretty worried things’d go badly, even though I’d been lookin’ forward to this."
    Merel "我甚至不确定，自己对你还有多重要，会不会像你对我一样。虽然期待了很久，可我……真的很怕搞砸。"

# chapter3.rpyc:959
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1e90e9e9:

    # Merel "It weighed on me. I mean..."
    Merel "一直放不下这件事。因为……"

# chapter3.rpyc:961
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e6756b74:

    # Merel "I liked you a lot back then, Niene..."
    Merel "妮妮，从前我就很喜欢你……"

# chapter3.rpyc:963
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2ed89ba4:

    # Merel "And, after all this time, I still do."
    Merel "过了这么久，现在还是。"

# chapter3.rpyc:965
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c3af4807_2:

    # Nienke "Oh..."
    Nienke "啊……"

# chapter3.rpyc:969
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d06fe141:

    # "My lips part at this, my face flushed. I already felt abashed after Merel’s kind words, but now I feel even more so."
    "我微微张开嘴，脸颊发烫。刚才那些体贴的话已经让我不好意思，现在更甚。"

# chapter3.rpyc:971
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_71b6542f:

    # "My face is so red it’s practically pulsating; my eyes half-lidded."
    "整张脸红得仿佛都在跳，眼睛半垂着。"

# chapter3.rpyc:972
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5bba9a92:

    # "I swallow, and when I do, my saliva seems to catch in my throat."
    "我咽了咽，口水却像卡在喉咙里。"

# chapter3.rpyc:974
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5772e30d:

    # "I’m not sure what to do, not that this is anything new. I hardly ever seem to know what I should do with her, but maybe that doesn’t matter too much."
    "不知道该怎么办。不过，这也不新鲜了。面对她，我好像总是不知所措。可也许，没那么要紧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:975
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9e42d320:

    # "Maybe it’s alright."
    "也许这样就好。"

# chapter3.rpyc:981
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5d1b3a72:

    # "Merel seems to know what to do, at least, even if I don’t — and, as she leans in, I find myself sighing from her close proximity."
    "至少，就算我不知道，她似乎知道。她靠过来，我被这份贴近惹得轻轻叹息。"

# chapter3.rpyc:983
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_62fd9eb4:

    # "I feel her breath against my cheeks, soft and warm."
    "她的呼吸拂在我脸颊上，柔软，温暖。"

# chapter3.rpyc:995
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1624d667:

    # "Then, I feel a gentle sensation against my lips."
    "接着，唇上传来轻轻的触感。"

# chapter3.rpyc:996
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cb344e38:

    # "She’s kissing me."
    "她在吻我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:997
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_67a1cb24:

    # "This... is my first ever kiss."
    "这……是我的初吻。"

# chapter3.rpyc:998
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_20f145fc:

    # "I’ve fantasised about it before, curled up in my bed reading books, but I’m not sure if this is how I anticipated it."
    "从前蜷在床上看书时，也幻想过，可不知道自己期待的是不是这样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:999
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0978a2b6:

    # "I didn’t imagine that I would experience my first kiss with my erstwhile childhood friend: a dark elf who I had already forgotten."
    "没想过初吻会给曾经的儿时玩伴，一个早已被我遗忘的暗精灵。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1000
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_caca750b:

    # "Merel had long since faded from my memories..."
    "梅蕾尔的模样，早就在记忆里淡去了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1001
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b0d16ce1:

    # "But, despite the gulf of years and my bout of fever which parted us, part of her always remained with me."
    "可尽管隔着漫长岁月，隔着那场让我们分离的高烧，她还是有一部分始终陪着我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1002
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_33a7ce10:

    # "She stayed with me like a burr, even when I thought she had faded from my memory. Stubbornly, snagged at the corner of my mind, refusing to let go..."
    "就像一颗带刺的小种子，哪怕我以为早已忘记，她仍固执地挂在记忆角落，不肯松开……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1003
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ea56d400:

    # "And, as her lips press against my own, I can’t help but sigh against them."
    "她的唇贴上我的唇，我忍不住在吻里轻轻叹息。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1004
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_25f101da:

    # "When I’m with Merel, I feel like I don’t need to worry how she might perceive me."
    "和梅蕾尔在一起，好像不用担心她会怎么看我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1005
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f8b98358:

    # "Merel isn’t like the boys from my primary school, and she isn’t like the girls from the lyceum."
    "她不像小学时的男生，也不像中学里的那些女生。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1006
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_633a9eed:

    # "She isn’t the sort of girl to snicker and sneer, or who’ll look down on me for being inferior."
    "她不会偷偷讥笑，不会冷嘲热讽，也不会因为觉得我不如她，就看不起我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1007
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ba24bbc8:

    # "When I’m with Merel, I know I have no need to worry about mind games. I don’t need to fear that she might tire of me on a whim, or that she’ll drop me at a moment’s notice."
    "和她在一起，我知道不用猜来猜去。不用怕她哪天忽然厌倦，也不用怕她说丢下我就丢下。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1008
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_12316eed:

    # "I don’t feel uncomfortable, therefore, as I let Merel kiss me."
    "所以，任她吻着，我没有觉得不自在。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1009
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dcf925ad:

    # "This isn’t what I imagined from my first ever kiss: a shy, almost awkward thing carried out beneath the starlight..."
    "初吻是在星光下，羞涩，甚至有点笨拙。这和我幻想过的不一样……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1010
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9db8b5f5:

    # "But, at the same time, I can’t conceive of anything better."
    "可同时，也想不出比这更好的了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1027
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e3fa6016:

    # Merel "Hmm, hmm, hmm {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♪{/font}"
    Merel "哼，哼，哼{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♪{/font}"

# chapter3.rpyc:1029
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_01985b35:

    # "Merel hums to herself as we wander along beneath the starlit sky, her hand in my own."
    "星空下，我们牵着手慢慢走，梅蕾尔轻轻哼着歌。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1031
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3baec815:

    # "My own palm feels alarmingly sweaty, though it’s not such a warm night. In fact, it’s a little chilly: the breeze cool as it disturbs my hair; the hem of my dress."
    "今晚明明不热，我手心却出汗得厉害。其实还有点凉，冷风拂动发梢，也拂动裙摆。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1032
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_786822d0:

    # "My palm shouldn’t be this unpleasantly damp. I’m horribly self-aware of it: conscious that I must feel distinctly sticky to the touch."
    "手心不该这么湿的。我在意得不得了，觉得摸上去肯定黏糊糊的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1034
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_30d992a7:

    # "I’m anxious, with every moment that passes, that Merel will notice my current predicament — or, worse still, that she’ll point it out."
    "每过一秒，都怕梅蕾尔发现。更怕她直接说出来。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1035
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5f87c6c7:

    # "I can’t stand the thought of her giggling at me: not after that kiss we shared..."
    "刚刚才接过吻，我可受不了被她拿这个取笑……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1037
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e3fa6016_1:

    # Merel "Hmm, hmm, hmm {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♪{/font}"
    Merel "哼，哼，哼{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♪{/font}"

# chapter3.rpyc:1038
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c3ecabfa:

    # "But Merel doesn’t seem to have noticed. She’s still humming to herself, walking along by the fields of corn with a definite spring to her step."
    "可她似乎没注意，仍旧哼着歌，沿着谷田走，步子里带着藏不住的轻快。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1040
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_16c3c7b0:

    # "Her choppy hair flutters in the breeze about her face, and her hand squeezes my own reassuringly."
    "参差的发梢在风里拂着脸，她握了握我的手，让人安心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1041
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fdcbad88:

    # "She looks up at the night sky, tipping her head back in a manner I’m sure is reminiscent of her father (everything I know about Bastian Asphodel is related to the stars), as she says..."
    "她仰起头看星空，那个动作一定很像她爸爸。毕竟我对巴斯蒂安·阿斯福德尔的全部了解，都跟星星有关。她开口道……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1043
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_72e4371a:

    # Merel "Well, well. Wouldja look at that!"
    Merel "哎呀，快看！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1053
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f3d35f18:

    # Nienke "A-At what...?"
    Nienke "看、看什么……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1055
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7f8a5fc1:

    # Merel "At the stars, silly! I didn’t notice then before, since I was a little... Hehe, distracted..."
    Merel "星星呀，小傻瓜！刚才没注意，因为有点……嘿嘿，分心……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1057
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9376b01a:

    # "She can say that again."
    "这话可真没错。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1059
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7140c563:

    # Merel "But they’re so bright, it’s kinda like they’re putting on a show for us."
    Merel "不过，它们这么亮，简直像特意给我们表演一样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1061
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5812f932:

    # Merel "It feels like they’re celebrating. What do you think, Nienke? Don’t you think they’re pretty?"
    Merel "像是在庆祝呢。妮恩克，你觉得呢？不漂亮吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1063
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d3befc88:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, um... I, um... suppose they’re not bad...?"
    Nienke "啊，嗯……我，呃……觉得还不错吧……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1065
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9dc0bff3:

    # Merel "You don’t sound very enthused!"
    Merel "听着没什么热情嘛！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1067
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1c528b74:

    # "Well, she’s not wrong about that."
    "她说得倒也没错。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1071
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cc81498b:

    # "I’m rather fond of the stars, but they’re the furthest thing from my mind right now."
    "我很喜欢星星，可现在，最没心思看的就是星星。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1073
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_15220e8c:

    # "I’m caught up in the soft, understated moment I shared with Merel; the sensation of her lips on my own."
    "脑海里全是刚才那安静、柔软的一刻，全是她嘴唇的触感。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1074
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_03301ceb:

    # "It’s hard for me to think of anything else."
    "根本很难想别的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1076
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c9987d96:

    # "Can’t Merel understand that? Can’t she feel the same tightness in her chest that I can and the same fluttering in the pit of her stomach?"
    "她不明白吗？难道没有和我一样胸口发紧，一样心慌意乱？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1078
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_937c4856:

    # "I’m starting to worry that I’m the only one who’s feeling this out of sorts here, when..."
    "我正开始担心，难道只有自己这么不知所措，就听见……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1080
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_acac6d04:

    # Merel "Well, I guess I can’t blame you."
    Merel "嗯，也不能怪你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1082
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d5f769fa:

    # Merel "What we did was more interesting than looking up at the stars, hehe..."
    Merel "刚才做的事，确实比看星星有意思多了，嘿嘿……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1084
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_607702c7:

    # Merel "But don’t let my father hear that I said that! He’d be so hurt!"
    Merel "不过，可别让我爸听见这句话！他会伤心死的！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1087
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_279b3254:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, um..."
    Nienke "啊，那个……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1089
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_75b6eb5c:

    # "I look at Merel, my eyes wide; a little glassy. I blink, and then..."
    "我睁大眼睛望她，眼里还有点水光。眨了眨眼，才说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1091
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bbdbb916:

    # Nienke "I’ll, um, keep that in mind, if I do happen to see your father. Isn’t he still in Mors Paravail, though?"
    Nienke "嗯，要是见到你爸爸，我会记着的。不过，他不是还在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1093
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_756a6afe:

    # Merel "That’s right. My father’s not all that old, but he’s such a bore. He’s so set in his ways!"
    Merel "对呀。我爸还没多老，就无聊得不得了，死守着那点习惯！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1095
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dcaa326c:

    # Merel "He has absolutely no interest in leaving Mors Paravail. He always says that Mors Paravail is where he settled, and he doesn’t want to leave. He’s so unadventurous!"
    Merel "一点都不想离开。总说莫尔斯·帕拉维尔是他安家的地方，不愿意走，完全没有冒险精神！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1097
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_257f6a3c:

    # Nienke "W-Well, um... I don’t think that’s a bad quality to have? I think a lot of people value the past..."
    Nienke "这、这个……我觉得也不算缺点吧？很多人都很念旧……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1099
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ae224cf1:

    # Merel "Well, you’re not wrong. I might be similar myself. I’ve been livin’ in the past for a while, too..."
    Merel "嗯，这你倒没说错。我可能也一样，这些年也一直活在过去呢……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1101
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3d3b8e0f:

    # Merel "But my father really is a stick-in-the-mud. He’s so stuck in his ways, I doubt he’d come to Alpenrose any time soon — if at all!"
    Merel "不过，我爸真是个老古板。固执成那样，短时间内肯定不会来阿尔彭罗瑟，搞不好这辈子都不会！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1103
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f7d2ac43:

    # Merel "I don’t think the goddess herself could convince him to leave Mors Paravail! He’s such a baby!"
    Merel "女神亲自来劝，他都不肯离开莫尔斯·帕拉维尔吧！真是个老小孩！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1105
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7aec6dfc:

    # Nienke "Hehe..."
    Nienke "呵呵……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1107
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cf50e171:

    # "I find myself giggling lightly, amused by Merel’s cutting words."
    "她这几句刻薄话，把我逗得轻轻笑了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1109
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_eb6ab6e6:

    # "Her remarks have helped lessen the tension somewhat, but I’m still self-conscious about how damp my palm is."
    "气氛缓和了一点，可手心的潮湿还是让我很在意。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1110
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c74ff2b6:

    # "I can feel an uneasy knot in the pit of my stomach, but I try to ignore it by positing a question to Merel."
    "腹中仍有一团不安。我试着不去想，转而问她。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1112
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_62149cb2:

    # Nienke "So, does that mean it’s unlikely I’ll see him?"
    Nienke "所以，我大概没机会见到他？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1114
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b6ac4ef5:

    # Merel "I guess so, yeah — if you stay in Alpenrose, that is."
    Merel "应该是吧，前提是你一直待在阿尔彭罗瑟。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1116
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4e4cc634:

    # Nienke "Then, are you suggesting that I move...?"
    Nienke "那你是想让我搬走……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1118
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a7da3843:

    # Merel "Move?"
    Merel "搬走？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1120
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_03bf9b41:

    # "Merel blinks. There’s a pause, and then..."
    "她眨了眨眼，愣了一下，接着说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1122
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2fc7686b:

    # Merel "Oh, no! I think that’d be a bit drastic."
    Merel "啊，不是！那也太突然了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1124
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4d669e85:

    # Merel "You might’ve been born in Mors Paravail, just like me, but you’ve been livin’ in Alpenrose ever since you were five! This place is your home now, for all intents and purposes."
    Merel "你是跟我一样出生在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔，可从五岁起就一直住在这里了。怎么说，阿尔彭罗瑟现在才是你的家。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1126
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fefc583d:

    # Merel "It’s what you’re familiar with, an’ it’s where all your friends are! I’d never ask you to just leave!"
    Merel "这里的一切你都熟悉，朋友也都在这里！我可不会让你说走就走！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1127
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_99fa5116:

    # Merel "I can be pretty selfish sometimes, but that’d be too much even for me!"
    Merel "我有时是挺自私，可也没到那个份上呀！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1135
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ffc7d318:

    # "Hmm. It’s nice of Merel to assume that I have any friends in Alpenrose I could leave behind, and who might miss me."
    "嗯。她居然觉得，阿尔彭罗瑟还有什么朋友值得我舍不得，也会在我走后想念我。真体贴。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1136
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fb9bb8d1:

    # "The only friend I really have is Cornelia, and she isn’t in Alpenrose anymore herself. She already left this place."
    "真正的朋友，我只有科妮莉娅一个。可她自己都已经不在这里了。她早走了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1138
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_77441736:

    # "She already left me."
    "早就把我留下了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1140
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5ad00f8f:

    # "I’ve been trying not to begrudge Cornelia for having fun, but it’s hard for me not to feel at least a little jealous of her exploits."
    "我努力不因为她玩得开心就心生怨气，可听见她那些经历，还是很难不羡慕。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1142
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7d8e774e:

    # "I know I’ve always been a quiet, retiring sort of girl, but I’d like to go on an adventure or two of my own."
    "我知道自己一向安静又退缩，可也想有一两段属于自己的冒险。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1144
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0fb35ca4:

    # "Even I get tired here in Alpenrose, doing the same things day after day."
    "天天待在阿尔彭罗瑟，重复同样的事，就连我也会厌倦。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1148
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4257e929:

    # "I’d like to leave this place if I can...{w} and maybe going to Mors Paravail would be a good way to break the dull, grey monotony of my life."
    "可以的话，也想离开这里……{w}也许去莫尔斯·帕拉维尔一趟，就能打破生活里这片灰暗的单调。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1150
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bc7b4b50:

    # "It would give me something to do, at least."
    "至少能有点新事做。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1152
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_eb5421b5:

    # "I don’t know if I would be ready to leave Alpenrose altogether (that seems a bit too hasty), but..."
    "不知道自己有没有准备好彻底离开，那好像太仓促了。不过……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1163
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_45ea60ed:

    # Nienke "Well, maybe I could visit you some time."
    Nienke "嗯，也许哪天，我可以去看你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1165
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3b9069d2:

    # Merel "Would you want to?"
    Merel "你愿意？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1167
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_52734927:

    # Nienke "W-Well, yes. I mean, after everything we did, um, I-I feel like I should at least meet your parents..."
    Nienke "愿、愿意啊。毕竟都已经那样了，我，嗯……至少该见见你爸妈……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1169
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6c9bbc63:

    # Nienke "Or meet them again, I should say."
    Nienke "或者说，重新见一面。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1171
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_075bdf10:

    # Nienke "I guess I must have known them already, but I don’t remember them."
    Nienke "以前肯定认识，只是不记得了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1173
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a27ab229:

    # Nienke "If my parents hadn’t told me about them, I wouldn’t even remember their names..."
    Nienke "如果爸妈没告诉我，连他们的名字我都想不起来……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1175
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b0679c06:

    # Nienke "B-But if I’m, um, d-dating their daughter...{w} I feel like I should reintroduce myself. I-It’s only right, um..."
    Nienke "可、可是，既然在跟他们的女儿交、交往……{w}总该重新介绍一下自己。这、这才合适吧，嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1177
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0741389c:

    # Nienke "If you wouldn’t mind, that is?"
    Nienke "如果你不介意的话？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1179
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4f36b677:

    # Merel "Well, of course I wouldn’t mind!"
    Merel "当然不介意！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1183
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3ebd6333:

    # Merel "I’d be happy if you could meet my family, hehe. I’m sure they’d love to see you again..."
    Merel "你能来见我家人，我会很开心，嘿嘿。他们肯定也很想再见到你……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1185
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_df5c7656:

    # Merel "And I bet they’d be thrilled to know we’ve gotten so close!"
    Merel "知道我们变得这么亲近，一定高兴坏了！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1187
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b488a77a:

    # Nienke "D-Do you think so?"
    Nienke "你、你觉得会吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1189
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_29fb95d4:

    # Merel "I’m sure of it! They know that I’ve liked you for ages, hehe."
    Merel "肯定会！他们都知道，我喜欢你好久了，嘿嘿。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1193
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c6770eea:

    # Merel "I wasn’t lying, y’know, when I said I missed you a lot, or that I’d been thinking about you."
    Merel "我没说谎。说很想你，一直惦记你，都是真的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1194
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3156f49e:

    # Merel "I’d been wishing we could spend more time together almost every day, ever since you left Mors Paravail."
    Merel "从你离开莫尔斯·帕拉维尔起，几乎每天都在盼，能再多陪陪你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1195
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_eac4b0be:

    # Merel "It felt like a hole had been made in my heart when you left..."
    Merel "你走的时候，我心里像破了个洞……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1197
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b14fdfa8:

    # Merel "But I don’t have to feel like that anymore. I’m with you again, and now you’re my cute girlfriend!"
    Merel "可现在不用再难受啦。又能跟你在一起，而且你还是我可爱的女朋友！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1200
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1a3ffed3:

    # Nienke "I-I am?"
    Nienke "我、我是吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1202
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_10812b12:

    # Merel "Yeah! Didn’t you say it yourself? You’re my partner, so of course I’ve gotta introduce you to my parents. It’s only right, hehe."
    Merel "是呀！你自己不是都说了吗？既然是我的恋人，当然得介绍给爸妈认识。这才合适嘛，嘿嘿。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1204
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b9430c38:

    # Merel "I dunno about you, but I’m looking forward to it! Aren’t you?"
    Merel "不知道你怎么想，反正我很期待！你呢？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1206
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7612ebba:

    # Nienke "W-Well, um... I do want to see a little more of the world, I guess..."
    Nienke "这、这个……我确实想多看看外面的世界……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1208
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2ba09211:

    # Merel "And you will! We’ll see a lot together, you’n me. This is just the beginning!"
    Merel "会看到的！我们一起，你和我，还有好多地方要去。这只是开始！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1216
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5155e8c8:

    # "Just the beginning, huh?"
    "只是开始啊……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1217
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f0e0aba7:

    # "The kiss I shared with Merel made me feel so light, it’s hard to imagine things could get any better after that."
    "刚才那个吻，已经让我轻飘飘的，很难想象还有比这更美好的事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1219
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_944e44b5:

    # "I don’t know what else will happen between us, but my footfalls feel light as I walk alongside Merel."
    "不知道以后会怎样，可走在梅蕾尔身边，连脚步都轻了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1220
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c52de41a:

    # "I don’t have anything to compare it to, but that kiss I shared with Merel beneath the stars..."
    "虽然没有别的经验可以比较，可星光下的那个吻……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1222
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f1d7d751:

    # "I’m sure it’s a moment I’ll always remember fondly."
    "我一定会永远珍惜。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1223
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_716aceba:

    # "I might have forgotten Merel once before, but I doubt I’ll be able to forget her after this. I know she’ll continue to live on in my mind, even brighter than the luminously white moon which hangs in the night sky."
    "以前忘记过梅蕾尔一次，可经历了这些，大概再也忘不掉。她会一直住在我的脑海里，比夜空中那轮莹白的月亮还鲜明。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1234
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_39ac61f5:

    # "This kiss almost feels like a brand. My lips still tingle from it, many minutes after we’ve parted."
    "这个吻简直像一道印记。分开好久了，嘴唇还在隐隐发麻。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1235
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b37c118e:

    # "Merel left such an impression, I might very well have kissed a candle. It feels like my lips have been singed."
    "她留下的感觉那么强烈，像我吻过一簇烛火，唇上都被烫着了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1236
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c4eeea45:

    # "It’s not an uncomfortable sort of pain, however. There’s something soothing about it."
    "却不是让人难受的疼，反而有种安慰。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1237
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9f5f1f82:

    # "I guess it isn’t painful at all, then. There was nothing agonising about Merel’s kiss. It was far too sweet for that."
    "那大概根本算不上疼。梅蕾尔的吻没有半点折磨，只有太多的甜。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1238
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3f907577:

    # "I don’t regret what we did — or, at least, I don’t think I do..."
    "我不后悔。至少，我想自己不后悔……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1249
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9cc7d30e:

    # "But the full extent of my actions hits me much later that night, when I’m sitting in the bathtub."
    "可直到当晚坐进浴缸，我才真正意识到，刚才做的事意味着什么。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1264
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9df4e182:

    # "In my mind’s eye, I see her approaching me once more. I feel her palm against my cheek, cupping it so gently; feel the warmth of her breath as it stirs my skin."
    "脑海里，她又一次向我靠近。掌心那么轻柔地托着脸颊，温热的呼吸拂过皮肤。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1265
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3b40dc55:

    # "Then, I feel her lips against my own."
    "然后，是她的唇贴上来。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1266
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_45b5a672:

    # "I remember the kiss, soft and sweet, and I tremble as I do."
    "想起那个轻柔甜蜜的吻，我不禁微微发抖。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1267
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9229fc62:

    # "This could be bad."
    "这下可能不妙了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1268
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d1722eee:

    # "It almost feels like Merel is the only thing I can think about..."
    "脑袋里简直只装得下梅蕾尔……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1269
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_851b4bb8:

    # "But I know my embarrassment is only a temporary state."
    "不过我也知道，这份羞窘只是暂时的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1270
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cc29d9b1:

    # "Time moves on, and the past will always slip further and further away..."
    "时间总会往前，往事也会一点点远去……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1271
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cec781e3:

    # "But the kiss with Merel is fresh in my mind now, alongside a brand new consideration."
    "可眼下，那个吻依旧鲜明，还带来了一个新的问题。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1272
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_347539c6:

    # "We’re sharing the same room."
    "我们住在同一个房间。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1273
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8e9b071d:

    # "Hell, we sleep in the same bed — and it’s not a very big bed, either!"
    "天哪，还是同一张床。而且床也不大！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1274
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5b65a647:

    # "Merel insisted that there would be space enough for the both of us when she was trying to make her case about the merits of sharing, and I suppose she wasn’t wrong about that."
    "当初劝我一起睡时，梅蕾尔坚持说，地方足够两个人。倒也不能说她错了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1275
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_50424d4f:

    # "There is space enough for the both of us, but that’s only if we squash together, like we’re polar explorers in a tent sheltering from a storm."
    "确实睡得下，可得挤在一起，像躲进帐篷避风雪的极地探险家。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1276
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_850b7726:

    # "Merel’s hand always ends up brushing me as we try to sleep; her knees and her elbows, too."
    "睡觉时，她的手总会碰到我，膝盖和胳膊肘也是。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1277
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_02574061:

    # "There’s nothing romantic about being nudged in the side with Merel’s pointy elbow when I’m trying to sleep, b-but what if she hasn’t gone to bed just yet?"
    "正想睡觉，却被尖尖的胳膊肘顶到肋边，没什么浪漫可言。可、可如果她还没睡呢？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1278
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_83de6b28:

    # "What if she’s waiting for me even now, in my bed, as I sit in the bathtub slowly soaking?"
    "我还坐在浴缸里慢慢泡着，她会不会已经在床上等我？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1279
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5bb45345:

    # "What would I do if she wanted to keep kissing me?"
    "如果她还想继续吻我，我该怎么办？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1280
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4c8701c4:

    # "What would I do if she wanted to do {i}more{/i} than kiss me?"
    "如果她想做的{i}不止{/i}接吻呢？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1281
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_60372f8d:

    # "We’re both adults, so it wouldn’t be entirely out of the question, or even all that unexpected..."
    "我们都是成年人，也不是完全不可能，甚至不算多出人意料……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1282
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b7724012:

    # "So why is my heart pounding so much? Does that mean that I want this or not?"
    "那为什么心跳得这么快？我到底是想，还是不想？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1283
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a2acb34e:

    # "My thoughts are so mixed up, I can’t tell!"
    "脑子里太乱了，我分不清！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1284
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1ba24eef:

    # "I try to pre-empt what Merel will say, conjuring up replies to questions I haven’t even asked..."
    "我试着预想她会说什么，对还没问出口的问题，先编起答案……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1296
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8acf5f29:

    # "But when I do return to my bedroom, clad in my pyjamas with my long hair hanging loosely down the back of my neck, I’m disappointed."
    "可等我穿着睡衣，长发松松垂在背后，回到卧室时，却失望了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1298
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5eefab70:

    # "Merel isn’t sitting up in bed, eagerly anticipating my return, and she most definitely isn’t in the mood to pick up where we left off."
    "她没有坐在床上，满心期待地等我回来，更没有继续刚才那一吻的打算。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1313
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_57690257:

    # "Instead, she’s lying beneath the covers, her eyes closed."
    "她躺在被窝里，眼睛闭着。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1314
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b1926326:

    # "Her arms are splayed out, occupying a large amount of space on the bed. There’s barely any room for me to slide in beside her, and worst of all..."
    "两条胳膊大大摊开，占了床上一大片地方，我都快挤不进去了。最糟的是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1315
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6b675121:

    # Merel "Mm, nn... Nn... Zzzzz..."
    Merel "唔，嗯……嗯……呼噜噜……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1316
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4397d880:

    # "She’s snoring."
    "她在打呼噜。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1317
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1da9ae74:

    # "Her mouth is open, and it almost looks like she’s awaiting a kiss..."
    "嘴巴微张着，看起来倒像在等一个吻……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1318
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bb6fdbbd:

    # Merel "Mm, nn... Zzzz..."
    Merel "唔，嗯……呼噜噜……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1319
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0e3b9785:

    # "But I’m in no position to give one: not when she’s fast asleep."
    "可她都睡熟了，我怎么好吻下去。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1320
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7c94842c:

    # "I might have been imagining all of the things that Merel might do to me, but these things have all flown out of the window now."
    "刚才还胡思乱想她可能对我做什么，现在全都没影了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1321
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_98de7fbb:

    # "Why was I even getting so worked up, anyway? It’s clear that Merel doesn’t care at all about what we did! This is so stupid!"
    "我到底一个人在紧张什么啊？她根本就没把刚才的事放在心上！蠢死了！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1322
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8f54c2ba:

    # Nienke "You’re such an idiot, Merel! You shouldn’t play with my heart like that!"
    Nienke "梅蕾尔，你这个笨蛋！别这么捉弄我的心啊！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1323
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7a498df6:

    # Nienke "Why are you such a {sc=3}dummmmmmmy?!?!?!{/sc}"
    Nienke "你怎么会笨成{sc=3}这——样啊？！？！{/sc}"

# chapter3.rpyc:1338
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0acaa7ff:

    # "I don’t get much sleep that night thanks to Merel’s snoring. It’s hard for me to doze off when she’s lying beside me, her chest rumbling, low and unbroken noise escaping from her lips."
    "那晚，托梅蕾尔呼噜声的福，我又没睡多少。她躺在旁边，胸腔低低震动，嘴里响个不停，让人怎么睡得着。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1339
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a3645770:

    # "I’ve known from the beginning that Merel tends to snore, but she’s being even more aggressive about it than usual...{w} or maybe I simply feel more sensitive?"
    "我从一开始就知道她会打呼噜，可今天比平时还要过分……{w}还是说，只是我更敏感了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1340
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d1422b1c:

    # "It’s hard to say."
    "说不清。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1341
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_53397a6b:

    # "I know that Merel isn’t doing this on purpose — at least, I don’t think that she is — but it doesn’t endear me to her."
    "我知道她不是故意的，至少应该不是，可这并不能让她变得讨人喜欢。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1342
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d4293749:

    # "It doesn’t help that she tends to shift about in her sleep so much, either. She keeps brushing me with her elbows, her knees, her foot, so I feel tense and on edge."
    "睡觉还爱乱动，更是雪上加霜。胳膊肘、膝盖、脚，轮番碰过来，弄得我一直绷着神经。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1343
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0a58bf79:

    # "It’s impossible for me to doze off with my new girlfriend lying beside me, constantly brushing against me with her miscellaneous body parts."
    "新交的女朋友就在旁边，身上各个部位不停往我这儿碰，根本没法入睡。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1344
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_18f5ccf9:

    # "...Well. I say that it’s impossible, but this doesn’t actually hold true."
    "……好吧，说根本没法，也不完全对。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1345
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9f0a6bb2:

    # "I’m eventually able to get some much-needed rest, crammed onto the left side of my bed and curled up like a grain of rice, but it comes much too late."
    "最后，我挤在床的左边，蜷得像粒米，终于睡上了一会儿。可实在太迟了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1352
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6c63e866:

    # "I don’t know what time it is when I finally do doze off, but the sky outside my bedroom windows is already starting to lighten, and I can hear birds chirping in the trees outside."
    "不知道合眼时究竟几点，只知道窗外已经渐渐发亮，树上传来鸟叫。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1353
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f404c7e2:

    # "I’m probably able to snatch about two hours’ worth of slumber, if that."
    "大概最多睡了两个小时，也许还不到。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1359
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fc69573e:

    # "As a result, I feel distinctly groggy when Merel hauls me out of bed that morning."
    "所以，早上被梅蕾尔从床上拖起来时，我昏沉得厉害。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1360
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_684a6a55:

    # "I traipse like a zombie into the kitchen, and eat the apple pancakes prepared by my mother half-heartedly."
    "像僵尸一样挪进厨房，没精打采地吃着妈妈做的苹果煎饼。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1370
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5b7dfca8:

    # "I’m so dazed I almost spill my tea down my front."
    "迷糊得差点把茶泼到自己胸前。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1371
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dafc501f:

    # "That would have the fortunate effect of waking me up, I suppose, but it would also scald me. I can’t say I’m too keen on that happening."
    "真泼上去，倒是能让我清醒，可也会烫伤。我可不想。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1373
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_47ba0c8e:

    # Elowen "Dear me!"
    Elowen "哎呀！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1374
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ed547527:

    # "My mother clicks her tongue, one hand resting against her chin."
    "妈妈啧了一声，一只手放在下巴旁。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1375
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cd4e28da:

    # Elowen "Are you alright, Nienke, dear?"
    Elowen "妮恩克，宝贝，你没事吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1377
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d3f19d71:

    # Nienke "Wha...?"
    Nienke "什……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1378
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3716193b:

    # "I look at my mother blankly, too exausted to even attempt to smile."
    "我茫然地望着她，累得连试着笑一下都懒得。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1380
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_61f761cf:

    # "I frown, then say..."
    "皱了皱眉，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1381
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0e73d2b8:

    # Nienke "I’ll live, I guess."
    Nienke "应该还死不了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1382
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_15a57b14:

    # Emiel "Well, I certainly hope so! I’d be devastated if anything happened to you, dear..."
    Emiel "那当然得好好活着！宝贝，你要是出什么事，我可受不了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1383
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_874782a9:

    # Emiel "But you look a little bit spacey this morning. Are you sure you’re okay?"
    Emiel "不过，你今天早上有点魂不守舍。真没事吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1393
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f246c1ca:

    # Merel "Oh, sorry about that, Mr and Mrs Faber!"
    Merel "啊，不好意思，法贝尔先生、太太！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1395
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1a4f55f6:

    # Merel "Nienke and I stayed out pretty late last night, and I’m afaid I might’ve tired her out! I can be so thoughtless sometimes, wahaha!"
    Merel "昨晚我和妮恩克在外面待得比较晚，大概把她累着了！我有时就是这么不周到，哇哈哈！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1396
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_df57662c:

    # Emiel "Really, now? And what did the two of you get up to?"
    Emiel "哦，是吗？你们俩都干什么去了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1397
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_853d7398:

    # Emiel "I can’t imagine there’s all {i}that{/i} much mischief to be had around Alpenrose!"
    Emiel "阿尔彭罗瑟好像也没{i}那么{/i}多淘气可捣吧！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1400
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c73092df:

    # "At the mention of the word ‘mischief’, my face floods bright red."
    "一听见“淘气”，我整张脸都红透了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1401
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_80a25c9e:

    # "I’m reminded rather forcefully of what happened in the field wth Merel last night, when she confessed her feelings to me."
    "昨晚田野里，梅蕾尔向我表明心意的事，猛地涌上来。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1403
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3c45f94a:

    # "I remember her leaning in, her hands resting against my shoulders, her lips on mine..."
    "想起她靠过来，双手放在肩上，嘴唇贴着我的唇……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1405
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6a9ff6d7:

    # Merel "Oh, we just went for a long walk, that’s all!"
    Merel "啊，就是散了个长步，没别的！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1406
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8fb38a1b:

    # "But Merel, to my immense relief, doesn’t disclose all of my indiscretions to my parents."
    "万幸，她没把我那些不够端庄的举动一股脑告诉爸妈。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1408
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_037c5b99:

    # "She beams, her knife and fork set aside (she’s seriously trying to cover for me, since she isn’t devouring her pancakes like a wildebeest), as she says..."
    "她笑着放下刀叉——连角马似的猛吃煎饼都暂停了，看来真是在认真替我打掩护——接着说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1410
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4722abf6:

    # Merel "I think the fields around Alpenrose are really nice, so I wanted to go for a bit of a wander..."
    Merel "我觉得阿尔彭罗瑟周围的田野很漂亮，就想多逛逛……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1411
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4f0442de:

    # Merel "But this wander turned out to be more like a trek, hehe."
    Merel "结果散步散着散着，都快变成徒步远足了，嘿嘿。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1413
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_32d67f6e:

    # Merel "Poor Nienke was tellin’ me her legs were hurtin’, but I kept saying, “Let’s go for just a little longer.”"
    Merel "可怜的妮恩克一直说腿疼，我还说：“再走一小会儿嘛。”"

# chapter3.rpyc:1415
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_67958dd7:

    # Merel "It’s a wonder we didn’t make it all the way to the next village. Isn’t that right, Nienke?"
    Merel "居然没一路走到隔壁村，也算奇迹了。对吧，妮恩克？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1417
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1f5a2cd0:

    # "Merel nudges me in the side, and I start. I glance at her, though it’s a little hard to meet her gaze, and mumble..."
    "她轻轻碰了碰我的腰侧，我一惊，瞥她一眼，却有点不敢对视，只低声答……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1419
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_29cb1e2c:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, er, that’s right. We, um, went a bit further than I anticipated, that’s all. I should be alright, though."
    Nienke "啊、啊，对。就是，嗯，走得比预想中远了一点。不过应该没事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1421
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_40a701f1:

    # Nienke "I just need to go to sleep early tonight."
    Nienke "今晚早点睡就好了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1422
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_edac784f:

    # Elowen "Hmm. Well, if you girls are sure that’s all it is..."
    Elowen "嗯，既然你们都确定只是这样……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1424
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_febb0cdb:

    # "My mother looks between us, a knowing glimmer in her eye."
    "妈妈看看我，又看看她，眼里闪着了然的光。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1425
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8bb9e850:

    # "She doesn’t directly question us, but I’m not sure if I like that look on her face."
    "她没直接追问，可那副表情，我有点不喜欢。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1426
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2fa90271:

    # "Why is her smile so coy? She doesn’t suspect something between me and Merel, does she?"
    "怎么笑得这么意味深长？该不会怀疑我和梅蕾尔有什么吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1428
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6cfbc3e3:

    # "Crap. She hasn’t noticed how much I’m blushing, has she?"
    "糟了。不会发现我脸有多红了吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1429
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3de4cda8:

    # "My mother might not be the one with the penchant for building ships in bottles, but her eyes {i}are{/i} pretty sharp. I wouldn’t be surprised if she’s worked out I have a crush..."
    "虽然爱做瓶中船的不是妈妈，可她的眼神{i}确实{/i}很厉害。就算看出我有喜欢的人了，也不意外……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1431
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e7cc7b01:

    # Elowen "Hehe. You girls. You need to learn your limits."
    Elowen "呵呵，你们这些姑娘。也该知道自己的限度。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1432
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fe4f080b:

    # Elowen "I know it must be very exciting for the both of you, being reunited after all of this time, but you should try to look out for yourselves."
    Elowen "隔了这么久终于重逢，你们肯定很兴奋，不过也得顾着点身体。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1433
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fa01260f:

    # Elowen "I don’t want you wearing yourself down, Nienke: do you hear me?"
    Elowen "妮恩克，别把自己累坏了，听见没有？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1434
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d18637a2:

    # Elowen "You’re already in the dog house with Mrs van Dijk, without having any more mishaps!"
    Elowen "范戴克太太已经对你不满意了，可别再出岔子！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1436
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_89b7fd32:

    # Nienke "R-Right. I’ll, um, keep that in mind..."
    Nienke "好、好的。嗯，我记住了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1438
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9c95bbd4:

    # "But if my mother knows the truth behind my early morning malaise, she doesn’t spill the beans."
    "不过，就算妈妈知道我一早没精神的真相，也没说破。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1439
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8747d8a2:

    # "Thanks, Mum. I guess I owe you one."
    "谢谢，妈妈。看来欠你个人情。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1440
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7a165fdc:

    # "I finish up my breakfast mutely, while my parents chatter away to Merel about the sights of Alpenrose."
    "爸妈继续跟梅蕾尔聊着阿尔彭罗瑟的景色，我默默吃完早饭。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1449
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aa43dd89:

    # "I vow, as I chew on my pancakes, that I’m not going to let my feelings for Merel get in the way of doing my job anymore."
    "嚼着煎饼，我暗自发誓：不能再让对她的心意妨碍工作。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1450
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_44ba6689:

    # "I mean to throw myself into my work as a waitress, so I can forget about the confusing, often contradictory, haze of feelings inside me..."
    "我要一心扑在服务生的工作上，忘掉心里这团混乱、又时常互相矛盾的情绪……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1460
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_47c28e06:

    # Merel "Hey, Nienke. I seem to be havin’ some trouble with the back of my dress again. Could you lend me a hand?"
    Merel "喂，妮恩克，裙子背后好像又不好弄了。能帮我一下吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1461
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ee2b2d39:

    # "But Merel must have other ideas."
    "可梅蕾尔显然另有打算。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1462
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8a952c2b:

    # "We’re in the staff room, changing into our uniforms..."
    "我们正在员工休息室换制服……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1463
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9d72e2b3:

    # "Or, to be more precise, {i}I’m{/i} changing into my uniform."
    "准确说，是{i}我{/i}正在换制服。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1475
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a8dfad6a:

    # "Merel, for her part, doesn’t even seem to be trying. Her fingers reach for the zip at the back of her dress, but she does so ineffectually. She’s not able to slide the zip up, but I’m not sure she’s really trying."
    "至于她，好像根本没认真穿。手指伸向背后的拉链，笨拙地摸索，拉不上去。可她究竟有没有真用心，我很怀疑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1476
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3f3f5c38:

    # "I’m not at all convinced by her efforts."
    "这番努力，我一点也不信。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1477
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a38978f3:

    # "I can’t help but wonder if this is some attempt to fluster me — and, if that is the case, she’s doing a good job at it."
    "忍不住怀疑，她是不是故意想看我慌张。如果是，那她做得很成功。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1478
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_66dbdb58:

    # "I blush as I look at the smooth expanse of Merel’s back, exposed before my roving eyes..."
    "目光扫过她露出的光滑后背，我又脸红了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1479
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2c532b29:

    # "But, no! I shouldn’t stare. There’s plenty of work to do, and I can’t afford to get distracted all because of Merel’s salacious little schemes!"
    "不行！不能盯着看！还有那么多工作，不能被她这点不正经的小把戏弄得分心！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1486
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b93a1432:

    # "I pout, then stamp over to Merel, my eyes narrowed."
    "我噘起嘴，眯着眼，重重踩着步子走过去。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1487
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_29a562e8:

    # Nienke "You know, I think you’re doing this on purpose."
    Nienke "你知道吗，我觉得你就是故意的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1488
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_18df3f5c:

    # Merel "Gee, really? Whatever tipped you off?"
    Merel "哎呀，真的？怎么发现的？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1489
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b70cc2f7:

    # Nienke "Goodness, I don’t know. Maybe it’s the fact that you seemed to get on perfectly well with zipping your own dress up yesterday — and the day before that, as it happens."
    Nienke "天哪，不知道呢。大概是因为昨天你自己拉得好好的，哦，还有前天。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1490
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_73fb115d:

    # Nienke "You’ve not had any issues with it since I first showed you how to work the zip. I didn’t think you’d have any problems after that..."
    Nienke "自从第一次教会你之后，你就没出过问题。我还以为已经学会了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1491
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0db9a3ae:

    # Nienke "But it seems like you’ve regressed this morning. I thought that you were smarter than this, Merel!"
    Nienke "结果今天早上居然又退步了。梅蕾尔，我本来以为你没这么笨！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1492
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_080137a0:

    # Merel "Did you, now?"
    Merel "哦，是吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1493
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b10deaba:

    # "Merel rejoins, with an amused smile."
    "她带着好笑的表情反问。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1494
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7564a7b4:

    # Merel "Well, I’m sorry to be the bearer of bad news, Nienke, but I really ain’t all that clever."
    Merel "那可要告诉你一个坏消息了，妮恩克，我真没多聪明。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1495
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_652745ca:

    # Merel "In fact, I think I’m a pretty big dummy, wahahaha!"
    Merel "其实，我就是个大笨蛋，哇哈哈哈！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1496
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2a0d207d:

    # Nienke "Well, I can see that now. You don’t need to laugh about it like that. You’re going to split my poor eardrums."
    Nienke "现在看出来了。不用笑成这样，我可怜的耳膜都要被你震破了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1497
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e25cd6dd:

    # Merel "Oh, yes. I apologise, hehe. You have pretty sensitive ears, don’t you?"
    Merel "哦，也是，对不起，嘿嘿。你的耳朵很敏感嘛。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1498
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e8e8508a:

    # Nienke "Well, of course. I’m not an elf for nothing — but you ought to have rather sensitive ears yourself."
    Nienke "那当然，我这精灵又不是白当的。不过你自己的耳朵也该很敏感吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1499
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d074c73a:

    # Nienke "Do you not get tired, listening to the sound of your own voice all the time?"
    Nienke "整天听着自己的声音，你都不嫌累吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1500
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6939d902:

    # Merel "Well, about that..."
    Merel "嗯，这个嘛……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1501
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_441fca64:

    # "Merel smiles wryly, while pressing her index finger against her lower lip. She grins, then says..."
    "梅蕾尔把食指抵在下唇上，促狭地笑了笑，接着咧嘴道……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1502
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aa8949ab:

    # Merel "You’d think I’d get tired, wouldn’t you, but I don’t really mind!"
    Merel "你肯定觉得我该嫌烦了吧，可我真不介意！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1503
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0586877c:

    # Nienke "No?"
    Nienke "不介意？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1504
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_749595b7:

    # Merel "Nope! I’m an incurable chatterbox, so I love yappin’! There’s nothin’ I like more than hearin’ the sound of my own voice..."
    Merel "不介意！我可是个没救的话痨，就爱说个不停！听见自己的声音，比什么都开心……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1505
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bde687c9:

    # Merel "Or, at least, there wasn’t!"
    Merel "至少，以前是这样！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1506
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_386a307b:

    # Nienke "Meaning, your tastes have changed?"
    Nienke "所以，现在爱好变了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1507
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1d0b096b:

    # Merel "Y’could say that, yeah."
    Merel "嗯，可以这么说。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1508
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a3d775b8:

    # Merel "I used to have plenty of fun chatterin’ away to anybody who’d listen — heck, sometimes I’d even talk to myself, just to keep myself entertained, but that’s been losin’ some of its appeal lately."
    Merel "以前，只要有人肯听，我就能聊得很开心。没人的时候，甚至会自言自语给自己解闷。不过最近，吸引力没那么大了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1509
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fa0ae4d9:

    # Merel "I still love the sound of my own voice, y’know, ’cause I’m horribly self-centred..."
    Merel "我当然还是喜欢自己的声音，谁让我那么自恋呢……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1510
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_02a1367a:

    # "Well, at least she admits it."
    "好歹她承认了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1511
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e7392cc3:

    # Merel "But there’s somethin’ I like more’n that."
    Merel "可现在，有更喜欢听的东西了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1512
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2a9a7344:

    # Merel "It might’ve taken me a few days to figure it out, buuut..."
    Merel "花了几天才弄明白，不——过……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1524
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_81b1814d:

    # "Merel turns as she speaks, the white ribbon of her dark maid’s dress shifting."
    "她边说边转过身，黑色女仆裙上的白缎带随着动作轻晃。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1526
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0adc2d01:

    # "She takes hold of my hands, squeezing them gently between her fingers, and..."
    "她拉起我的双手，轻轻握住，然后……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1529
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9133d1ba:

    # Nienke "Oh...!"
    Nienke "啊……！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1530
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4056e62f:

    # "Quick as a flash, she ducks her head. Her lips press against my cheek in a quick kiss which doesn’t linger, as she says..."
    "她飞快地低头，在我脸颊上啄了一下，毫不停留，接着说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1532
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_42e1dc83:

    # Merel "I think I like hearin’ you whimper even more than I love listenin’ to myself..."
    Merel "比起听自己说话，我现在好像更爱听你这种小小的惊呼……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1534
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_498eee6b:

    # Merel "And of course, I love makin’ you blush!"
    Merel "当然，也喜欢逗你脸红！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1537
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0a467c18:

    # Nienke "Y-You..."
    Nienke "你、你……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1538
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b0a9d8df:

    # "I take a step back, my eyes wide."
    "我睁大眼睛，往后退了一步。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1540
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fdb79100:

    # "Merel dispensed with that kiss without a moment’s hesitation, like a philanthropic princess might scatter largesse amongst her people."
    "她送出这个吻，半点都没犹豫，像慷慨的公主向子民施予恩惠。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1542
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8e495dc0:

    # "She didn’t even pause before bequeathing me with that kiss, and she doesn’t look even remotely perturbed about it."
    "吻下来之前没停顿，吻完也丝毫不见慌张。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1544
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dc4f11bd:

    # "In fact, it’s the exact opposite. She seems to be in her element. She’s in such high spirits, she’s positively beaming."
    "恰恰相反，她简直如鱼得水，神采飞扬，笑得耀眼。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1545
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5be1196a:

    # "I stare at her, my lips parted, and then..."
    "我微张着嘴盯着她，然后……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1547
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a3683c5b:

    # Nienke "I-I appreciate the sentiment, b-but you can’t go around kissing me at work, Merel!"
    Nienke "心、心意我领了，可上班时不能随便亲我，梅蕾尔！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1549
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bfe14d1f:

    # Merel "What?"
    Merel "什么？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1552
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0e497341:

    # "Merel pouts, her cheeks puffed out."
    "她鼓起脸颊，噘着嘴。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1556
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c81db84a:

    # Merel "Why can’t I kiss you, Nienke? I mean, you are my girlfriend now, and I don’t think you dislike it?"
    Merel "为什么不能亲？妮恩克，你现在是我女朋友呀，而且也没不喜欢吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1558
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_14f651a1:

    # Nienke "W-Well, no, I don’t, but that isn’t the point!"
    Nienke "是、是没不喜欢，可重点不是这个！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1560
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b4602da2:

    # Merel "Then what is? You aren’t afraid of what other people might think, are you?"
    Merel "那是什么？你不会在怕别人怎么看吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1564
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8addcaf5:

    # Merel "I kept quiet to your parents earlier, but I don’t think they’d mind if I spilled the beans."
    Merel "刚才我没跟你爸妈说，可就算说出来，他们应该也不介意。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1566
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a7d6fca2:

    # Merel "I figured it’d be better to talk to you about this before making a big deal outta it, but I’m sure your parents will accept you. They seem so nice!"
    Merel "我觉得公开之前，还是先跟你谈谈比较好。不过，他们肯定会接受你的。他们看着人那么好！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1568
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d95c17da:

    # Nienke "They don’t just seem nice, they {i}are{/i} nice. I doubt they would mind either, and I don’t care what other people think about me."
    Nienke "不是看着好，是{i}真的{/i}很好。我也觉得他们不会介意。而且，别人怎么看我，我不在乎。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1572
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0beb20bf:

    # Nienke "I’m used to getting strange looks. It’s something I’ve always had to endure, thanks to being an elf."
    Nienke "奇怪的目光，我早习惯了。身为精灵，一直就得忍受这些。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1574
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2bcc0015:

    # Nienke "I don’t think the villagers of Alpenrose would find me any more peculiar than they do already because I go around kissing girls..."
    Nienke "阿尔彭罗瑟的人，也不会因为我亲了女孩子，就觉得我比现在更奇怪……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1576
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cc0caa40:

    # Nienke "O-Or because I let another girl kiss me, I guess."
    Nienke "或、或者说，让别的女孩子亲了我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1578
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8939a8ab:

    # Merel "Then what is the issue?"
    Merel "那到底有什么问题？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1580
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_25122e51:

    # Nienke "Well, I—"
    Nienke "因为我——"

# chapter3.rpyc:1583
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d06d53ad:

    # Merel "Don’t tell me! You aren’t ashamed of bein’ seen with me, are you?"
    Merel "别说了！你该不会觉得，被人看见跟我在一起很丢脸吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1585
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a47d9e70:

    # Nienke "What? No! O-Of course not!"
    Nienke "什么？不是！当、当然不是！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1587
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_700df6a5:

    # Merel "Are you sure? Muscles aside, I dunno if I’m that much of a prize, and I have heard it said I can be kinda annoying..."
    Merel "确定吗？除了这一身肌肉，我也不知道自己多拿得出手，而且还听说过，我挺烦人的……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1589
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6c33b056:

    # Nienke "Yes, I know you’ve heard that said. I’m sure you heard it from me, and I still stand by that. You {i}can{/i} be annoying."
    Nienke "我知道你听说过。肯定就是我说的，而且现在也没改口。你{i}确实{/i}会烦人。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1598
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a5f51561:

    # Merel "Oh, Nienke! You wound me!"
    Merel "妮恩克！你伤了我的心！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1606
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_168e51b8:

    # Nienke "The truth hurts — but, no. I’m not opposed to you, um...{w} k-kissing me...{w} because I’m ashamed of you."
    Nienke "实话总是伤人的。不过，不是因为嫌你丢脸，我才反对你……{w}亲、亲我……{w}的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1608
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9fe28d4f:

    # Nienke "I just don’t think it’s very professional."
    Nienke "我只是觉得，这样不太有工作的样子。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1611
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c74cf8dd:

    # Merel "Huh? What’s so unprofessional about a little peck on the cheek?"
    Merel "啊？亲一下脸颊，哪里不像工作了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1613
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1d91b15e:

    # Nienke "It’s unprofessional because we should be on the clock. We need to focus on serving our customers, not indulging in affection with one another."
    Nienke "因为我们正在上班。应该专心服务客人，不该只顾着彼此亲热。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1617
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bd77a65b:

    # Merel "Whaat? But we ain’t even in the café yet: not properly! We’re still in the staff room!"
    Merel "诶？可我们都还没正式进店呢，还在休息室呀！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1619
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_35b39224:

    # Nienke "I know, but it’s the principle of the thing. I don’t think we should get too comfortable with being overly affectionate during the working day."
    Nienke "我知道，可这是原则问题。上班时太亲密，不该习惯成自然。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1623
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_57429228:

    # Nienke "I don’t want to keep people waiting, and a lot of elderly people attend Fleur de Lys."
    Nienke "我不想让客人等着，来百合花的老人又多。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1625
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ad6cc90e:

    # Nienke "I’m afraid, if you act too familiar with me, some of our more old-fashioned customers might have an issue with it."
    Nienke "你要是对我太亲昵，有些老派的客人可能会看不惯。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1627
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_55aa3a46:

    # Nienke "I don’t want Mrs van Dijk collapsing into her poppyseed cake, or spilling her Darjeeling everywhere. That would be a disaster to clean up!"
    Nienke "我可不想让范戴克太太一头栽进罂粟籽蛋糕，或者把大吉岭茶洒得到处都是。收拾起来就是场灾难！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1629
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a43c1f2f:

    # Merel "Aaah. I see."
    Merel "啊——懂了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1631
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1d3526d7:

    # Merel "Well, y’might have a point there. I guess this café {i}does{/i} get visited by a lot of oldies."
    Merel "嗯，你说得有道理。这店里{i}确实{/i}常来不少老人家。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1633
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5fb6c7cb:

    # Merel "I don’t want any of these dinosaurs to wind up turnin’ into fossils, or goin’ extinct, so I’ll try’n behave myself."
    Merel "我也不想让这些老恐龙直接变成化石，或者当场灭绝，所以会尽量规矩点的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1634
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4e2411e2:

    # Merel "I’ll keep my hands — and my lips — to myself while we’re working. How does that sound?"
    Merel "工作时，我会管好手，也管好嘴唇。这样行吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1636
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a31b70ce:

    # Nienke "It sounds rather offensive, actually."
    Nienke "其实，听起来相当冒犯。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1639
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_01c96ac8:

    # Merel "Hey! What’s so offensive about it? I’m tryin’ to be thoughtful, Nienke! I thought you’d like that!"
    Merel "喂！哪里冒犯啦？我这是在替别人着想，妮恩克！还以为你会高兴呢！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1641
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_14d42188:

    # Nienke "And I do. I appreciate that you’re willing to think about others for a change—"
    Nienke "我是高兴。你终于肯考虑一下别人，我很感激——"

# chapter3.rpyc:1643
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7251bce4:

    # Merel "‘For a change’, she says — like I wasn’t always lookin’ out for you when we were growin’ up!"
    Merel "听听，“终于”！好像我们小时候，我没一直照顾她一样！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1645
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_744b28de:

    # Nienke "—but you probably shouldn’t call Mrs van Dijk a fossil. I’m not sure if she would appreciate it."
    Nienke "——不过，最好别把范戴克太太叫作化石。我不觉得她会高兴。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1647
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f2cfcc2b:

    # Merel "But she {i}is{/i} a fossil! I’ve seen her, Nienke, an’ she’s ancient! Her back is all hunched, and her hands are like claws, and she can hardly walk at all without that cane!"
    Merel "可她{i}就是{/i}化石嘛！我见过她，妮恩克，年纪大得不得了！背都驼了，手像爪子，不拄拐杖都快走不动！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1649
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9a8ef22a:

    # Nienke "You might be right, but you can’t say those things while we’re at work. Somebody might hear."
    Nienke "就算是事实，上班时也不能这样说。会被人听见。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1651
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6ce0e803:

    # Merel "Hehehe. Well, alright. I can understand your concerns—"
    Merel "嘿嘿，好吧。我理解你的顾虑——"

# chapter3.rpyc:1653
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7a639987:

    # "That’s a relief. Sometimes, I think Merel can’t understand much more than her own immediate feelings."
    "那就好。有时候，我真觉得她除了自己眼前的心情，什么都理解不了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1655
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_03fad0b8:

    # Merel "—so I’ll behave, like I said. There’ll be no kissin’, and no canoodling..."
    Merel "——所以我会守规矩的。不亲亲，也不腻腻歪歪……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1657
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ebcd5799:

    # Merel "And I won’t harp on about how old Mrs van Dijk is, either. I’ll be like a saint — no, an angel! Is that contrite enough for you, Nienke?"
    Merel "也不再唠叨范戴克太太有多老。我会像圣人一样，不，像天使一样！妮恩克，这样算有悔意了吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1659
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_27b4f7f1:

    # Nienke "I still think you could work on it. You’re smiling a little too much, and you didn’t apologise..."
    Nienke "我觉得还有进步空间。笑得太开心了，而且也没道歉……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1661
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dfa4cd4d:

    # Nienke "But I at least trust you to try."
    Nienke "不过，我至少相信你会试着改。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1663
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7426274e:

    # Merel "Of course! I’m always trying, in my own way!"
    Merel "当然！我一直都在用自己的方式努力！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1665
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0984f569:

    # Merel "Now, let’s get started. The quicker we can start servin’ people, the quicker we can get finished, and the quicker I can have you all to myself..."
    Merel "好啦，开工。越早开始招待客人，就能越早结束，我也能越早独占你……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1667
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_30c4199e:

    # Merel "And the quicker I can kiss you some more, hehe!"
    Merel "越早多亲你几下，嘿嘿！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1669
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ce97177a:

    # Nienke "I’m not sure if that’s how it works."
    Nienke "事情好像不是这么算的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1670
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6222e734:

    # Merel "Why not?"
    Merel "为什么？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1672
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c6bcdce7:

    # Nienke "No matter how quickly we rush to finish things, our shift will end at 17:00, just like always. We can’t make the time go by any faster..."
    Nienke "再怎么赶进度，我们也得像平时一样，下午五点才下班。时间又不能加速……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1674
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b969834d:

    # Merel "Not with that attitude! We’ve just gotta believe!"
    Merel "抱着这种想法当然不行！得相信呀！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1676
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5c0ccd87:

    # Nienke "And what am I meant to be believing in, exactly?"
    Nienke "到底要相信什么？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1678
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ddc8ab12:

    # Merel "The power of love, duh!"
    Merel "爱的力量呀，这还用问！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1679
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b683fbdc:

    # "Merel rejoins, like this should be oh-so-obvious — and maybe, to her, it is."
    "她答得理所当然。也许对她来说，真就是这么理所当然。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1681
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ee953021:

    # "She rolls her eyes: bright, enthused eyes which seem to sparkle."
    "她翻了翻眼睛，那双明亮又兴奋的眼，仿佛闪着光。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1687
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_99604f73:

    # "She leans in."
    "她靠过来。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1688
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_df70b415:

    # "Then, pressing another quick kiss against my cheek, she says..."
    "又在我脸颊上飞快亲了一下，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1689
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a525e566:

    # Merel "Now, let’s get to it {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Merel "好了，干活吧{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# chapter3.rpyc:1703
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_389a0666:

    # "I had a few concerns about how today would go, of course (I always seem to have concerns when Merel is involved), but the morning actually passes by relatively peacefully."
    "对今天能不能顺利过去，我当然有些担心。只要牵涉梅蕾尔，我似乎总有担心不完的事。不过，上午倒是挺平静。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1704
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_efcc001f:

    # "It’s a quiet Thursday, and there aren’t all that many patrons. We only get a smattering of oldies — or ‘fossils’, as Merel oh-so-kindly called them."
    "这是个清闲的星期四，客人不多，只有零零星星几位老人，或者用梅蕾尔那“体贴”的叫法，几块化石。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1705
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_182de4cb:

    # "I’m kept occupied during work, but I’m not so very occupied I’m rushed off my feet. There’s something relaxing about it."
    "工作有事可做，却又不至于忙得脚不沾地，反而有点让人放松。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1706
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0725f64a:

    # "My life might have changed a good deal since Merel arrived in it, but my work is as regular as always."
    "她来了以后，生活是变了不少，可工作还是一如既往，有条不紊。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1707
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_14bbc7b5:

    # "I’m soon able to establish a rhythm, and the hours pass by quickly."
    "我很快找到了节奏，时间也过得飞快。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1708
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f883c839:

    # "I get so caught up in everything that I don’t think too much about Merel, or our new relationship, or the way she kissed me last night."
    "忙着忙着，就没再多想梅蕾尔，没多想我们新的关系，也没多想昨晚那个吻。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1709
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ec61746f:

    # "I’m content enough to go through the motions, a small smile on my face all the while.."
    "按部就班地做着事，嘴边挂着一点微笑，已经足够满足……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1720
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dc8c0416:

    # VD "Excuse me, Nienke? I know you’re busy, but I can’t imagine you’re so very busy you can’t spare a word for your most loyal customer."
    VD "妮恩克，打扰一下？知道你忙，可总不至于连最忠实的老客人想说句话，你都抽不出空吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1721
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_62153dab:

    # VD "Could you come over here?"
    VD "能过来一下吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1722
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7f58d0d5:

    # "But my good mood is soon sullied by an interjection from Mrs van Dijk."
    "可范戴克太太一开口，我的好心情很快就蒙上了阴影。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1724
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a6925c97:

    # "She entered the café at her usual time — at midday on the dot — while I was busy serving another table."
    "她照例中午十二点整进店。那时，我正忙着招待另一桌。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1725
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5d0cd2dd:

    # "Merel, seeing I was otherwise indisposed, wound up leading Mrs van Dijk to her table, then taking her order."
    "梅蕾尔见我腾不出手，就带她入座，替她点了单。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1726
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_13d7b1e7:

    # "I thought it would be fine to let Merel take care of everything, since Mrs van Dijk seems tolerably fond of her, but maybe not."
    "她挺喜欢梅蕾尔，我以为全交给她应该没事。现在看来，未必。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1727
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_196a7c79:

    # "Mrs van Dijk is looking at me now, her hands folded on the top of her cane."
    "此刻，范戴克太太双手交叠在拐杖顶上，正望着我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1728
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1a2fab96:

    # "She doesn’t exactly sound upset, but it can be hard to tell with Mrs van Dijk. She always keeps her voice level, and I’ve never once heard her shout: not even when I messed up my scales during her piano lessons."
    "声音倒不像生气，可她这人很难判断。说话一向平稳，我从没听她吼过，连钢琴课上把音阶弹错时都没有。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1729
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5236727a:

    # "It could be fine..."
    "也许没什么事……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1730
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7bd371e2:

    # "But Mrs van Dijk’s expression gives me pause."
    "可她的表情，让我有些迟疑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1731
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_858bd03d:

    # "What does she want?"
    "她想干什么？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1742
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1be9a01b:

    # "I swallow down my unease, then approach. I try to look casual, but my feet start to shuffle the closer I get to her and a hard pit of dread starts to form in my stomach."
    "我咽下不安，走过去，努力显得自然。可越靠近，脚步越拖沓，胃里也像结起一块硬邦邦的恐惧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1743
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_719dff87:

    # "I’m positive that she’s going to scold me. That’s all she ever seems to do."
    "肯定又要训我了。她好像总在做这件事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1745
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_60a556c1:

    # "I’m anticipating another barrage of complaints — a remark, maybe, about how the tea is too cold; the cake too crumbly; my conduct too slovenly; my expression too awkward — when..."
    "我等着新一轮抱怨：茶太凉，蛋糕太松散，举止太懒散，表情太别扭之类。结果……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1747
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3dfb1a63:

    # VD "Perhaps it isn’t my place to comment upon such a thing, Nienke, dear, but I couldn’t help but notice that you seem to be in higher spirits than usual today."
    VD "妮恩克，亲爱的，也许我不该多嘴。不过我注意到，你今天好像比平时精神多了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1748
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_97326e03:

    # VD "Did something good happen?"
    VD "遇上什么好事了吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1750
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a2e87a0b:

    # Nienke "What...?"
    Nienke "什么……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1751
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fbc8960b:

    # "Well, that was unexpected. I stand there, frozen, looking like a statue. My mouth hangs open in a small ‘o’ while Mrs van Dijk smiles conspiratorially."
    "这倒完全没想到。我像雕像一样僵在那里，嘴巴微微张圆。范戴克太太却露出心照不宣的笑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1755
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_75344334:

    # VD "Now, now, don’t play coy with me, dear. I’m an old woman, yes, but that means I’ve seen things."
    VD "好了，别在我面前装傻，孩子。我是老了，可也正因为老，才见过些世面。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1756
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_007eeef5:

    # VD "I know you youngsters like to fancy that all of us old women are senile, but I have eyes in my head which work just as well as yours, and I’ve seen things."
    VD "我知道，你们年轻人爱把老太太都当老糊涂。可我这双眼睛不比你的差，该看见的，都看得见。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1757
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_76fbecd8:

    # VD "I see how you’ve been smiling today, and I’ve noticed that you seem to be looking at the new waitress a fair bit, too."
    VD "今天你脸上一直带着笑，而且没少往新来的服务生那边看，我都注意到了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1760
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9133d1ba_1:

    # Nienke "Oh...!"
    Nienke "啊……！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1762
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_39bf26f2:

    # "My face flushes at Mrs van Dijk’s words, so red I feel like a boiled lobster."
    "她的话让我脸一下烧红，感觉像只煮熟的龙虾。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1763
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ee78e43e:

    # "I continue to blink at her, struck dumb, while she smiles triumphantly."
    "我只能愣愣地眨眼，一句话也说不出。她则露出猜中的笑容。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1764
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bdac99dc:

    # VD "Well. Was I correct in my assessment, dear? Has working with Merel cheered you up?"
    VD "怎么样，亲爱的，我没说错吧？跟梅蕾尔一起工作，让你开心了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1766
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9a089c9a:

    # Nienke "W-Well, um..."
    Nienke "这、这个，嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1774
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ed20ed1a:

    # "I look to one side, too abashed to meet Mrs van Dijk’s clever, hooded eyes. I’ve always known that she’s canny, but I didn’t realise she would be able to read me quite so accurately."
    "我羞得看向旁边，不敢对上她那双藏在眼皮下的精明眼睛。一直知道她厉害，却不知道能把我看得这么准。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1775
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f97f30d6:

    # "Either Mrs van Dijk’s gaze is even more discerning than I’ve ever imagined, or I’m much more transparent."
    "要么她比我想象中更敏锐，要么就是我比自己以为的更藏不住事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1777
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_832220b4:

    # "I’m not sure which is worse."
    "不知道哪种更糟。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1779
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d6c81762:

    # "I don’t really want to talk to Mrs van Dijk about this (letting her know about my love life sounds horribly awkward), but I don’t think there’s much point in trying to pretend I’ve not been getting on with Merel."
    "我实在不想跟她聊这个。让她知道我的恋爱生活，听着就尴尬得要命。可再装作和梅蕾尔关系不好，好像也没意义。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1780
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_88fb8dc6:

    # "My mother always taught me not to lie, and I doubt Mrs van Dijk would appreciate it, so..."
    "妈妈一直教我别说谎，范戴克太太想必也不喜欢听谎话，所以……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1790
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0fa54f39:

    # Nienke "W-Well, um... Y-You’re... not wrong."
    Nienke "这、这个……您、您……没说错。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1792
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5253af7e:

    # Nienke "I have been getting on well with Merel, yes. I thought she would be annoying at first, s-since she’s a relative stranger, but..."
    Nienke "我和梅蕾尔现在相处得不错。一开始以为她会很烦，毕、毕竟还不熟，可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1794
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_19357aad:

    # Nienke "I...{w} guess she isn’t as bad as I imagined?"
    Nienke "我……{w}觉得她没想象中那么糟吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1796
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b9df7ecd:

    # VD "Well said."
    VD "这话说得好。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1800
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d43eee3c:

    # VD "Now, you mark my words, Nienke. I know I must seem like little but a crotchety old lady to you, but I’ve lived a long time, and I do know what I’m talking about."
    VD "妮恩克，记住我的话。你大概只觉得我是个爱发脾气的老太太，可我活了这么多年，说话还是有点根据的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1801
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_571cb655:

    # VD "I know you’ve been feeling blue ever since Cornelia left for Utrecht—"
    VD "科妮莉娅去了乌得勒支以后，你一直闷闷不乐，我知道——"

# chapter3.rpyc:1803
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c54f7593:

    # "Sh-She knows about that, too?! How obvious am I?!"
    "连、连这个都知道？！我到底有多明显啊？！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1807
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_367907e4:

    # VD "—but Merel’s company has perked you right up. You’re like a little flower which has finally seen a bit of sunshine!"
    VD "——可有了梅蕾尔陪着，你一下就精神了。像朵终于晒到太阳的小花！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1809
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1e0f559f:

    # "Hmm. So, she says I’m like a flower, does she?"
    "嗯，说我像花啊？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1811
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_84fcfbb8:

    # "That’s interesting. Is she harkening back to that old biology experiment?"
    "有意思。她是不是想起从前那次生物实验了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1813
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_563f7090:

    # "I remember telling Mrs van Dijk about it, during our old piano lessons."
    "以前上钢琴课，我记得跟她讲过。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1814
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_39e8dbfd:

    # "I was rather frustrated about that: upset that my sunflower was shunted off the windowsill, and relegated to the dark, dusty storage cupboard."
    "那时很不甘心。我的向日葵被从窗台上挪走，塞进又黑又落灰的储物柜。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1815
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1dcd55c8:

    # "I felt like I’d failed my poor sunflower: especially when it grew up short and stilted, unlike Hendrik’s, Hans’s, and Cornelia’s."
    "它长得矮小瘦弱，跟亨德里克、汉斯，还有科妮莉娅的都不一样。我觉得自己辜负了那株可怜的小花。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1817
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2667adc4:

    # "Everybody else’s sunflowers grew, but mine didn’t. It languished instead, the leaves brittle and anaemic, the stem too skinny to properly support its head."
    "别人的都在长，只有我的没有。叶子脆弱苍白，茎细得撑不住头，一天天萎靡下去。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1818
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e898acbf:

    # "I don’t think my sunflower ever even developed any petals. It never had a chance. It was shut up in the dark."
    "它好像连花瓣都没长出来过。被关在黑暗里，根本没有机会。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1820
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_da4a843a:

    # "I wonder if Mrs van Dijk likened me to my poor sunflower. It’s true, I have been feeling blue since Cornelia left, but seeing Merel has filled me with a newfound sense of purpose."
    "范戴克太太是把我比作那株向日葵了吗？科妮莉娅走后，我确实一直低落。可见到梅蕾尔以后，心里又有了新的盼头。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1822
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_daac4512:

    # "It sounds corny, I know, but being with her makes me happy."
    "我知道，听着挺俗，可跟她在一起，我就是开心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1823
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_eceb58b1:

    # "She makes me smile — and Mrs van Dijk, in her wisdom, has determined that."
    "她让我笑起来，而范戴克太太慧眼如炬，已经看穿了这一点。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1825
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8e0569c7:

    # "She’s seen right through me, with those sharp eyes of hers, which haven’t been blunted by time’s passage."
    "那双没被岁月磨钝的锐利眼睛，把我看了个透。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1826
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c4c4b692:

    # "She knows exactly how I feel, which might be why her smile is so knowing when she says..."
    "她完全知道我是什么心情，所以说话时，笑得那么了然……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1828
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1f845ccf:

    # VD "Listen to me, Nienke. If you like that Merel girl, then I have only one piece of advice for you. You can’t afford to let her go."
    VD "听着，妮恩克。如果你喜欢梅蕾尔那个姑娘，我只有一句劝告：别让她从你身边溜走。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1830
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c81e48eb:

    # Nienke "L-Let her go?"
    Nienke "让、让她溜走？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1832
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a89f3095:

    # VD "Yes, indeed. I’ve not seen you this happy in a long time, dear. I’ve been worried about you, here in Alpenrose on your own."
    VD "没错。亲爱的，很久没见你这么高兴了。看你一个人留在阿尔彭罗瑟，我一直不放心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1836
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9f71a927:

    # VD "It’s a small village, and though it is rather pretty, there’s precious little for a girl your age to do or aspire to."
    VD "村子是漂亮，可地方小，你这个年纪的姑娘，在这里能做的、能盼的，实在不多。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1837
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cbf240ac:

    # VD "Fleur de Lys is pleasant enough, but I’m unsure whether this is what you want to do for the rest of your life: working at your parents’ café."
    VD "百合花也不错，可一辈子替爸妈打理咖啡馆，到底是不是你想要的，我不知道。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1839
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_305c91fa:

    # VD "I always had the impression you had bigger dreams than this, a smart girl like yourself, but you were unsure how to realise them."
    VD "你这么聪明，我一直觉得，你的梦想不止这些，只是不知道该怎么实现。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1843
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1a2a5274:

    # VD "For a while, you were drifting..."
    VD "有一阵子，你一直没有方向……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1845
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a2c492bd:

    # VD "But it seems like Merel has been able to grant you some stability."
    VD "不过，梅蕾尔好像让你安定了一点。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1847
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_36ded6b9:

    # VD "She has made you smile, which might not seem all that important, I suppose, in the grand scheme of things. You might think that a smile is not worth all that much: that they are easy enough to come by..."
    VD "她能让你笑。放到整个人生里，这似乎不算什么大事。你或许觉得，一个笑容不值多少钱，想要总会有……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1851
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1f2d7b3d:

    # VD "But when you reach an advanced age like myself, you will soon realise that these small moments of happiness are what truly makes life worth living."
    VD "可等你活到我这个岁数，就会明白。正是这些小小的快乐，才让人觉得日子值得过。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1853
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_98e3d363:

    # VD "A person who can make you smile like that is worth their weight in gold."
    VD "能让你这样笑的人，千金难换。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1855
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7f17bedf:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, um... O-Of course. I, um, appreciate the advice — and I am very glad that you care so much. It’s very kind of you...?"
    Nienke "啊，嗯……当、当然。谢谢您的建议。您这么关心我，我真的很高兴。您……太好了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1856
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fb572114:

    # VD "Well, of course I care about you! I am very fond of you, Nienke."
    VD "我当然关心你！妮恩克，我很疼你这个孩子。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1860
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c55d21f8:

    # VD "We might not be related, but part of me does regard you as a daughter. I’ve seen you grow up: you and Cornelia both. I care for you, dear, though you might think me incapable of caring about anything."
    VD "虽然没有血缘，可心里有一部分，真把你当女儿。我看着你长大，也看着科妮莉娅长大。我在乎你，孩子，哪怕你觉得我根本不会在乎任何事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1861
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_abd0834f:

    # VD "I know I might seem dried up to you: positively dessicated..."
    VD "我知道，在你眼里，我大概已经干巴巴的，像枯透了一样……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1863
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cf96b570:

    # VD "But, though I never had children, I do see you as a daughter of sorts. You are precious to me, and I want you to be happy. Nothing would bring me more joy..."
    VD "可就算没生过孩子，我也把你当半个女儿。你对我很重要，我希望你幸福。没有什么比这更让我高兴……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1867
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c746abf4:

    # VD "Apart from another cup of Darjeeling, maybe. Do you think you could fetch that for me? I would be most obliged."
    VD "也许，再来一杯大吉岭茶除外。能替我拿来吗？那就感激不尽了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1869
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d36b49fb:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, um, y-yes! R-Right away!"
    Nienke "啊，嗯，好、好的！马、马上来！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1877
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d482d1d2:

    # "I bow my head to Mrs van Dijk, with the realisation that I’m being dismissed. She no longer requires my company, though that might be a good thing."
    "我低头向她致意，明白谈话到此结束。她不需要我再陪着了，也许正好。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1879
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9b32068a:

    # "I’m so flushed, I imagine my face must look similar to my mother’s home made jam; the thick, chunky stuff that we spread on our scones."
    "我的脸这么红，肯定像妈妈自制的果酱，那种厚厚的、带着大块果肉，抹在司康上的果酱。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1881
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0ae60656:

    # "I don’t doubt that Mrs van Dijk wants another cup of tea (she often has two), but I get the feeling she’s granting me a reprieve."
    "她想再喝杯茶，我倒不怀疑，平时也经常喝两杯。可总觉得，她是特意放我一马。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1883
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_06d03463:

    # "She’s giving me an excuse to escape her company so I can gather my thoughts. I appreciate her concern, but..."
    "给我个借口离开，好理清思绪。我很感激这份体贴，可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1896
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_18333367:

    # Merel "Hey, Nienke! Didja finish up with Mrs VD? The old woman’s doing alright, isn’t she?"
    Merel "喂，妮恩克！跟范太太聊完啦？老太太没事吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1898
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e6430f37:

    # Nienke "O-Oh...!"
    Nienke "啊……！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1900
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6337be50:

    # "I can’t go skulking off on my own: not with Merel here."
    "有梅蕾尔在，我就没法一个人悄悄躲开。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1905
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a01c6db0:

    # "Her eyes catch my own, a small smile playing about her lips which looks a little too knowing."
    "她对上我的视线，唇边那点笑容，也太像知道了什么。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1907
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_781f8b66:

    # "Did she hear what Mrs van Dijk said to me?"
    "她听见范戴克太太的话了吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1909
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_05fb68ce:

    # "I hope not."
    "希望没有。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1911
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_59489c5c:

    # "I stuggle with words, red-faced, while a concerned Merel says..."
    "我红着脸，说不出完整的话。她有点担心地问……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1913
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_83a52eeb:

    # Merel "Are you alright? Mrs van Dijk didn’t give you another scolding, did she?"
    Merel "没事吧？范戴克太太没又训你吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1915
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6fa9d0f8:

    # Merel "I would say you look like you’ve seen a ghost, but your face is so red you could’ve been sunburned!"
    Merel "本来想说你像见鬼了，可脸这么红，更像晒伤了耶！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1916
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_23b22a84_1:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, no, um..."
    Nienke "啊，没有，嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1924
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e1ff833b:

    # "I take a step back from Merel, perturbed — and, in so doing, I manage to bump against a table behind me."
    "我慌乱地往后退一步，结果撞上身后的桌子。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1926
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1cd80e3e:

    # "The table isn’t occupied, fortunately, but the table still judders, and a flash of pain goes through my thigh."
    "幸好那桌没人，不过桌子还是一晃，大腿猛地一痛。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1928
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6c4330e4:

    # "Wow. Real smooth, Nienke: {i}not.{/i}"
    "真行啊，妮恩克，真是从容得{i}不得了{/i}。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1930
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_95001566:

    # Nienke "I-It’s all fine. You don’t need to worry."
    Nienke "没、没事。不用担心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1932
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f741c128:

    # Merel "Are you sure? You don’t look fine to me!"
    Merel "确定吗？我看着可不像没事！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1934
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d87b25d6:

    # Nienke "W-Well, I am! Everything is perfectly alright. I’m alright. N-Now, if you’ll excuse me, I need to get Mrs van Dijk her tea!"
    Nienke "我、我就是没事！一切都好，我也好！现、现在，请让一下，我得给范戴克太太拿茶！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1936
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e465bcc9:

    # Merel "What? Are you sure there’s nothing going on? Hey, Nienke...!"
    Merel "啊？真的什么事都没有？喂，妮恩克……！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1949
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8fa79114:

    # "Merel calls after me, but to little avail."
    "梅蕾尔在背后叫我，可没什么用。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1950
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d0a4d39a:

    # "I turn on my heels, then go striding off, the hem of my dark maid’s skirt fluttering around my legs."
    "我转身大步走开，深色女仆裙的下摆在腿边翻飞。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1951
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ddf9fcfb:

    # "I’m glad that Merel cares so much about me, but in this precise moment, I wish that she wouldn’t."
    "她这么关心我，我很高兴。可偏偏这一刻，真希望她别这么关心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1952
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5bfa19d3:

    # "Doesn’t she know that she’s the cause of my current flustered state?!"
    "不知道我现在慌成这样，就是她害的吗？！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1953
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fb2c7a40:

    # "If I’m acting unlike myself, it’s because of her! She’s gotten me all worked up, so it’s hard for me to even look at her!"
    "如果我不像平时的自己，全是因为她！把我弄得心乱如麻，连看她一眼都难！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1954
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0d5dbcb3:

    # "Ah, geez! I never knew that working with the girl I have a crush on would be so hard!!!"
    "啊，真是的！从来不知道，跟喜欢的女孩一起工作会这么难！！！"

# chapter3.rpyc:1969
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f8c70f3f:

    # "Despite Merel’s teasing and Mrs van Dijk’s knowing looks, the rest of the work day goes by with little incident."
    "虽然梅蕾尔一直逗我，范戴克太太也总投来会心的目光，可剩下的工作时间，倒没出什么事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1970
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cb3c6891:

    # "I finish up my work at around 17:00, same as always, and then I spend the next half hour cleaning up around the café: wiping down the tabletops and dusting the floor."
    "和往常一样，下午五点左右结束服务，再花半小时打扫店里，擦桌子，清理地板。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1971
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f580d61b:

    # "Merel helps me, humming to herself all the while: a jaunty tune which sounds vaguely familiar, but I can’t quite place."
    "梅蕾尔帮着我，一边哼歌。曲调轻快，隐约耳熟，却想不起在哪儿听过。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1972
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c98036df:

    # "We pass the evening idly, playing Scrabble in the kitchen with my parents while Engelmund perches on Merel’s lap."
    "晚上，我们在厨房陪爸妈玩拼字游戏，悠闲地消磨时间，恩格尔蒙德窝在梅蕾尔腿上。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1973
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e7fa93ff:

    # "It’s nominally fun, I guess, for the first twenty minutes or so..."
    "大概还算好玩吧，至少前二十分钟如此……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1985
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aaee3de6:

    # "But the game gets hijacked in the beginning of the second round, when my dad decides to play a pretty fancy word."
    "可第二轮一开始，爸爸决定拼个花哨的长词，整个游戏就被他带跑了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1986
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0d537bfd:

    # "He was holding onto his tiles for a while, making teeny-tiny words like {b}HAS{/b} and {b}WHY{/b} which only netted him a pitiful handful of points, all for this big play."
    "为了憋这一手，他一直攥着字母块，只拼些 {b}HAS{/b}、{b}WHY{/b} 这样的小词，得分少得可怜。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1988
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bb119151:

    # "His impressively long word, which cuts across the left-hand side of the board, reads..."
    "如今，这个长得惊人的单词横跨棋盘左侧，拼出来的是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1989
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a34d938b:

    # Elowen "Darling...?"
    Elowen "亲爱的……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:1990
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c8d19891:

    # "My mother tilts her head as she examines my father’s latest play."
    "妈妈歪着头，打量爸爸刚拼出的词。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1992
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b1ddd8c5:

    # Elowen "That’s quite the long word. You really were hoarding your tiles, hehe..."
    Elowen "这词可真够长的。难怪一直攒着字母块，呵呵……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1993
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_658f794b:

    # Elowen "But it’s not the most impressive play. It doesn’t have any higher value letters, and it only lands on one double word score tile."
    Elowen "不过得分没多惊人，没有高分字母，也只占了一个单词双倍格。"

# chapter3.rpyc:1994
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_69535d23:

    # Elowen "All in all, that looks like..."
    Elowen "加起来，应该是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:1998
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fdc35823:

    # Nienke "Eighteen points."
    Nienke "十八分。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2000
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f6b2c6aa:

    # Nienke "I was counting."
    Nienke "我算过了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2002
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d48e0ccb:

    # Elowen "Right. Eighteen. Let me jot that down..."
    Elowen "对，十八分。我记一下……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2004
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c9fd1715:

    # "My mother does, her head bent, her hair falling over her shoulder."
    "妈妈低头写下分数，头发垂过肩膀。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2005
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e9db2731:

    # "She’s been taking a note of our scores during the last two games (my father’s handwriting is pretty atrocious, and I don’t trust Merel not to cheat)."
    "这两局都是她负责记分。爸爸的字太难看，梅蕾尔会不会作弊，我又信不过。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2006
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8d73b865:

    # "She tallies up my father’s total score, then frowns."
    "她算了算爸爸的总分，皱起眉。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2007
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_07cd42e6:

    # Elowen "Hmm. With that last play, you’re at thirty-one points now. It did give you quite the boost, but you’re still in last place."
    Elowen "嗯，加上刚才这手，现在三十一分。倒是涨了不少，可还是最后一名。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2008
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e5b81c7a:

    # Elowen "Why did you wait such a long time to play this word in particular, dear? Did you have some sort of strategy?"
    Elowen "亲爱的，为什么等了这么久，非要拼这个词？有什么策略吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2010
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7c13088c:

    # Merel "Yeah! I’m kinda curious too. Were you hopin’ you could be sneaky an’ scrape a victory at the end?"
    Merel "是呀，我也好奇！是想偷偷留一手，最后险胜吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2011
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c5408ffd:

    # Emiel "Ahaha... Not quite."
    Emiel "啊哈哈……倒不是。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2013
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_94d318a7:

    # Emiel "I figured I would probably lose this round, since my first plays were so weak."
    Emiel "前几手太弱了，我就觉得这局多半得输。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2014
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_37e86152:

    # Emiel "I wasn’t aiming for a last minute victory or anything. That isn’t really my style."
    Emiel "没打算最后关头翻盘什么的，那不是我的作风。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2016
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5c743fe3:

    # Emiel "I prefer to be in the shadows. I was like that when I was younger, and I used to spend all that time with your father, Merel."
    Emiel "我更喜欢待在不显眼的地方。年轻时跟你爸爸经常一起玩，也这样，梅蕾尔。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2017
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_edebc92d:

    # Emiel "Bastian really could talk for the Netherlands. If it was a national sport, he would win first place."
    Emiel "巴斯蒂安那张嘴，都能代表荷兰去比赛。要是唠嗑算国家项目，他肯定拿第一。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2018
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1a192713:

    # Emiel "I was fine hanging back and nodding at whatever he said..."
    Emiel "我在旁边听着，点点头，就挺好……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2020
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_32eaa7b9:

    # Emiel "And I’m fine losing in Scrabble, too, if my family and Bastian’s charming daughter can come out on top."
    Emiel "拼字游戏也一样。家里人，还有巴斯蒂安这位可爱的女儿能赢，我输也没关系。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2021
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6b49bc52:

    # Emiel "I just thought it was too good of a play to pass up on, that’s all: especially with Elowen right here."
    Emiel "只是觉得，这个词实在不舍得错过。尤其艾洛温就在旁边。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2023
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6e714301:

    # Emiel "It was a move dedicated to you, so, um...{w} I hope my feelings got across, haha."
    Emiel "这一手是特意献给你的，所以，嗯……{w}希望心意传达到了，哈哈。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2024
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_20c840e2:

    # "My dad laughs awkwardly, now scratching his cheek with one hand, while my mother blinks."
    "爸爸尴尬地笑着，抬手挠挠脸。妈妈眨了眨眼。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2025
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9ab68541:

    # "There’s a pause, and then..."
    "停顿片刻后……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2026
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_51a421f1:

    # Elowen "Goodness me! Was that a confession, dear?"
    Elowen "哎呀！亲爱的，这是在告白吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2028
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_895c311d:

    # Emiel "W-Well, I think I’m past the point where I need to confess to you. We {i}have{/i} been married for twenty-five years, haha..."
    Emiel "这、这个，都到这份上了，好像不用再告白了吧。我们{i}毕竟{/i}结婚二十五年了，哈哈……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2029
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_569ef0b0:

    # Emiel "But maybe you could see it as an affirmation of my feelings."
    Emiel "不过，也可以当作又表了一次心意。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2030
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1affe3f4:

    # Emiel "I just want you to know, Elowen, that you’re very dear to me, and I will always cherish you."
    Emiel "艾洛温，我只是想让你知道，你对我非常重要，我会一直珍惜你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2032
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6417e364:

    # Elowen "Oh, Emiel {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Elowen "埃米尔，真是的{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2033
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2ad650be:

    # "My mother sighs (she’s practically swooning), while I groan."
    "妈妈叹息着，几乎都要陶醉了，我却忍不住哼了一声。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2035
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a888381e:

    # "Why do my parents need to lay on the sap so thick, anyway? It’s embarrassing: especially when it wasn’t so long ago that I shared a kiss with Merel myself."
    "爸妈干吗要甜腻成这样啊？太难为情了。尤其我自己不久前，才跟梅蕾尔接过吻。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2036
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3e77b197:

    # "I thought I was having my own summer love story here, but it feels like my parents are trying to upstage me!"
    "还以为正在上演属于我的夏日恋曲，结果爸妈居然跑来抢戏！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2037
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_74acdf27:

    # "It’s not fair..."
    "不公平……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2039
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ffdbad26:

    # Merel "Aw, that’s so cute. You two are so lovey-dovey, hehe."
    Merel "哎呀，好可爱。你们俩真恩爱，嘿嘿。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2041
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5359e48d:

    # Merel "I wish my parents got on that well!"
    Merel "真希望我爸妈也能处得这么好！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2043
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_200f5838:

    # "And, to make matters worse, Merel is encouraging them!"
    "更过分的是，梅蕾尔还在给他们捧场！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2044
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2369a119:

    # "What’s wrong with her?! Don’t tell me she’s {i}enjoying{/i} this?"
    "她怎么回事？！不会还{i}看得很开心{/i}吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2046
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ff8ed941:

    # Emiel "Oh? Are Bastian and Marieke having problems?"
    Emiel "哦？巴斯蒂安和玛丽克闹矛盾了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2048
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8a0751df:

    # Merel "No more than usual."
    Merel "也没比平时更多。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2050
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f30083e6:

    # Merel "I know they love one another a lot, but they argue a whole bunch: probably because my dad’s such a know-it-all."
    Merel "我知道他们很爱对方，可就是老吵。大概因为我爸太爱装万事通吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2052
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8df065e3:

    # Merel "In fact, he’s a real..."
    Merel "说真的，他简直是个……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2053
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2b692592:

    # "Merel glances down at her assorted words, then grins."
    "梅蕾尔低头看看自己的字母块，咧嘴一笑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2054
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9b616c45:

    # "She selects a few of them, then makes a word with Dad’s {b}DARLING{/b}, running horizontally through it."
    "她挑出几块，借用爸爸那个表示“亲爱的”的 {b}DARLING{/b}，横着交叉拼出一个词。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2055
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7ac193b8:

    # "I lean in, frowning, as Merel takes her play."
    "我皱着眉凑近，看她这一手。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2056
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8a212caf:

    # "{b}PLAGUE.{/b}"
    "{b}PLAGUE。{/b}灾星。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2057
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_924effc3:

    # "Merel’s word is a lot shorter than Dad’s, but it uses a rarer tile in the U, and it runs through a double {i}and{/i} a triple word multipler."
    "这词比爸爸的短，却用了更少见的 U，还跨过了单词双倍{i}和{/i}三倍格。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2058
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_577a40c6:

    # "It looks like Merel’s turn has netted her a cool..."
    "看来，这一手让她一口气拿到了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2061
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e2344419:

    # Nienke "Fifty-four points?!"
    Nienke "五十四分？！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2063
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_abab0db5:

    # Merel "Heh. An’ I said I wasn’t any good at these word games. I guess my old man is good for somethin’ after all!"
    Merel "嘿，亏我还说不擅长这种文字游戏。看来我家老头还是有点用嘛！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2065
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f0c58362:

    # Emiel "Haha. Somehow, it feels like I’m being overshadowed by Bastian again..."
    Emiel "哈哈，怎么觉得，又被巴斯蒂安抢了风头……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2066
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_45854c56:

    # Emiel "But I suppose I’m used to it. That’s what my whole childhood was like."
    Emiel "不过，也习惯了。我整个童年都这样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2067
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_00202ce2:

    # Elowen "Oh, don’t be so down, dear. Merel might have beaten you handily, but I liked your last play."
    Elowen "别灰心，亲爱的。梅蕾尔是赢得漂亮，可我喜欢你刚才那一手。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2068
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_51c047bb:

    # Emiel "Y-You did?"
    Emiel "真、真的？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2069
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e3250b3f:

    # Elowen "Of course! I thought it was very romantic, hehe~"
    Elowen "当然啦！很浪漫，呵呵～"

# chapter3.rpyc:2071
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_add9412a:

    # "My mother giggles, her face flushed with girlish delight, while I sigh."
    "妈妈笑得脸颊微红，像个欢喜的小姑娘，我则叹了口气。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2073
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_40c848ee:

    # "I love my family, but sometimes, they really do get on my nerves."
    "我爱家里人，可有时候，他们也真的很让人受不了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2074
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f60f02a6:

    # "Why do they always have to make such a show about being unbearably in love with one another?"
    "为什么非得把这种腻得要命的恩爱，摆出来给人看啊？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2076
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b7f3b0b9:

    # "...Well, whatever. It’s not worth getting hung up about."
    "……算了，不值得纠结。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2084
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9dbf82f4:

    # "The rest of the evening slips by quietly enough, despite my simmering resentment about my parents and their overt flirting."
    "虽然心里还在嘀咕爸妈明目张胆的调情，剩下的夜晚倒也安安静静地过去了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2088
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_88d5a69c:

    # "I rise once I’ve finished another round of Scrabble (it’s definitely possible to play too much of it) and stretch."
    "又玩完一局拼字游戏，我站起来伸个懒腰。这东西玩多了，确实也会腻。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2089
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b213be06:

    # "I have a bath, which I sit in for a good while, and return to my bedroom a little flushed."
    "我去泡了个澡，泡了好一会儿，回房时脸还有些红。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2090
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dddb5175:

    # "Merel has a bath after me, though she doesn’t luxuriate in the tub. She’s in and out in about ten minutes, which seems like a suspiciously short time."
    "梅蕾尔在我之后去，却没在浴缸里慢慢享受。十分钟左右就进进出出一趟，快得可疑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2091
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_007aa0b7:

    # "She has even longer hair than I do. How in the world can she clean it so quickly?"
    "她头发比我还长，到底怎么洗得这么快？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2092
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3f6000b9:

    # "I’m curious, but I’m not curious enough to ask questions. I don’t want to be rude, and I’m not all that interested."
    "好奇归好奇，也没到要开口问的地步。不想失礼，也没那么在意。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2093
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_89fa4114:

    # "I’m so tired I’d rather turn in for bed."
    "我太困了，只想睡觉。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2094
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a2e6200a:

    # "I lie beneath the covers, my mask over my eyes, and try to rest. I mean to drift off, cocooned beneath my sheets..."
    "钻进被窝，戴好眼罩，试着休息。想被床单裹着，慢慢沉入梦乡……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2101
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6bf0aed4:

    # "But that night, I have a peculiar dream."
    "可那天夜里，我做了个奇怪的梦。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2105
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9604c212:

    # "In my dream, I’m also lying in a bed, but it isn’t the bed in my own room, which Engelmund so often stakes as his own."
    "梦里，我也躺在床上，却不是自己房间里那张总被恩格尔蒙德霸占的床。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2106
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f4981e2e:

    # "It’s a small bed with a mean wooden frame."
    "那是一张小床，木头床架简陋。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2107
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bf59a811:

    # "The bed isn’t the only thing that’s smaller in my dream, either. I am, too."
    "梦中变小的，也不只有床。我也小了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2108
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b6587940:

    # "I feel as though I’ve shrunk to almost half my size: a diminutive version of myself which wilts under the weight of my own body."
    "仿佛缩到原来一半，一个小小的自己，连自身的重量都快承受不起。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2109
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6b0935e6:

    # "I’m so enfeebled, my forehead so flushed, that I can’t sit up. An awful lethargy claims my limbs that’s so intense that the mere act of breathing feels like too much effort."
    "虚弱得厉害，额头滚烫，连坐起来都做不到。可怕的倦意占据四肢，连呼吸都费力。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2110
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_94dc0958:

    # "It hurts."
    "好疼。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2111
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_205fb4de:

    # "My chest aches, and I can’t raise my hands. I can barely even twitch my fingers..."
    "胸口发痛，手抬不起来，连指头都几乎动不了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2121
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_226034c2:

    # "But I’m still seized with an intense desperation: not just for my sake, but for the sake of the girl sitting beside me."
    "可我还是被强烈的绝望攥住。不光为了自己，也为了坐在旁边的女孩。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2122
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_73986b78:

    # "I stare at her, my eyes wide with a raw, almost animal sort of panic, as I cry..."
    "我睁大眼盯着她，眼里满是近乎小动物本能的惊恐，叫道……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2123
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1b73ed83:

    # Nienke "{i}What? They’re going to make me leave?{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}什么？他们要带我走？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2124
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3511da45:

    # W "{i}That’s what I heard, yes.{/i}"
    W "{i}嗯，我听到的是这样。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2125
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_14a03b81:

    # "The girl sitting next to me — the girl with the elfin ears and the long fair hair — says, with a brief nod of her head."
    "坐在旁边的女孩，长着精灵耳朵，留着浅色长发，轻轻点了点头。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2126
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6210ce1c:

    # W "{i}It’s what your dad said, at least... but I don’t think he meant for me to hear him.{/i}"
    W "{i}至少你爸爸是这么说的……不过，他应该没想让我听见。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2127
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_69868e7d:

    # W "{i}He came over to see my folks last night, so I heard ’em talkin’. Your dad sounded really worried. He said you were super sick, Niene, an’ nobody knew what the issue was.{/i}"
    W "{i}昨晚他来找我爸妈，我听见他们说话了。你爸爸特别担心，说你病得很重，妮妮，可没人知道到底怎么了。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2128
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0353b12f:

    # W "{i}He told my folks, if they didn’t leave, you might die. He said...{/i}"
    W "{i}他跟我爸妈说，再不走，你可能会死。他说……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2129
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_64d6b2fa:

    # "The girl beside me sniffles. Her fingers curl into fists, resting on her lap, and with damp eyes she says..."
    "女孩吸了吸鼻子，放在膝上的手攥成拳，眼睛湿漉漉的，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2130
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a7d0dfca:

    # W "{i}He said you might die!{/i}"
    W "{i}他说，你可能会死！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2131
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_786b284a:

    # Nienke "{i}What...?{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}什么……？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2132
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_22984c6b:

    # "I stare at the girl sitting beside me, my eyes comically wide. My breath catches in my throat, and I feel my head swimming."
    "我盯着身旁的女孩，眼睛睁得大得可笑。呼吸卡在喉咙里，脑袋一阵发晕。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2133
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a28d516e:

    # "Die...?"
    "死……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2134
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7c270088:

    # "Will I really?"
    "我真的会吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2135
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f7ebdf94:

    # "It’s true that I have been feeling tired and lot lately, and achey, but death is a foreign concept I can’t wrap my head around."
    "最近是总觉得累，浑身也疼，可死亡太陌生，我没法理解。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2136
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_875368ac:

    # "Isn’t death something which happens to very old men and women? I’m much too young to think about such things."
    "不是只有很老很老的爷爷奶奶才会死吗？我还这么小，不该想这些。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2137
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_230ac40b:

    # "I can’t die. It’s not possible. I’ll be alright, so..."
    "我不会死，不可能。我会没事的，所以……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2138
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_81b5e299:

    # Nienke "{i}I don’t want to go, though! Please, don’t make me!{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}可我不想走！求求你，别让我走！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2139
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dacd6590:

    # Nienke "{i}What about our promise?! You said we’d always stay together! You said—{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}那我们的约定呢？！你说过会永远在一起！你说过——{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2140
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9e077f79:

    # W "...dy?"
    W "……下？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2141
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b5fb5f48:

    # Nienke "{i}I don’t wanna leave...!{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}我不想离开……！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2142
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8067cb39:

    # W "—me, milady? It’s time to—"
    W "——殿下？打扰了，该——"

# chapter3.rpyc:2143
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f455049e:

    # Nienke "{i}I don’t—{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}我不——{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2156
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_86afa870:

    # W "Excuse me, milady? I apologise for disturbing you, but it is time that you awoke."
    W "殿下，打扰了。很抱歉惊扰您的清梦，不过，该起身了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2157
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7a38ce2f:

    # W "The sun is high in the sky already, and the birds are beginning to sing. You do not want to spend the day lying in bed, do you?"
    W "太阳已经高挂，鸟儿也开始歌唱。您总不想一整天都躺在床上吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2162
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_91697d37:

    # Nienke "Nn..."
    Nienke "嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2163
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_80f70a37:

    # "I wince, my eyelids fluttering, as I feel hands about my shoulders and hear a voice in my ear."
    "肩上落着双手，耳边传来声音，我皱了皱脸，眼皮轻颤。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2165
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3f98a808:

    # "I think I recognise that voice — or, at the very least, I feel like I should. There’s something warm about it; something reassuring..."
    "这个声音，我好像认得。至少，应该认得。里面有种温暖，让人安心……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2166
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_351286df:

    # "But isn’t it a bit too mannered?"
    "可是，说话是不是太讲究了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2172
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d1912a5e:

    # "I blink groggily, still half-asleep, and look up at Merel."
    "我还半梦半醒，昏沉地眨眼，抬头望向梅蕾尔。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2185
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_46ed3ee0:

    # "She’s standing by my bedside, as I expected, a gentle smile on her face."
    "果然，她站在床边，脸上带着温柔的笑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2186
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d67eaad3:

    # "Her hands are resting on my shoulders, her fingers splayed in a manner which is almost possessive, but she draws back when my eyelids flicker open."
    "双手放在我的肩上，张开的手指甚至有点占有的意味。不过我一睁眼，她就收回了手。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2192
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b9886915:

    # "I examine her, my brow furrowed, while Merel looks at me in turn. She smiles, then says..."
    "我皱眉打量她，她也看着我，微笑着说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2193
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_34a32339:

    # Merel "Good morning, Sleeping Beauty. It is very good to see you amongst the ranks of the living once more, hehe. How are you feeling this morning?"
    Merel "早安，睡美人。很高兴见您重返人间，呵呵。今天早上感觉如何？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2195
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_279b3254_1:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, um..."
    Nienke "啊，嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2196
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d540c5de:

    # "I’m feeling a little weird, truth be told: especially since Merel is talking like that. I don’t know if it really suits her, but maybe it’s not my place to say anything."
    "说真的，有点奇怪，尤其她还这么说话。不知道合不合适她，不过我好像也没什么好评价的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2198
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_395f971d:

    # "Instead, I mumble a shy..."
    "只羞怯地低声答了一句……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2200
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0aa4e090:

    # Nienke "I’m...{w} feeling alright, thank you."
    Nienke "我……{w}还好，谢谢。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2202
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aaaaffa0:

    # Merel "You are?"
    Merel "是吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2204
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aa3b054a:

    # Nienke "Yeah, mm... M’just..."
    Nienke "嗯，唔……就是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2208
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f3d47f6f:

    # "A yawn."
    "打了个哈欠。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2209
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bf7f50ba:

    # Nienke "A-A little sleepy, that’s all."
    Nienke "有、有点困而已。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2211
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2d3ed906:

    # Merel "Well, that is to be expected. I {i}did{/i} only just awake you, and you have been very busy these last few days."
    Merel "那也是自然。毕竟我{i}才{/i}刚叫醒您，这几天您又一直很忙。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2213
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_83f33ebd:

    # Merel "I can well imagine that you would feel tired, after all of the running about we have been doing recently..."
    Merel "最近我们来来回回跑了那么多路，您会疲惫，我完全能理解……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2217
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_470aa49d:

    # Merel "But never you mind, milady. I am here, and I am determined to look after you — so long as you will let me, that is."
    Merel "不过不用担心，殿下。有我在，我一定会照顾好您。当然，得您愿意才行。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2219
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_96a0d6c9:

    # Merel "Now, would you like me to help you with your hair?"
    Merel "现在，要我替您打理头发吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2223
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5766ef5b:

    # Merel "It must take you ages to brush through all of that, so you ought to let me lend a hand. I am rather tough, you see, and I do not get tired easily!"
    Merel "这么长的头发，一定很费工夫，就让我帮一把吧。我身体结实，可没那么容易累！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2224
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_227cc132:

    # "Merel flexes her biceps as proof, a bright grin curving the corners of her lips."
    "她弯起胳膊，亮了亮肌肉作为证明，嘴角扬起灿烂的笑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2226
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_49771851:

    # Merel "I promise I’ll do a good job with it. I’ll be very, very gentle! You have hair fit for a princess, so you deserve a maid to help you with it..."
    Merel "保证梳得好好的，动作也会非常、非常轻！您有一头公主般的秀发，当然该有位侍女帮忙打理……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2229
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c9f863a7:

    # Merel "And I have been known to look good in a maid’s dress. Just take a look!"
    Merel "而我穿起女仆装来，也算有模有样。您看！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2231
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a9894071:

    # "Merel takes a step back, then turns neatly on the spot."
    "她后退一步，利落地转了一圈。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2232
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3604b8df:

    # "I’m still half-asleep, blinking white, gauzy spots out of my vision, so it takes a few moments to register, but..."
    "我还没完全醒，正眨眼赶走视野里白纱似的朦胧，过了几秒才反应过来……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2234
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cdf74dc7:

    # Nienke "...You’re wearing your maid’s dress?"
    Nienke "……你穿着女仆裙？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2236
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1ace353a:

    # Merel "Thaaat’s right!"
    Merel "没——错！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2238
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_21a98401:

    # Merel "I figured it’d be a fun way to wake you up, and I’m afraid I miiiiight’ve been a bit of a bother during my stay here."
    Merel "觉得这样叫你起床会很好玩。而且住在这里这几天，我大——概也添了点麻烦。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2239
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d263c071:

    # Merel "I wanna make things up to you, Nienke, for being a nuisance, so I told myself I was gonna be extra helpful to you today."
    Merel "妮恩克，我想补偿一下，所以告诉自己，今天一定要格外体贴。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2243
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ed482862:

    # Merel "I wanna be nice to you, and this is how I figured I’d go about it. Whaddaya think?"
    Merel "想对你好一点，琢磨着就这么办啦。怎么样？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2245
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_996f15ab:

    # "Merel takes hold of the black, sensible maid’s dress between both of her hands, then drops a neat curtsy. Her eyes look very soft, lined with her long, fair lashes, as she says..."
    "她双手提起规规矩矩的黑色女仆裙，端端正正地行了个屈膝礼。浅色长睫毛下，眼神柔软。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2247
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_019d2ef7:

    # Merel "Does this meet your standards, milady?"
    Merel "殿下，这样可还合您的心意？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2249
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a924da97:

    # Nienke "Pfft. And since when was I your ‘lady’?"
    Nienke "噗。我什么时候成你的“殿下”了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2250
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_06b8ffd2:

    # Merel "Since about ten minutes ago, when I decided it’d be fun to dress up like this and wake you up!"
    Merel "大概十分钟前吧，决定穿成这样来叫你起床的时候！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2252
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0ea42f45:

    # Merel "So, whaddaya think? Are you enjoying the show?"
    Merel "所以，怎么样？这场表演还喜欢吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2254
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_477a9ca0:

    # Nienke "It’s a spectacle alright. You’ve certainly given me a lot to look at."
    Nienke "倒是挺有阵仗，确实让我看了不少东西。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2255
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0abb4eb8:

    # Merel "Well, that was the general idea. Do you like what you see?"
    Merel "本来就是这个意思嘛。看着喜欢吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2257
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2dd9e02a_1:

    # Nienke "Hmm..."
    Nienke "嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2267
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6789a9c4:

    # "I frown, my lips pursed. I know Merel is just trying to keep things light, but I find myself raising an eyebrow at her antics regardless."
    "我抿着嘴蹙起眉。知道她只是想逗个乐子，还是忍不住对这番胡闹挑了挑眉。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2268
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_429fae0b:

    # "Merel might be dressed the part, but she doesn’t suit my image of the ideal servant at all. There’s nothing even remotely demure about her."
    "衣服是像，可她离我理想中的侍女形象差远了，半点也不端庄。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2269
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d1278e27:

    # "She talks far too much, and I don’t think she’d know the meaning of the word ‘deference’ if it hit her upside the head."
    "话太多，“恭顺”两个字就算拍到她脸上，她大概也不懂。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2270
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6c6110f8:

    # "I don’t think she really respects me enough for me to be her mistress, either. Mostly, she seems to find me amusing."
    "她对我好像也没尊敬到能让我当主人的程度，大多时候，只觉得我好玩。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2271
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0c039dc1:

    # "She pokes fun at me, and I pout at her, and then we both start giggling..."
    "她逗我，我噘嘴，然后两个人一起笑起来……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2272
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_92996000:

    # "But I don’t mind a bit of roleplay. I’m just about awake enough to appreciate it."
    "不过，我不介意陪她演一会儿。现在也清醒得差不多，能体会其中的乐趣了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2273
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1d3d3efa:

    # "I yawn, wiping my eyes with the back of my arm, then say..."
    "我打了个哈欠，用手背揉揉眼睛，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2283
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_078b7b1e:

    # Nienke "I guess I’ve seen worse things earlier in the morning."
    Nienke "一大早醒来，我见过比这更糟的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2285
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2cfe149e:

    # Merel "Oh yes? Like what?"
    Merel "哦？比如？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2287
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_513b31d1:

    # Nienke "Like Engelmund’s rear, when he decides to stick his behind in my face."
    Nienke "比如恩格尔蒙德的屁股。他决定把屁股对着我的脸时。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2289
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8126cc56:

    # Merel "Oh, milady! You really are a caution! You’re too amusing..."
    Merel "哎呀，殿下，您可真会说笑！太有意思了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2291
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1b6eb1ed:

    # Merel "Though I fear it isn’t very ladylike to talk of animals’ rears! Your mother, the duchess, would be most perturbed if she knew of this!"
    Merel "不过，谈论动物的屁股可不够淑女。公爵夫人要是知道了，一定很不高兴！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2293
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_220f011b:

    # "So, my mother’s a duchess in this scenario, is she?"
    "原来在这个故事里，我妈妈是公爵夫人啊？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2295
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_92fb4f14:

    # "What would that make me, then?"
    "那我又该是什么？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2296
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2d4eec78:

    # "I’m not all that clued in on the hierarchies of wealthy human families, though maybe I should be. A lot of the girls who attended the lyceum with me were rather wealthy."
    "富有人类家庭的等级，我不太清楚，也许该懂一点。毕竟中学里不少同学都挺有钱。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2297
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_818f0145:

    # "Several of the girls from the lyceum lived down that street, with politicians and lawyers and artists for fathers; doctors and accountants and actresses for mothers..."
    "有几个就住在那条街上，父亲是政客、律师、艺术家，母亲是医生、会计、演员……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2299
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c2ac8afd:

    # "But I’m getting distracted."
    "又走神了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2301
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dd4a5cce:

    # "My mother might not be a duchess, but I suppose I can always play the part of an aristocrat’s young daughter."
    "妈妈虽然不是公爵夫人，我倒也不妨演一演贵族家的小姐。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2302
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cbb3648e:

    # "I return Merel’s expression of faux surprise with a cool, narrow-eyed look as I say..."
    "面对她装出来的惊讶，我眯起眼，冷冷回望，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2304
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b2040f2f:

    # Nienke "What my mother thinks is neither here nor there, because you will not report what I have said to her. You are my loyal maid, Merel, not my mother’s, and you will answer only to me. Do I make that plain?"
    Nienke "母亲怎么想，并不重要，因为你不会把这些话传到她耳朵里。梅蕾尔，你是我的忠心侍女，不是母亲的。你只听命于我，明白了吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2306
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1882cd47:

    # Merel "Ooh, yes, milady! I understand, as plain as day! Do not dwell on your mother. She is wholly irrelevant. Why, I regret that I even brought her up at all!"
    Merel "明白，殿下，再明白不过！不用顾虑您的母亲，她与此事毫不相干。我甚至后悔提起她了！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2308
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1443204f:

    # Merel "Now, do you wish for me to serve you?"
    Merel "那么，现在需要我服侍您吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2310
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_58c16055:

    # Nienke "If you would be so kind. That is why I keep you around, after all."
    Nienke "有劳了。毕竟，把你留在身边，就是为这个。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2312
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ea55cb23:

    # Merel "Indeed, it is, and I will prove that I can earn my keep! There is nobody who cares about you more than I, milady!"
    Merel "正是，我会证明自己值得留下！殿下，没有人比我更在乎您！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2314
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bda4d1fc:

    # Merel "I am your humble servant, and it is always a pleasure to serve you. Now, would you mind sitting at your vanity table? I can better tend to your hair then!"
    Merel "我是您谦卑的侍女，能为您效劳，永远是我的荣幸。现在，请到梳妆台前坐下好吗？那样更方便替您梳头。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2316
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_19d9baed:

    # Nienke "Yes, of course. Thank you, Merel."
    Nienke "当然。谢谢，梅蕾尔。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2318
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5f3b8630:

    # Merel "Oh, it’s quite alright, milady! You hardly need to thank me. I am your maid, remember!"
    Merel "不必客气，殿下！您不用谢我。别忘了，我是您的侍女！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2320
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e8b5c362:

    # Merel "Simply being with you is payment enough for me. It’s all I need to remain happy."
    Merel "只要能陪着您，就是足够的报酬。有这一点，我便心满意足。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2333
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_07c16e2a:

    # "Merel giggles as I rise from my bed, then sit at my vanity. She follows behind me dutifully, the hem of her sensible black maid’s dress swishing."
    "我起床坐到梳妆台前，梅蕾尔笑着，尽职地跟在身后，黑色裙摆沙沙轻响。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2334
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f5d9ab50:

    # "Then, she retrieves the brush from my vanity table and introduces it to my hair."
    "她拿起台上的梳子，放到我的发间。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2335
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_330000c5:

    # "She cocks her head inquisitively, examining my reflection in the circular mirror, and says..."
    "好奇地歪着头，打量圆镜里的我，问……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2337
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_935f0248:

    # Merel "Do you mind if I begin?"
    Merel "可以开始了吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2339
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b3f1f5da:

    # Nienke "Please, do. I fail to see what you are waiting for."
    Nienke "请吧。我不明白你还在等什么。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2341
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cceda31f:

    # Merel "Why, your consent, of course! These things are very important..."
    Merel "当然是等您答应！这种事很重要……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2343
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d877d7dc:

    # Merel "But I suppose, as my mistress, caring for you in this manner is simply one of the many tasks expected of me?"
    Merel "不过，既然您是我的主人，这样照顾您，也只是我众多职责中的一项吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2345
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bc5a7b5f:

    # Nienke "Well, of course. I am glad that you know your place."
    Nienke "当然。你能明白自己的本分，我很欣慰。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2347
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_536425e8:

    # Merel "Thank you, milady! There’s not much I do know, but this is something I’m sure of!"
    Merel "谢谢殿下！我懂得不多，可这一点再清楚不过！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2349
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ca7d6385:

    # Merel "If nothing else, I know that I always want to be with you."
    Merel "至少我知道，自己永远都想陪在您身边。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2350
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_748eff98:

    # Merel "It is, and always has been, my duty to care for you..."
    Merel "照顾您，是我的职责，从来都是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2352
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f4312481:

    # Merel "My wonderful mistress {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Merel "我最美好的主人{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# chapter3.rpyc:2363
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2099803e:

    # "Merel introduces the bristles of the brush to my hair as she speaks, then begins to run it slowly through my tresses."
    "说着，她把梳齿轻轻放进发间，开始慢慢梳理。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2364
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d8286f50:

    # "She’s being very gentle about it: taking supreme care, as she moves the brush up and down, not to tug at any knots, or to yank at my hair."
    "动作非常轻柔，梳子上下移动时格外仔细，避开打结的地方，不扯痛我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2365
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_82c5cb63:

    # "She smiles softly as she works, her eyes trained on mine in the mirror. There’s something gentle about her expression; a look in her half-lidded eyes which makes my heart flutter."
    "她边梳边浅浅笑着，透过镜子望进我的眼睛。半垂的眼里有种温柔，让心轻轻发颤。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2369
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_27f3e825:

    # "Though part of me enjoys the attention, another self-conscious part of me wishes she wouldn’t bother. There’s something embarrassing about all of the attention."
    "心里有一部分享受着这份关注，另一部分却又羞得希望她别这么费心。被这么专注地看着，总有点难为情。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2370
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_782112b8:

    # "Cornelia used to play with my hair a lot when we were younger, but her childish fumbling never made my heart flutter like this."
    "小时候，科妮莉娅也经常摆弄我的头发，可那些孩子气的小动作，从没让我心跳成这样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2371
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3a33f4d4:

    # "I wonder why they feel so different...?"
    "为什么感觉差这么多呢……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2384
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a4b44882:

    # Merel "So, Nienke. I’m sure you know this already, but I figured I might as well bring it up."
    Merel "对了，妮恩克。这件事你肯定知道，不过我想，还是提一下。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2386
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b69231fb:

    # Merel "We both knew this day was coming — I’m sure you were countin’ it off, just waitin’ until you could be shot of me — so I might as well say it."
    Merel "我们都知道这一天会来。你说不定还数着日子，等着赶快甩掉我呢。所以，就直说了吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2388
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_03cb408f:

    # Merel "It’s...{w} kinda sad for me, but..."
    Merel "虽然……{w}我有点难过，不过……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2390
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9b7bac29:

    # Merel "Today’s my last full day in Alpenrose."
    Merel "今天，是我能完整待在阿尔彭罗瑟的最后一天。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2392
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_209b2f96:

    # Merel "After that, I’ll be goin’ back to Mors Paravail. I’m not sure if I’ll see you for a while..."
    Merel "之后就得回莫尔斯·帕拉维尔了，可能会有一阵子见不到你……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2394
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_187d732f:

    # Merel "But, even though we’ve gotta say goodbye, this won’t be the end of our friendship — or our relationship. I’ll still be thinkin’ about you, Nienke: I swear on it!"
    Merel "不过，就算要道别，也不代表友情，或者恋情，到这里就结束。我还是会一直想着你，妮恩克，我发誓！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2396
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c3af4807_3:

    # Nienke "Oh..."
    Nienke "啊……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2398
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ca981740:

    # "I exhale as I look at my reflection in the mirror, my eyes half-lidded."
    "我望着镜中的自己，半垂着眼，轻轻呼出一口气。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2400
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c85cd88d:

    # "I wasn’t thinking about Merel’s eventual, inevitable departure..."
    "我没在想她迟早要离开的事……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2402
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_27244e30:

    # "But, no, that’s not quite right. I {i}was{/i} thinking about it, but I tried not to."
    "不，也不对。我{i}想过{/i}，只是尽量不去想。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2404
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_932c9702:

    # "I didn’t want to ponder the inevitability of Merel leaving me, though why that is, I’m not entirely sure."
    "不愿细想梅蕾尔终究会离开，至于为什么，自己也说不准。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2406
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c1c24e91:

    # "Is it because of the kiss?"
    "是因为那个吻吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2407
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_48648a4c:

    # "My feelings for her can’t have shifted quite that much, can they?"
    "我对她的感情，真的能变那么多？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2409
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_28770b39:

    # "I’ll be the first to admit that, in the beginning, I didn’t much care for Merel. I thought her company was nothing more than an irritant. I didn’t want to spend more time with her than was strictly necessary..."
    "我不否认，最初确实不怎么喜欢她。只觉得她烦人，能少相处一刻，就少相处一刻……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2411
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a79776aa:

    # "But now, I don’t know if I can stand the thought of her going."
    "可如今，想到她要走，竟有点受不了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2413
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7510278a:

    # "It really is funny how quickly things can change. It’s funny, and it’s also a little sad."
    "变化这么快，真好笑。好笑，也有一点难过。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2415
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_393a72a9:

    # "I look at my own reflection, lost in my thoughts, as Merel continues. She smiles, still running the brush through my hair, as she says..."
    "我望着镜子出神，梅蕾尔继续说着。她微笑着，梳子仍在发间轻轻穿过。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2417
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c008ae57:

    # Merel "It’s not all doom and gloom, though! I know you’d normally be workin’ on Saturdays — Fleur de Lys only closes on Sunday, right? — but I talked things through with your folks, an’ they said they were willin’ to keep the place closed today."
    Merel "不过，也不是全都不开心！你平时周六要上班，百合花只有周日休息，对吧？我跟你爸妈商量过了，他们愿意今天也关门休息。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2419
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_605e9014:

    # Merel "That means we can spend the whole day together, just the two of us..."
    Merel "这样，我们就能一起待一整天，只有我们两个……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2421
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6bb92c49:

    # Merel "So I think we should enjoy ourselves!"
    Merel "所以，好好玩吧！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2423
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f61b194b:

    # Merel "I dunno about you, but I wanna take another look around the village. I dunno when I’ll be able to come back here next, so it’ll be nice to make some memories. What do you think?"
    Merel "不知道你怎么想，反正我还想再逛逛村子。下次能来，不知道得等多久。多留点回忆也好嘛，你说呢？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2425
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_69125667_1:

    # Nienke "Oh, um..."
    Nienke "啊，嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2427
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_29e796c8:

    # "I frown and, anxiously, I bite the inside of my cheek."
    "我皱起眉，不安地咬住脸颊内侧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2428
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0b71a596:

    # "It’s difficult to wrap my head around the knowledge that Merel will be leaving. It feels far too soon, even if there is something darkly amusing about that."
    "她就要走了，这件事很难接受。太快了，虽然这么想也实在有点讽刺。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2430
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a6221cda:

    # "In the beginning, I couldn’t wait for Merel to leave. I thought her company was exhausting, and I didn’t want anything to do with her."
    "起初，我巴不得她赶快离开。和她相处太累，根本不想扯上关系。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2432
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b35aaa0c:

    # "I wanted nothing more than for her to give me some space; for her to leave me alone."
    "只想让她留点空间，别再来烦我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2433
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_75dd5a9e:

    # "That first night, when we shared a bed together, and she kept me up from her snoring, I thought that I’d be glad to see the back of her, and I would celebrate her departure."
    "第一晚挤着睡，被她的呼噜吵得合不了眼时，我还想，等她走了，一定高兴得要庆祝。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2435
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2d16d894:

    # "That was what I hoped for..."
    "那时盼的就是这个……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2437
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2831420b:

    # "But now, after spending some time with her, I’ve come to care for her."
    "可相处过这些日子，我却开始在乎她了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2439
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_171a1b3e:

    # "I don’t want to see her leave: not so suddenly. There’s something upsetting about it."
    "我不想她走，尤其不想这么突然。心里有点难受。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2440
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d8bd3841:

    # "It’ll feel strange, saying goodbye to somebody I’ve become so close to, but..."
    "刚刚变得这么亲近，就要说再见，感觉好奇怪。可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2442
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f41655f5:

    # Merel "D’you wanna do that, Nienke? I’m not imposing, am I?"
    Merel "妮恩克，你想一起吗？我没有强迫你吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2444
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ea9d07fa:

    # Nienke "Oh, no, not at all."
    Nienke "没有，一点也没有。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2445
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_31e0597a:

    # "Though I still feel sad, I’m able to make myself smile."
    "虽然还是难过，我也努力笑了笑。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2446
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_35eb662e:

    # "I meet Merel’s reflected gaze in the mirror as I say..."
    "在镜中对上她的目光，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2448
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5c1a986b:

    # Nienke "I’d like to spend today with you, too. There’s still a lot of places I haven’t taken you, and there’s a lot to see. It’d be a shame to spend today indoors..."
    Nienke "我也想今天陪着你。还有好多地方没带你去，也有不少东西可以看。整天待在屋里，太可惜了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2450
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_75b9e3a5:

    # Nienke "So, let’s do it."
    Nienke "那就走吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2453
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cedd9d3c:

    # Merel "Ooh! Does that mean you’ll be my tour guide, Merel? Will you show me around?"
    Merel "哦！妮恩克，你要当我的导游啦？带我到处逛？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2454
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_01ef9c7e:

    # Nienke "Yes, if you’d like. I don’t mind that."
    Nienke "嗯，你愿意的话，我没问题。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2458
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e1dd2bc5:

    # "In fact, I think that’s what I want."
    "其实，这正是我想做的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2460
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e83cb11c:

    # "I want to stay by Merel’s side, and I want to show her around. I want us both to have fun together, all the way until the end."
    "我想陪在梅蕾尔身边，带她四处看看。想让我们一起开心，直到最后一刻。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2462
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a941cfbe:

    # "I don’t think there’s anything that would give me more joy than that."
    "我想，没有比这更让我快乐的事了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2482
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6dff4465:

    # Merel "Ooh, this place is so cute! It looked kinda small on the outside, but it’s surprisingly light and airy inside!"
    Merel "哇，这里好可爱！外面看着小小的，里面却意外地明亮宽敞！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2484
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5f8c043d:

    # Merel "It looks like there’s quite a few galleries, too..."
    Merel "展厅也有好几个呢……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2486
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6bade0e5:

    # Merel "And there’s even a section for elven artists! That’s kind of novel, wahaha~"
    Merel "居然还有精灵艺术家的专区！挺新鲜的，哇哈哈～"

# chapter3.rpyc:2487
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0f824e0f:

    # Merel "I doubt there’ll be a big selection of pieces there, but still! We’ve simply gotta check that out!"
    Merel "作品大概不会很多，可还是得去看看！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2489
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_120c7a9c:

    # Merel "It’s our duty as fellow elves. Don’t you think so, Nienke?"
    Merel "同样身为精灵，这是我们的义务嘛。妮恩克，你说呢？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2491
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6c23a82b:

    # Nienke "I’m not sure if it’s our ‘duty’, per se..."
    Nienke "是不是“义务”，倒也不一定……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2493
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a8acafa1:

    # Nienke "But I know what you mean. I was pretty intrigued when I heard they were going to exhibit some art by elven artists, too."
    Nienke "不过，我懂你的意思。听说要展出精灵艺术家的作品时，我也很好奇。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2495
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_192fff9e:

    # Nienke "It’s pretty unexpected, in a small village like Alpenrose..."
    Nienke "在阿尔彭罗瑟这么小的村子里，挺意外的……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2497
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_27ad1062:

    # Merel "I’ll say! I didn’t think this place had much of an elven population?"
    Merel "就是呀！这里精灵应该不多吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2499
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ebe1f0d7:

    # Nienke "It doesn’t have any elves at all, other than me and my parents. As far as I know, we’re the only ones."
    Nienke "除了我和爸妈，没有别的精灵。据我所知，就我们一家。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2501
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c9cc92a7:

    # Merel "The only ones, eh?"
    Merel "只有你们啊？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2502
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_42cf42f8:

    # "Merel whistles, then says..."
    "她吹了声口哨，接着说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2506
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_64dcf647:

    # Merel "You must feel special, then!"
    Merel "那你一定觉得自己很特别！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2508
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_65a6bfe9:

    # Nienke "In a sense, I suppose...{w} though I don’t know if I feel special in a positive way."
    Nienke "某种意义上吧……{w}不过，是不是好的那种特别，就不一定了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2509
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c6d2ee76:

    # Nienke "Mostly, I’m afraid I’ve stood out a lot..."
    Nienke "大多时候，只觉得自己太显眼……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2511
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a191c14f:

    # Nienke "But it is nice to see us elves being celebrated, I suppose."
    Nienke "可看见精灵也受到重视，还是挺高兴的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2519
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a0c4c878:

    # "I decided to take Merel to the local art gallery, mostly because it’s one of the few things to do in Alpenrose."
    "我决定带她来当地美术馆，主要因为阿尔彭罗瑟可做的事本来就不多。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2521
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bfaf1288:

    # "It’s such a small village, there isn’t all that much in the way of entertainment."
    "村子这么小，也没多少消遣。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2522
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6bf5e3f8:

    # "I didn’t think Merel would enjoy looking around the churchyard, even if it is rather scenic, or the old Villiers house, which is supposedly haunted, so the art gallery seemed like one of the only real options."
    "教堂墓园是挺有景致，可她应该不爱逛。还有据说闹鬼的维利耶旧宅，我也觉得不合适。所以，美术馆几乎是仅剩的选择。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2524
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_596bc990:

    # "...Well. I say ‘Merel wouldn’t enjoy looking around the Villiers house’, but that’s not strictly true."
    "……好吧，要说“梅蕾尔不会喜欢维利耶旧宅”，倒也不完全对。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2526
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6240adf0:

    # "I get the feeling that Merel {i}would{/i} enjoy poking around an old gothic home, with warped wooden floors and a sloping roof, but therein lies the problem."
    "那种木地板翘曲、屋顶倾斜的哥特式老房子，她{i}会{/i}有兴趣探索吧。可问题就在这里。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2527
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_826fc870:

    # "I’m afraid she’d enjoy it too much. She’d wander around in every single room, and then she’d probably place her right foot wrong and go falling straight through the floor."
    "怕她兴致太高，每间屋子都想进去，最后一脚踩错，直接掉穿地板。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2529
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ba3de7ab:

    # "The image of Merel lying on the ground, her arms and legs bent at alarming angles, is a troubling one. The art gallery seems like the much more sensible option."
    "想到她躺在地上，胳膊腿折成吓人的角度，我就不安。还是美术馆稳妥得多。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2530
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_94db6624:

    # "I’ve been here a handful of times in the past, though it’s been about a year since my last visit."
    "以前来过几次，不过上一次到现在，已经差不多一年了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2532
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ef6bac14:

    # "The last time I came here would have been with Cornelia, when she was back at home for the summer holiday."
    "上次是和科妮莉娅一起来的，她那时放暑假回家。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2533
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_738b8892:

    # "There’s something nostalgic about that thought: almost tragically so."
    "一想起来，就有种怀念，几乎让人难过。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2534
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c40a0ea4:

    # "I don’t think I’ve quite overcome my melancholy over Cornelia leaving..."
    "她离开带来的失落，我好像还没完全走出来……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2536
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d046135c:

    # "But I don’t need her. I’m with Merel, and I’m determined to enjoy myself."
    "可我不需要她。我现在跟梅蕾尔在一起，一定要开开心心的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2544
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4e38e0d5:

    # "The gallery is even running a new exhibition: one which features art exclusively by elven artists from the nearby towns of Gouda and Leiden."
    "馆里还办了新展览，专门展出附近豪达和莱顿的精灵艺术家的作品。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2545
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_34e81297:

    # "There aren’t any elves in Alpenrose other than myself and my parents (and Merel now, I suppose), so the exhibition won’t feature any local artists."
    "阿尔彭罗瑟除了我和爸妈，没有别的精灵，当然，现在还得算梅蕾尔。所以展览里不会有本地艺术家的作品。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2546
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_df7cb605:

    # "There aren’t any local artists to feature. I’ve never been all that artistic. I much prefer burying myself in the world of books than I do playing around with charcoals and watercolours."
    "因为根本没有本地精灵艺术家。我一向不擅长艺术，比起玩炭笔和水彩，更喜欢把头埋进书里的世界。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2547
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f75f6853:

    # "I don’t think I’d make a very good artist. I’m too precious about getting my fingers dirty — and anyway, I don’t have an eye for it."
    "我也当不好艺术家。太怕弄脏手指，而且根本没有那份眼光。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2548
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_97241d68:

    # "I don’t know if I’ll appreciate the art here all that much either, for that matter..."
    "说起来，也不知道自己能欣赏多少这里的作品……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2549
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ca951d59:

    # "But an exhibition of elven art seems significant, somehow."
    "不过，专门办一场精灵艺术展，总觉得很有意义。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2550
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_07d62bfd:

    # "I’ve wanted to see it for a while, and I thought it would be even more meaningful to see it with Merel."
    "我想看很久了，觉得跟梅蕾尔一起来，会更有意义。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2551
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4ad9ba1e:

    # "I’m in cautiously high spirits..."
    "心情不错，只是还带着一点谨慎……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2555
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c4635295:

    # Wh "Hey. Are you here to purchase a couple of tickets?"
    Wh "喂，买票？两张？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2565
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2db28090:

    # "But my spirits sink the moment Merel and I approach the counter, where the bored-looking clerk is sitting."
    "可和梅蕾尔走到柜台前，看见那个一脸无聊的工作人员，我的心情立刻沉了下去。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2570
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ed5614c4:

    # "It’s been a while since I last spoke to him, but I recognise him at once. It doesn’t take me even a moment to place his bored, disinterested expression and his dark brown hair."
    "虽然很久没跟他说过话，还是一眼就认出来了。那副百无聊赖、漠不关心的表情，还有深棕色头发，根本不用回想。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2571
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ad2d3359:

    # "It’s Hendrik Baas, my childhood tormentor."
    "亨德里克·巴斯。小时候折磨我的人。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2573
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f5c14dec:

    # "I didn’t know that he worked at this gallery. If I had, I’m not sure if I would have suggested coming here in the first place, but it’s too late to back out now."
    "我不知道他在这里工作。早知道，还会不会提议来，我都不确定。可现在反悔也晚了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2575
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_474baba6:

    # "Merel and I already walked all of the way to the gallery, and it would seem like such a shame to turn back now."
    "都走到美术馆了，就这么掉头回去，实在可惜。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2576
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c8eca28b:

    # "I don’t want to let Hendrik unnerve me, but I don’t want to speak to him either."
    "我不想让他影响自己，可也不想跟他说话。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2578
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_00616852:

    # "I can still recall the shame and embarrassment which always came hand-in-hand with the pithy insults Hendrik hurled at me, and the way he would hook his leg beneath my own while I was walking through the hallway."
    "那些刻薄的辱骂总伴着羞耻和难堪，我还记得。还有走过走廊时，他故意把腿伸到我脚下。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2579
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_30fc154d:

    # "I’ve cracked my head on the ground more times than I care to remember thanks to Hendrik, and he’s shredded several of my textbooks."
    "因为他，脑袋撞过多少次地，我都不愿数了。还有好几本课本，被他撕得稀烂。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2581
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_07a88ff2:

    # "Once, he even poured a glass of milk over my head in the middle of lunch."
    "有一次吃午饭，他甚至把一杯牛奶从我头顶浇下来。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2582
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_78769a24:

    # "We were both children back then, granted, and I’d like to believe that he’s graduated from such petty, mean-spirited bullying, but I don’t want to take any risks."
    "是，那时我们都还是孩子。我也愿意相信，他已经长大，不再做这种卑劣的小动作，可我不想冒险。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2584
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_babd9325:

    # "I don’t want to see him, and I don’t want to speak to him."
    "不想见他，也不想说话。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2585
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_193e5d86:

    # "I don’t want to acknowledge he even exists."
    "甚至不想承认他的存在。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2587
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e64ab044:

    # "I hang back, half-hidden behind Merel, hoping against hope that Hendrik won’t see me."
    "我退后半步，半躲在梅蕾尔身后，抱着最后一点侥幸，希望他看不见。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2588
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bf2177f2:

    # "I pray that Hendrik will be too busy working to pay me any heed, but..."
    "祈祷他忙着工作，顾不上我。可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2589
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d04890d6:

    # Hendrik "Alright, here are your tickets. These will let you visit every room in the gallery until closing time, which is—"
    Hendrik "好了，你们的票。闭馆前所有展厅都能看，闭馆时间是——"

# chapter3.rpyc:2590
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fa579ec6:

    # Hendrik "...Wait."
    Hendrik "……等等。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2592
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e7fd5a7c:

    # "Hendrik looks at me sharply, his eyes narrowed. Then, he scoffs."
    "亨德里克猛地看向我，眯起眼，接着嗤笑一声。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2593
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4398cee7:

    # Hendrik "My God. I don’t believe this. It’s Nienke, right?"
    Hendrik "天哪，真不敢相信。妮恩克，对吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2594
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6992b475:

    # Hendrik "What’re you doing here?"
    Hendrik "你来这里干什么？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2596
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4dbfeaf5:

    # "I draw in a breath, then take a step back. My gut reaction is to shrink behind Merel’s broad shoulders, just like a flower..."
    "我吸了口气，后退一步。本能地想缩到梅蕾尔宽阔的肩后，像一朵小花……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2597
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_42027284:

    # "But I know that isn’t going to help me."
    "可我知道，这没用。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2599
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aaebdbef:

    # "I don’t want Hendrik to think I’m the same old Nienke: the shy little elf girl whose sunflower was shunted into a storage cupboard."
    "我不想让他以为，自己还是从前那个妮恩克，那个怕生的小精灵女孩，连向日葵都被塞进储物柜。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2600
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e0155c53:

    # "I want him to know that I’ve grown up at least a little bit since those days."
    "我要让他知道，这些年，我至少长大了一点。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2601
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ac3e17c7:

    # "Sure, I’m still short (I’m going to blame my childhood sickness for that), and yes, I’m still an elf (that, meanwhile, is inherent), but I’m not ashamed of either of these things..."
    "没错，我还是矮，这得怪小时候那场病。也还是精灵，这是天生的。可这两件事，都没什么好羞耻……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2603
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_66524ff6:

    # "Or, no, that’s not quite right. I do wish I was a few centimetres taller, but my height (or lack of) is no reason to let Hendrik walk all over me!"
    "不，也不完全对。我确实想再高几厘米，可长得矮，也不是让亨德里克随便踩在头上的理由！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2605
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3395c070:

    # "I’m a little more confident now, at least, and I’m going to prove it!"
    "至少，我比以前自信了一点。这就证明给他看！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2606
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d6fdc401:

    # Nienke "Yes, that’s right. It’s Nienke — and what do you mean, “what am I doing here”? Is there any rule which states that I can’t come to a local art gallery when I want?"
    Nienke "对，是妮恩克。还有，“我来这里干什么”是什么意思？哪条规定说，我想来的时候，不能来本地美术馆？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2607
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_42949d14:

    # Nienke "As far as I know, I’m not barred from this place."
    Nienke "据我所知，这里并没有禁止我入内。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2608
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_095a272a:

    # Hendrik "Hmm..."
    Hendrik "嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2609
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_11a8d89e:

    # "Hendrik leans back in his chair, eyeing me up. He folds his arms across his chest, his expression impassive, as he looks me up and down."
    "他靠回椅背，抱着胳膊，面无表情地把我上下打量。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2610
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9124d9f7:

    # "There’s a moment’s pause, and then..."
    "停顿片刻，然后……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2611
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5961057f:

    # Hendrik "I s’pose you’re right about that. There’s no rules about elves coming into places like this, though some people might think otherwise..."
    Hendrik "也是。确实没规定不让精灵进这种地方，虽然有些人可能不这么想……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2613
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4bf2723c:

    # "I resist the urge to wince (he couldn’t have been more obvious if he’d flat-out said “I don’t want you here, freak”), then say..."
    "我忍住瑟缩的冲动。他就差直接说“怪胎，这里不欢迎你”了。然后开口……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2615
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f317da4c:

    # Nienke "‘Some people’ like you, do you mean?"
    Nienke "“有些人”，是指你这样的人？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2616
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7cb01887:

    # Hendrik "Now, now. Did I say that?"
    Hendrik "哎，这可是你说的。我说了吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2617
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_610417a1:

    # Nienke "You implied it."
    Nienke "你就是那个意思。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2618
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_785bade2:

    # Hendrik "I implied no such thing. I’m just repeating things I’ve heard other people say: mostly the oldies."
    Hendrik "我可没这个意思。只是转述听来的话，主要是那些老人说的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2619
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5c81b38f:

    # Hendrik "You should know well enough that elves aren’t all that welcome ’round here, though."
    Hendrik "不过，你也该知道，精灵在这儿没那么受欢迎。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2621
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a9c8234f:

    # Nienke "Yes, I am aware. You made that more than apparent when we were still in school."
    Nienke "知道。上学时，你已经让我体会得再清楚不过了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2622
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f44d1a42:

    # Hendrik "Oh, come on, Nienke, that was years ago! I can’t believe you’re still hung up on that!"
    Hendrik "拜托，妮恩克，多少年前的事了！你居然还惦记着！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2623
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d9fc4b77:

    # Hendrik "You’ve got to learn to let the past go. It’s no good for you to ruminate!"
    Hendrik "得学会放下过去啊，老纠结有什么好处？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2625
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ae892ee2:

    # Nienke "That’s funny. I could say the same about you — and all of you people who hate elves for no good reason. The war was over 200 years ago, you know?"
    Nienke "真好笑。这话我也可以送给你，还有那些无缘无故讨厌精灵的人。那场战争都过去两百多年了，知道吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2626
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d7f8801d:

    # Hendrik "I’m aware, yes. I did pay a little attention in history class..."
    Hendrik "知道，历史课我还是听了点的……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2627
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6c48d449:

    # Hendrik "But that’s neither here nor there."
    Hendrik "不过，那跟这没关系。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2628
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_db8b3c49:

    # Hendrik "I’ve not seen much of you recently, Nienke."
    Hendrik "最近很少见到你啊，妮恩克。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2630
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_711e1432:

    # "Hendrik takes care to pronounce every single syllable of my name: seeming to taste it on his tongue like some sort of sweet."
    "他把我的名字一个音节一个音节地念出来，像在舌尖品尝什么糖果。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2631
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_55b34df5:

    # "He rolls it about inside his mouth, and I can’t help but shudder."
    "那个名字在他嘴里滚来滚去，我忍不住打了个寒战。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2633
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_26321282:

    # Hendrik "I’ve been wondering what you’ve been getting up to, but I s’pose I have my answer."
    Hendrik "还在想你最近忙什么呢，现在有答案了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2634
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_64d78549:

    # Hendrik "It looks like you’ve found a friend — and she’s just as strange as you are."
    Hendrik "看来是找了个朋友。跟你一样奇怪。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2646
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bfe14d1f_1:

    # Merel "What?"
    Merel "什么？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2647
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aeb8f20f:

    # "Merel scowls. She plants both her hands on her hips, then says..."
    "梅蕾尔沉下脸，双手叉腰，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2652
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7ca96173:

    # Merel "Who’re you callin’ strange? I don’t even know you!"
    Merel "说谁奇怪呢？我都不认识你！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2653
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ff554c6e:

    # Hendrik "I know you don’t, and thank goodness for that."
    Hendrik "我知道，谢天谢地。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2654
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4456cd2f:

    # Hendrik "Some of the other villagers in Alpenrose might feel differently, but I’ve no real interest in being friendly with elves."
    Hendrik "阿尔彭罗瑟的其他人也许不一样，反正我没兴趣跟精灵交朋友。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2656
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_88f7e127:

    # Merel "Well, right back at you. I have no interest in being friendly with jerks!"
    Merel "彼此彼此，我也没兴趣跟混蛋交朋友！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2657
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_17dda2a9:

    # Hendrik "Oh...?"
    Hendrik "哦……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2659
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_97701ca1:

    # "Hendrik blinks. He looks momentarily surprised by this outburst, then says..."
    "他眨眨眼，似乎被这句回击惊了一下，接着说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2660
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d6732add:

    # Hendrik "Ha! That’s kinda funny. I guess I am being a bit of an ass, huh?"
    Hendrik "哈，有意思。我好像是有点混账，是吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2662
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_54959358:

    # Merel "Yes, you are. I don’t know what you’ve got against me and Nienke, other than the obvious, but can’t you cut it out?"
    Merel "对，就是。除了明摆着的那个原因，我不知道你对我和妮恩克还有什么意见，可你能不能适可而止？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2664
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b0c10ba0:

    # Merel "There’s nothing impressive about what you’re doing. You’re not cool. You’re just being childish!"
    Merel "这样做一点也不厉害，也不酷，只是幼稚！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2665
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a2091072:

    # Hendrik "Heh. That’s not the first time I’ve been called that. My sisters get on my case pretty often too..."
    Hendrik "呵，这评价倒不新鲜。我那几个姐妹也经常数落我……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2667
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fe114dff:

    # Hendrik "But I think they’d back me up in this case, at least."
    Hendrik "不过这次，她们至少会站我这边吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2668
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_88f692c3:

    # Hendrik "They don’t want to see more elves moving into Alpenrose either."
    Hendrik "她们也不想看见更多精灵搬进阿尔彭罗瑟。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2669
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7ff710eb:

    # Hendrik "Nienke and her family are more than enough — and, for as long as I can recall, they were the only elves here."
    Hendrik "妮恩克一家就够了。反正从我记事起，这里就只有他们几个精灵。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2670
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_390eb152:

    # Hendrik "I’ve not seen any other long-ears around..."
    Hendrik "没见过别的长耳朵……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2671
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_188d506f:

    # Hendrik "So, now I’m curious. I’m supposed to be on the clock right now, but tell me: who are you, and how do you know Nienke? You aren’t some relative of hers, are you?"
    Hendrik "所以现在好奇了。虽然还在上班，不过说说，你是谁，怎么认识妮恩克的？该不会是什么亲戚吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2675
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6dfb699f:

    # Merel "No, I am not her relative. I’m Nienke’s friend. I came all the way to Alpenrose to spend the summer with her, and I’m not interested in some silly little boy tryin’ to ruin things."
    Merel "不是亲戚，我是她的朋友。大老远来阿尔彭罗瑟，就是想陪她过夏天，没兴趣让一个幼稚的小男孩来扫兴。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2677
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b9d8210b:

    # Merel "Now, look here."
    Merel "现在，你听好了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2683
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_632adff7:

    # "Merel takes a step forwards, her eyes narrowed."
    "梅蕾尔眯起眼，往前迈了一步。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2688
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5b2f1676:

    # "Impetuously, she slams her palm on the counter in front of Hendrik. He tries to look unaffected, but I still see him flinching."
    "她猛地一掌拍在亨德里克面前的柜台上。他想装作不在意，可我还是看见他缩了一下。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2690
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_794de267:

    # "Then, scowling, she says..."
    "她绷着脸，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2691
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_24677fd8:

    # Merel "I don’t know what your problem is, but don’t you have a job to do?"
    Merel "我不知道你有什么毛病，可你不是还有工作要做吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2692
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_86910690:

    # Hendrik "Yes...?"
    Hendrik "是啊……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2694
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6c9d3d91:

    # "Hendrik looks up at Merel, his lazy disinterest restored. He raises one eyebrow languidly and says..."
    "他抬头看她，又摆回那副懒洋洋、不在乎的神情，慢吞吞挑起一边眉毛。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2695
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9fd2586c:

    # Hendrik "And what does that have to do with anything?"
    Hendrik "这跟现在有什么关系？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2696
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bea495c6:

    # Merel "Well, wouldn’t you like to know. I figured, since you’re working behind the desk, you were supposed to greet people with a smile, an’ hand out the tickets."
    Merel "那你可得好好听听。我以为，坐在柜台后面，是该笑着欢迎客人，再把票递过去。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2698
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cf95da40:

    # Merel "I didn’t know you were being paid to make the visitors feel uncomfortable, or to make rude remarks. Is that part of your job description?"
    Merel "原来人家花钱雇你，是让你给游客添堵、说没礼貌的话？工作要求里写着这条吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2699
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6f39e764:

    # Hendrik "Well, er..."
    Hendrik "这个，呃……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2701
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e18e294e:

    # "It’s here that Hendrik finally falters. He scratches his cheek and mumbles..."
    "他终于迟疑了，挠挠脸，低声说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2702
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_da84b0bc:

    # Hendrik "Not strictly, no..."
    Hendrik "严格说，没有……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2704
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_06a38f87:

    # Merel "I thought not."
    Merel "我想也是。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2706
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_80f1ba76:

    # Merel "You’re meant to be makin’ us feel welcome, desk boy, so knock it off with the superior attitude. Otherwise, I’ll go and speak to your supervisor."
    Merel "柜台小哥，你的工作是让我们宾至如归，别再摆高人一等的架子。不然，我就去找你的主管谈。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2708
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6bdd3a2d:

    # Merel "Would you like that? You seem to care sooooo much about being at the centre of attention, I figured you’d enjoy it..."
    Merel "你愿意吗？这么——喜欢引人注意，我还以为你会高兴呢……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2710
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_44e05c3c:

    # Merel "Or maybe not?"
    Merel "还是说，不愿意？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2711
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_393aba76:

    # "Hendrik, by this point, has started to sweat. He bites the inside of his cheek before saying..."
    "亨德里克已经开始冒汗。他咬了咬脸颊内侧，开口……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2713
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_520ddee5:

    # Hendrik "Nah, I’m good. There’s no need to tell my supervisor about this. She’s a very busy woman, you see. I’m sure she has things she’d rather be doing, instead of—"
    Hendrik "不了，免了。没必要跟主管说。她很忙，肯定有别的正事要做，不想为了——"

# chapter3.rpyc:2715
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_56a4e0f8:

    # Merel "Being called to discipline one of her own employees about a racial incident, when this gallery is quite literally hosting a display dedicated to elven artists?"
    Merel "自己的员工闹出种族歧视，被叫来处理？尤其这家美术馆，眼下明明正在办精灵艺术家的展览？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2716
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6d6a37b6:

    # Hendrik "Um... Yeah, that. It’s, uh, more trouble than it’s worth, so can the two of you take your tickets and hurry along? There’s a bit of a line forming."
    Hendrik "呃……对，就是。太麻烦了，不值当。你们能不能拿好票赶紧进去？后面都排队了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2718
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_212a21a3:

    # Merel "Well, I can see that. I don’t want to cause a fuss..."
    Merel "看见了，我也不想惹事……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2720
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_df6c8153:

    # Merel "But, before I go, I want to know that you’re truly sorry about what you’ve done."
    Merel "不过走之前，我要知道，你真的为刚才做的事感到抱歉。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2722
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ed624ffa:

    # Merel "You can manage a simple apology, can’t you, a big boy like you?"
    Merel "这么大的男孩了，道个歉，总做得到吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2723
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_419519df:

    # Hendrik "R-Right! Uh... Damn."
    Hendrik "做、做得到！呃……该死。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2725
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fb58306f:

    # Hendrik "I’m sorry, alright? I didn’t mean anything bad by it. You just...{w} don’t see many elves ’round here, is all."
    Hendrik "对不起，行了吧？我没什么恶意。只是这里……{w}很少见到精灵而已。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2726
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8c2bc007:

    # Hendrik "I guess I let my surprise get the better of me — not that it’s a real excuse, I guess. I was being a jerk, and... Um..."
    Hendrik "大概是太意外，没管住嘴。当然，这也不能算借口。我是挺混账的，然后……嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2727
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c6089c61:

    # Hendrik "I’m sorry, Nienke?"
    Hendrik "妮恩克，对不起？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2731
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c673ea79:

    # "I stare at Hendrik, too stunned to speak. In all the time I’ve known him, I don’t think Hendrik has ever apologised to me: not even at the behest of the teachers."
    "我瞪着他，震惊得说不出话。认识这么多年，他好像从没向我道过歉，老师让道歉也没有。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2732
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9423cf6f:

    # "The teachers back at our primary school didn’t much care what was said, so long as there were no broken bones."
    "小学的老师不太管嘴上说了什么，只要没闹到伤筋动骨就行。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2733
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d7eeaef8:

    # "Hendrik and his gang were allowed to torment me with impunity, more or less..."
    "亨德里克那伙人欺负我，几乎不用承担任何后果……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2735
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_08edb87f:

    # "But here’s Merel, standing up to my childhood tormentor, and it only took a few words for her to get him to back off."
    "可现在，梅蕾尔站出来，只用了几句话，就让这个折磨过我童年的人退缩了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2737
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_31c62e7d:

    # "How does she do it?"
    "她怎么做到的？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2739
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0f9cc914:

    # Merel "That’s all I wanted to hear. Thanks a bunch, pal. It seems you can be civil after all! I only had to threaten you a little bit, wahaha!"
    Merel "这就是我想听的。多谢啦，朋友。看来你也会讲礼貌嘛，只需要稍微吓一吓，哇哈哈！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2741
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_11d75c5c:

    # "Merel cracks her knuckles ominously, then glances at me."
    "她把指关节掰得咔咔响，带着点威胁的意味，然后看向我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2743
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_38139849:

    # Merel "D’you wanna start lookin’ around, Nienke? I’m real excited to see what sort of paintings they have! I’m sure it’ll be a blast!"
    Merel "妮恩克，开始参观吧？真想看看这里都有什么画，肯定很好玩！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2744
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_544725f3:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, um, r-right. O-Of course."
    Nienke "啊，嗯，好、好的。当、当然。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2754
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_19e7f113:

    # "I turn my back on Hendrik, who still looks uncharacteristically frazzled, and hurry to keep pace with Merel."
    "我背过身，不再看那个难得狼狈的亨德里克，赶紧跟上梅蕾尔。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2755
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_edb7ad67:

    # "I’m trying to look nonchalant, but all the while, my heart is fluttering."
    "努力装得若无其事，心却一直轻颤。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2756
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4bd4e60d:

    # "I can hardly believe that Merel was able to stand up to Hendrik like that."
    "她居然能这样顶回去，简直难以置信。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2757
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0c8a7b64:

    # "He tormented me when I was a child, and not even Cornelia could make him stop. He never listened to her, but Merel’s different."
    "小时候他折磨我，连科妮莉娅都制止不了。她说什么，他都不听。可梅蕾尔不一样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2758
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_38e5007f:

    # "I wonder why Hendrik was more inclined to obey her. Is it because she’s so muscular?"
    "他为什么更愿意听她的？因为她肌肉多吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2759
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5537103e:

    # "Merel {i}does{/i} have quite the impressive figure for a woman."
    "作为女人，她这体格{i}确实{/i}很惊人。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2760
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_658ec507:

    # "She really is impressive..."
    "她真的很了不起……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2764
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e759a73b:

    # "But maybe that’s to be expected of her."
    "不过，也许本来就该如此。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2765
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f815d122:

    # "Merel {i}is{/i} my self-proclaimed knight."
    "毕竟她{i}可是{/i}自封的、我的骑士。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2769
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2d8e8fcb:

    # "With the unpleasant run-in with Hendrik behind us, Merel and I begin to peruse the art gallery in earnest."
    "把与亨德里克的不愉快抛在身后，我们开始认真参观。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2770
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7f402148:

    # "We wander through the various rooms, pausing to take in all of the art: the landscapes in their gilt frames, and the religious portraits of women in voluminous robes."
    "走过一间间展厅，停下来欣赏各种画：镀金画框里的风景，还有穿着宽大长袍的女性宗教肖像。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2771
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1f2e42a2:

    # "I don’t recognise all of the saints depicted on the various canvases, since some of them are pretty obscure, but I do slightly better at recognising some of the long-suffering heroines from various myths."
    "有些圣人太冷门，我认不全。不过那些神话里饱经苦难的女主角，倒多认识几个。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2772
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_86892b09:

    # "The art on display is very pretty, but I’ve always preferred books over drawing, and I get the feeling Cornelia would probably enjoy this more than I am."
    "画很漂亮，可我一向更爱书，不爱画画。总觉得科妮莉娅大概会比我更喜欢这里。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2785
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7259e65f:

    # "She’s a chronic doodler. She used to scribble away in the margins of all of her textbooks, until our teachers saw and invariably scolded her."
    "她是个停不下来的涂鸦爱好者，以前所有课本边角都画满了，直到老师发现，又免不了一顿训。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2786
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_69c18034:

    # "Cornelia has much more of an aesthetic sense than I do..."
    "她的审美比我强得多……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2787
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_352db04a:

    # "But it’s been a while since I came to see these paintings, and their beauty is able to strike me regardless."
    "不过，很久没来看这些画，它们的美还是能打动我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2799
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_18d27be7:

    # "I spend a long while standing by a pietà: a sorrowful image of a sobbing Mary clutching the deceased Jesus to her chest."
    "我在一幅《圣母怜子》前站了很久。画中的玛利亚哭泣着，把死去的耶稣紧抱在胸前，满是悲伤。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2800
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9c1bc9e6:

    # "There’s something striking about it: the dark colours used to pick out the shadows in Mary’s face, and the hollows of her eyes, so she almost looks like a skull."
    "深色勾出她脸上的阴影和眼窝，几乎像一颗骷髅，触目惊心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2801
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ed2cebc8:

    # "The painting is equal parts eerie and upsetting, and looking at it is enough to make me shudder."
    "这画既阴森又令人难过，看着就让人发颤。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2802
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f45588ad:

    # "It makes quite the impression..."
    "相当震撼……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2803
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fa17a558:

    # "But no painting makes an impression like the large canvas on display in this elven artists gallery: a painting simply called War."
    "可没有哪幅比精灵艺术家展厅里那张巨画更震撼。画名只有两个字：《战争》。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2804
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f02641c2:

    # "The painting is so large it takes up almost the entirety of the wall. It’s twice as tall as I am, and it spans from one end of the room to the other."
    "画幅几乎占满整面墙，比我高一倍，从房间这头一直延伸到那头。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2805
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_646a8ef5:

    # "This painting is mostly rendered in dark browns and burgundys, just like the pietà I saw earlier, but it’s dashed through with copious amounts of red."
    "和刚才的《圣母怜子》一样，大多用了深棕和酒红，却又穿插着大片鲜红。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2806
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0cfe80bb:

    # "The painting is so huge, it dwarfs the plaque on the wall beside it, which explains what the painting represents."
    "画太大，连旁边解释作品含义的说明牌，都显得微不足道。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2807
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a182aafc:

    # "There’s a couple of neat little paragraphs written on this plaque, explaining the painting was by the famed elven artist Reon, who lives in The Lonely Isles..."
    "牌上整整齐齐写了几段，说画出自著名精灵艺术家雷昂之手，他住在孤独群岛……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2808
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c996f034:

    # "But these prosaic, practical details about who crafted this painting have no significance to me."
    "可这些关于作者的平实资料，此刻对我已经不重要。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2809
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_11cdc3fb:

    # "The painting is more than capable of speaking for itself."
    "画本身，足够说明一切。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2810
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0a5299dc:

    # "The painting depicts a series of events plainly: events I was fortunate enough not to live through, but which I’ve heard about in history lessons back in the lyceum."
    "画面清楚呈现了一连串事件。我庆幸自己不曾亲历，却在中学历史课上听过。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2811
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4a971894:

    # "My parents have told me bits and pieces, but they never really wanted to dwell upon it."
    "爸妈也零星提起过，可从不愿多谈。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2812
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_acb7afa6:

    # "This war between the elves and humans was a violent, bloody affair, and its after-effects can still be felt in society centuries later."
    "精灵与人类之间的这场战争，残酷而血腥。几个世纪过去，余波仍留在社会之中。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2813
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_72443340:

    # "There were always skirmishes between elves and humans, as there will always be skirmishing between different species."
    "精灵与人类之间一直有冲突，就像不同种族之间，总免不了争斗。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2814
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_17d86b3c:

    # "I’m afraid that is simply part of our nature. War, or so our tired-looking history teacher, Mr Lavelle told us, is an intrinsic part of us all."
    "恐怕这就是天性。那位总是满脸疲惫的历史老师拉韦尔先生曾说，战争根植在每个人的本性里。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2815
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f9da524a:

    # "It’s just human nature..."
    "这是人性……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2816
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ebddf9d8:

    # "And elvish nature too, apparently."
    "看来，也是精灵的天性。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2827
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_05c6514c:

    # "I ponder this as I look at the painting, standing by Merel’s side. She examines it too, her head tipped back, as she says..."
    "我站在梅蕾尔身边，望着画想着这些。她也仰头打量，开口道……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2829
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aa5ec3f6:

    # Merel "Hey. Isn’t this paintin’ kinda dark?"
    Merel "喂，这幅画是不是有点阴暗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2831
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9a79737c:

    # Nienke "I would say so, yes. I mean, it is depicting a war."
    Nienke "嗯，的确。毕竟画的是战争。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2833
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2250faa0:

    # Merel "I guess so. It’s kinda sad, but I guess this is how things used to be between us elves and the humans."
    Merel "也是。有点难过，可以前精灵和人类之间，就是这样吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2835
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9059033e:

    # Merel "We were at war all the time, until more’n half of us were wiped out. Back then, I imagine we elves hated humans..."
    Merel "一直打，一直打，直到我们的族人死了一半还多。那时，精灵一定很恨人类……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2839
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_76850114:

    # Merel "And they hated us, too."
    Merel "人类也恨我们。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2841
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_91d09371:

    # Merel "They must’ve, to hunt us down like they did. Their actions don’t make any sense otherwise."
    Merel "肯定是的，不然怎么会那样追杀？没有别的解释。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2842
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ee6051e4:

    # Merel "They must’ve despised us, so we despised them in turn. We hated one another enough that somethin’ awful like this happened."
    Merel "他们恨透我们，我们也反过来恨他们。恨到最后，就发生了这样的惨事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2843
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2c828de5:

    # Merel "It’s been two hundred years since then, but we still remember what happened."
    Merel "已经过去两百年，可大家还记得。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2845
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5b22e725:

    # Merel "You know, my parents were worried when your folks said you’d move to Alpenrose. They were opposed to it, even though it might’ve been the only way to save you."
    Merel "你知道吗，你爸妈说要搬去阿尔彭罗瑟时，我爸妈特别担心。哪怕可能只有这样才能救你，他们还是反对。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2847
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e4127039:

    # Merel "They said that it wasn’t safe for us elves to live with humans. They were afraid that you’d be hurt, Nienke, an’ I got scared too."
    Merel "说精灵跟人类住在一起，不安全。他们怕你受伤，妮恩克，我也跟着怕。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2848
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7a2857f2:

    # Merel "I was worried that these humans wouldn’t treat you proper, an’ you might not get the medical care you needed. Part of me thought you might die..."
    Merel "怕人类不好好待你，不给你好好治病。心里有一部分，总觉得你可能会死……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2855
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_58f2bb36:

    # "Merel’s voice trails off. She inhales, then says..."
    "她的声音低了下去，吸了口气，继续说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2857
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3283a7c1:

    # Merel "But it looks like you’ve been doing okay here. You’re doin’ okay, and you were able to settle in. You even made a few friends!"
    Merel "不过，你在这里过得挺好。真的挺好，安顿下来了，还交到了朋友！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2859
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_25f93511:

    # Merel "You have that Cornelia girl, even though I never met her, an’ Jenny seems nice, too."
    Merel "有科妮莉娅，虽然我没见过她，珍妮看着也很好。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2860
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_445d205c:

    # Merel "I was worried you’d never fit in here, all because you’re an elf..."
    Merel "以前我担心，就因为是精灵，你永远融不进这里……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2867
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cff853ef:

    # Merel "But you’ve been doing much, much better than I imagined you would..."
    Merel "可你比我想象中过得好得多……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2869
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ee7b04e4:

    # Merel "Even if there are some jerks here, like that pompous jerk at the counter."
    Merel "虽然这里也有混蛋，比如柜台那个自大的家伙。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2870
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ffb1554e:

    # Nienke "That pompous jerk has a name. It’s Hendrik."
    Nienke "那个自大的家伙有名字，叫亨德里克。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2872
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9395d6bc:

    # Merel "I don’t care what his name is. I don’t wanna remember it: not after he called me ‘long ears’."
    Merel "管他叫什么。我不想记，尤其刚才还叫我“长耳朵”。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2874
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a5d1c048:

    # Merel "That’s such a dated insult, too. I mean, geez. He ought to be embarrassed, trotting out lines like that."
    Merel "这骂法也太老掉牙了。真是的，搬出这种话，他该觉得丢脸才对。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2875
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fc06481d:

    # Merel "That’s the sort of stuff that folks in their eighties say!"
    Merel "那是八十多岁的人才会说的吧！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2877
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e4ed7e0e:

    # Nienke "He probably did learn it from somebody in their eighties. I know that Hendrik lives with his grandfather, so that’s probably where he picked it up..."
    Nienke "他可能真是跟八十多岁的人学的。我知道他跟爷爷住在一起，多半从那里听来的……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2879
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8fce18bf:

    # Nienke "And Mr Baas has never been the biggest fan of elves, either."
    Nienke "巴斯先生也从来不怎么喜欢精灵。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2881
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_94f9289e:

    # Merel "Heh. Well, that explains it."
    Merel "呵，那就说得通了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2885
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_edc090ab:

    # Merel "It’s no wonder he wound up with all of these old-fashioned ideas, bein’ stuck with an ancient fossil like that."
    Merel "跟那种老化石待在一起，难怪满脑袋都是过时的想法。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2887
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d1bc099d:

    # Merel "I s’pose people can’t help but be hateful if they’re left to stew in it."
    Merel "一直泡在仇恨里，人也难免变得刻薄吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2889
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f8026ce8:

    # Merel "I know we ain’t never gonna see a world where all humans accept elves as equals: where we’re able to stand side by side, hand in hand, without some people takin’ issue with it..."
    Merel "我知道，不可能有一天，所有人类都把精灵当作平等的存在，肩并肩、手牵手，也没人反对……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2891
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b90ac633:

    # Merel "But everybody here’s been mostly alright, despite that."
    Merel "可即便这样，这里大多数人还是挺好的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2893
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0245dc8a:

    # Merel "We’ve gotten a few funny looks in the streets, but all of the customers at Fleur de Lys are alright, at least. Some of them even tipped me!"
    Merel "街上是遇到过一些奇怪的目光，可百合花的客人至少都不错。有些还给我小费呢！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2895
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_47a10130:

    # Merel "They didn’t seem to care that I was an elf. They all treated me like an equal."
    Merel "好像根本不在乎我是不是精灵，都把我当普通人一样对待。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2897
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_18ca1c06:

    # Merel "I didn’t expect it — I didn’t know what to expect, actually — but it was...{w} nice, I guess."
    Merel "没想到会这样，其实原本也不知道该期待什么。不过……{w}真的挺好。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2899
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_61bbec61:

    # Nienke "Oh, really? Did you even enjoy serving Mrs van Dijk?"
    Nienke "哦，是吗？连招待范戴克太太，你都开心？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2902
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5d6a3baf:

    # Merel "Yeah! She was one of my favourite customers!"
    Merel "对呀！她是我最喜欢的客人之一！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2906
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_11ab23b3:

    # Merel "She might be a little sharp, but I know she means well. She only scolded you that one time, Nienke, for your own good. I get the feeling she’s been lookin’ out for you, too, in her own way."
    Merel "嘴巴是厉害了点，可心是好的。妮恩克，那次训你，也是为了你好。我觉得，她一直在用自己的方式照顾你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2907
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_eb9ef897:

    # Merel "She’s a grump, but I think she’s grumpy to absolutely everybody: man or elf. She treats us all the same."
    Merel "是个坏脾气老太太，可对谁都一样坏，不管人类还是精灵，一视同仁。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2909
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_943781a4:

    # Merel "She’s a nice lady, an’ she tipped me better’n everybody else! I can’t hold a grudge against her for that!"
    Merel "她人很好，而且小费给得最多！这样我怎么会讨厌她！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2911
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f0562198:

    # Nienke "Well, I would hope so. She {i}is{/i} a wealthy woman."
    Nienke "那也是应该的。她{i}确实{/i}很有钱。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2913
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_80c35111:

    # Merel "She is?"
    Merel "是吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2915
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a3b7b5ab:

    # Nienke "Mm. I used to go to her house for piano lessons when I was younger, and it’s extravagant. She showed me all of her jewellery once, and she has enough of it to fill a museum."
    Nienke "嗯。小时候去她家上钢琴课，那房子可豪华了。有一次她给我看首饰，数量多得都能开博物馆。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2917
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_85415dc3:

    # Nienke "Haven’t you noticed all of the rings she wears? She’s almost obscenely rich."
    Nienke "没注意她手上那些戒指吗？她有钱得都快不讲道理了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2919
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d8774329:

    # Merel "It must’ve slipped my mind, wahaha~"
    Merel "大概没留意，哇哈哈～"

# chapter3.rpyc:2921
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5475d288:

    # Merel "I don’t really pay attention to details like that. I’m not the most attentive, I guess, when it comes to clothes an’ jewellery an’ things..."
    Merel "衣服、首饰这些细节，我不太注意。在这方面，确实不够细心吧……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2923
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2ec06dbe:

    # Merel "But, no matter how wealthy old Mrs van Dijk might be, she didn’t need to tip me so much. She only did that ’cause she cares."
    Merel "不过，就算范戴克太太再有钱，也没必要给那么多小费。愿意给，是因为有心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2927
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5c2fe281:

    # Merel "She’s a sweet lady really, despite all of her bluster..."
    Merel "嘴上再凶，其实也是个好老太太……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2929
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_497d0c42:

    # Merel "An’ I think a lot of the people in Alpenrose have been pretty nice."
    Merel "而且阿尔彭罗瑟的人，大多都挺好。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2931
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0990311b:

    # Merel "My parents might’ve been pretty harsh about the world that ordinary humans live in, but I’m starting to think they were worrying about nothing!"
    Merel "我爸妈把普通人类的世界说得那么糟，可我现在觉得，他们可能白担心啦！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2933
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0fff5d12:

    # Merel "Comin’ to this place has been a lot of fun. I’m glad I came here: not just to see you, Nienke, but to see how you’ve been living. I didn’t know the world of humans could be so welcoming!"
    Merel "来这里真的很开心。妮恩克，我很高兴来了，不光是为了见你，也为了看看你的生活。没想到人类的世界还能这么友善！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2935
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_10b38ec0:

    # Nienke "H-Have you really been enjoying it that much?"
    Nienke "真、真的有那么开心？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2937
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_04f0bf89:

    # "I’m quite fond of Alpenrose myself, despite it being so secluded, but I’m not sure if I expected Merel to take to it so quickly."
    "这里虽然偏僻，我自己也很喜欢，可没想到她适应得这么快。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2938
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_42d3e44d:

    # "I thought she might find it boring, given the village is so isolated, and there’s so little to do."
    "村子隔绝，能做的事又少，本来以为她会觉得无聊。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2940
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d184ea09:

    # "There’s only a handful of shops on the main street, and most of the shops we do have are dedicated to antiques and second-hand books."
    "主街上就那么几家店，还大多卖古董和二手书。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2942
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_19759cd6:

    # "The population of Alpenrose skews pretty old, from what I’ve gathered, so it makes sense that the shops here would cater to the elderly and their nostalgia for the past."
    "据我所知，村里老人偏多，所以店铺迎合老人的喜好和怀旧心情，也很合理。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2943
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_86cabb65:

    # "Most of the wares you can buy here are ancient: the fashions out-dated and the books printed almost five decades ago."
    "能买到的大多是老东西：过时的衣服，快五十年前印的书。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2945
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_970d5cb5:

    # "It’s an old sort of village: so much so, it almost seems to be tinted sepia..."
    "这是个老村子，老得仿佛整个笼着一层褐黄色……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2947
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cc59a43b:

    # "But Merel doesn’t seem to mind. She beams at me, flashing a mouthful of pearly whites, as she says..."
    "可她一点不介意，笑着露出一口白牙，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2950
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3975ba78:

    # Merel "Yes, I do! I was a little sceptical at first, but wanderin’ around here has been a lot of fun!"
    Merel "真的！起初还有点怀疑，可逛下来，太好玩啦！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2951
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ece41c3d:

    # Merel "The air smells so sweet and fresh, and there’s so many things to do!"
    Merel "空气又清新又好闻，还有这么多事可以做！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2955
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_579aef4e:

    # Merel "There’s the cute gallery, and all the cafés, and teeny-tiny little shops tucked away in nooks and crannies — and there’s the fields, too!"
    Merel "可爱的美术馆，各种咖啡馆，藏在角角落落的小店，还有田野！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2957
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_68515036:

    # Merel "It’s so lush and green! I’m not really used to that: not in Mors Paravail, hehe."
    Merel "到处都绿油油的！在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔，可看不惯这种景色，嘿嘿。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2958
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c400281c:

    # Merel "The whole community’s underground, more or less, so we don’t see a lot of green, unless you count all of this weird fuzzy lichen stuff which grows on the cave walls."
    Merel "大家几乎都住在地下，见不到多少绿色。除非把洞壁上那些怪怪的、毛茸茸的地衣也算进去。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2960
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_13a64656:

    # Merel "It can be pretty gloomy in Mors Paravail, even with all of the lights strung up around the cave. It’s pretty dark..."
    Merel "就算洞里挂满灯，莫尔斯·帕拉维尔也还是挺阴沉，黑乎乎的……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2962
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_02db5519:

    # Merel "But it’s so nice and bright here! It’s like a whole other world!"
    Merel "这里却又明亮又漂亮！简直另一个世界！"

# chapter3.rpyc:2963
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_be0b6e54:

    # Merel "I’d love to come back here in the future, if I can — but do you know what?"
    Merel "可以的话，以后还想再来。不过，你知道吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2965
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_87a4eb74:

    # Nienke "No, um... What?"
    Nienke "不知道，嗯……什么？"

# chapter3.rpyc:2967
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1330dfbe:

    # Merel "Alpenrose might be pretty, but I’m mostly happy that I was able to see you again."
    Merel "这里是很美，可最让我开心的，还是又见到你。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2969
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_006f4f50:

    # Merel "I missed you, Niene..."
    Merel "我很想你，妮妮……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2975
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_77fab1db:

    # "Merel takes a step forward, then finds my hands with her own. Our fingers entwine and Merel beams."
    "她往前一步，找到我的手。十指相扣，她笑得灿烂。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2979
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_64db37bd:

    # Merel "And, now I’ve found you, I don’t wanna lose you again."
    Merel "现在既然找到了，就不想再把你弄丢。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2981
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5a6a7247:

    # "A giggling Merel examines me, her eyes half-lidded. Then, she dips her head, quicker than lightning."
    "她轻笑着望我，眼睛半垂，忽然飞快低头。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2982
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8e13e7a7:

    # "Her eyelids fall shut, her lips parting, as she presses a gentle kiss to my cheek."
    "眼帘合上，嘴唇微张，在我脸颊上落下轻轻一吻。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2984
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9d3254b3:

    # "I turn red almost immediately when I feel Merel’s lips on my cheek, but the kiss doesn’t linger."
    "唇一碰上来，我几乎立刻红了脸，可这个吻并没停留。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2991
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_53b64666:

    # "She draws back, then brightly declares..."
    "她退开，欢快地宣布……"

# chapter3.rpyc:2993
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_70dd8baf:

    # Merel "Alright! This gallery’s been pretty interesting, but I think I’ve seen enough windmills and fields and tulips for a while."
    Merel "好啦！美术馆挺有意思，不过风车、田野、郁金香，暂时看够了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:2998
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_55d82cbb:

    # Merel "Why don’t we take another look ’round the village? I’m sure there’s a bunch more stores I haven’t seen yet..."
    Merel "再去村里转转吧？肯定还有好多店没去过……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3000
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_76f61e93:

    # Merel "And I don’t know about you, Nienke, but I’m craving something sweet to eat."
    Merel "而且妮恩克，不知道你想不想，反正我有点馋甜的了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3004
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f1f3d83b:

    # Merel "D’you wanna visit one of the nearby cafés? I saw a really cute one on the way here!"
    Merel "去附近的咖啡馆怎么样？来时看见一家特别可爱！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3006
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_69125667_2:

    # Nienke "Oh, um..."
    Nienke "啊，嗯……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3008
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4b98a87e:

    # "I blink, my eyelids trembling, feeling a touch out of sorts."
    "我眨了眨颤动的眼皮，还有点回不过神。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3010
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_13d271b8:

    # "I was so caught up in my tender thoughts about Merel, I’d almost forgotten my surroundings."
    "刚才只顾着心里对她的那份柔软，几乎忘了周围。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3011
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f81ed6de:

    # "Merel’s kisses sure are powerful..."
    "梅蕾尔的吻，威力真大……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3012
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d2b031c1:

    # "Or maybe I’m simply easy to win over. I’m not sure which is worse."
    "或者只是我太容易被哄好。说不准哪种更糟。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3014
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5d455def:

    # Nienke "I, um, don’t mind that. I think I’m feeling a bit peckish myself, now that you mention it, a-ahaha..."
    Nienke "我，嗯，可以啊。你这么一说，我好像也有点饿了，啊哈哈……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3016
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a9387de4:

    # Merel "Then let’s go and grab something. It almost feels like a shame, since this place is so pretty..."
    Merel "那就去吃点东西。这里这么漂亮，现在走还有点可惜……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3018
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5d373c22:

    # Merel "But it’s alright. It’s not like this place will go anywhere, even if we do. We’re not gonna stay here all day..."
    Merel "不过没关系，我们走了，馆又不会跑。也不能一整天都待在这儿嘛……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3020
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_53b27994:

    # Merel "But we don’t need to."
    Merel "再说，也没必要。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3024
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9ee25422:

    # Merel "I can always come back. I’m sure I’ll be visiting Alpenrose lots, lots more in the future {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Merel "我随时可以回来。以后，一定还会来阿尔彭罗瑟很多、很多次{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3039
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_90e1e69b:

    # "It’s at Merel’s request that we next find ourselves in a café: a smallish, soothing sort of a venue with dark walls daubed with constellations."
    "应梅蕾尔的要求，接下来，我们来到一家不大的咖啡馆。气氛安静舒适，深色墙壁上画着星座。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3041
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_af734684:

    # "I’m not sure how accurate those constellations are, exactly. I don’t know enough about the stars. Maybe Merel’s father would be able to tell me that, if he was here, him being the so-called Bastion of Knowledge..."
    "不知道那些星座画得准不准，我懂得不够多。她那位号称满载知识的“巴士”爸爸如果在，应该能告诉我……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3043
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ff8fe589:

    # "But I don’t suppose the accuracy really matters."
    "不过，准不准好像也不重要。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3045
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ace9df8c:

    # "I’m sure my own father would take an issue with the gimmicky nature of this place, though — {i}and{/i} my mother, come to mention it."
    "我爸爸肯定会嫌这家店净搞花样。说起来，妈妈{i}也会{/i}。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3047
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_170336a7:

    # "Astrolabe is one of Fleur de Lys’s biggest competitors, but Merel wanted to come here. I couldn’t exactly refuse her..."
    "星盘可是百合花最大的对手之一。可梅蕾尔想来，我也不好拒绝……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3049
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_948ead45:

    # "And anyway, I’ve wanted to eat here for a while myself."
    "何况，我自己也想来吃很久了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3057
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_43820625:

    # "Astrolabe is rather chic. There’s something modern about all of the dark colours, not to mention the plush couches piled high with velvet pillows."
    "星盘很时髦。深色调显得现代，还有柔软的沙发，上面堆着天鹅绒靠垫。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3058
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_683027a8:

    # "Maybe Fleur de Lys could learn a thing or two about interior decorating from whoever designed this place."
    "也许，我们家该向这里的设计者学学室内布置。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3059
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ed2acb7f:

    # "Fleur de Lys is a very traditional sort of café, which attracts elderly women like Mrs van Dijk who dislike change, but is that the direction we should keep going on?"
    "百合花很传统，吸引着范戴克太太那样不爱变化的老妇人。可真该一直沿着这个方向走吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3060
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_55fd1d4e:

    # "Do we really want to pass up on the patronage of the younger crowd in Alpenrose?"
    "村里的年轻客人，就这样放过去了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3061
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0ed71b65:

    # "I’m not sure, and maybe I shouldn’t be worrying about this right now. I want to sample the food."
    "不知道。也许现在不该操心这些，我想先尝尝吃的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3062
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_87a7d6ac:

    # "Merel ordered a decadent chocolate sundae for us to share, and it looks incredibly opulent."
    "梅蕾尔点了一份豪华巧克力圣代，两个人分着吃，看起来奢侈极了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3070
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8a7120fc:

    # "The fluted sundae glass is piled high with scoops of ice cream: some vanilla, some chocolate."
    "高脚圣代杯里堆着满满的冰激凌球，有香草的，也有巧克力的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3071
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_741c4b43:

    # "The chocolate sauce drizzled on top of the ice cream scoops glistens in the dim lights, looking almost like a precious metal."
    "淋在上面的巧克力酱，在昏暗灯光下闪着光，几乎像贵金属。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3072
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d329c163:

    # "There’s a vanilla wafer poking out one side of the topmost peak of ice cream, and there are freshly cut fruits dotted about on the top like precious gems: cherries and bananas."
    "顶端插着一片香草威化饼，刚切好的水果像宝石一样点缀其间，有樱桃，也有香蕉。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3073
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8a918528:

    # "It’s quite the spectacle. It makes my mother’s scones and currant buns look very humble by comparison: almost prosaic."
    "这阵仗真够大的。相比之下，妈妈的司康和葡萄干面包都显得朴素，甚至有点平淡。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3074
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_be91ff74:

    # "My parents don’t serve anything on this scale at Fleur de Lys. They don’t really go in for ice cream in general, actually."
    "百合花没有这么夸张的甜点。其实，爸妈本来就不怎么做冰激凌。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3075
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_824ff2a1:

    # "The desserts in Fleur de Lys are mostly traditional: various slices of cake, and scones (sweet and savoury), and little tartlets."
    "我们店里的甜点大多传统：各式蛋糕切片、甜咸两种司康，还有小果挞。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3076
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1804073d:

    # "My mother’s a wonderful baker, and everything on the menu at Fleur de Lys tastes good. I’m especially fond of her apple tart: the crust soft and crispy, sparkling with sugar like something precious..."
    "妈妈烘焙手艺很好，菜单上每样东西都好吃。我尤其喜欢苹果挞，挞皮酥松，糖粒闪闪发亮，像件宝贝……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3077
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9c1cfa86:

    # "But the food we serve at Fleur de Lys can’t really compare to this sundae in terms of aesthetics."
    "可只论外表，我们家的东西确实比不上这杯圣代。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3088
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5c6f8319:

    # Merel "Mmm!"
    Merel "唔——！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3089
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5b0b2665:

    # "Merel sighs happily as she spoons the first mouthful of sundae into her mouth."
    "第一口圣代送进嘴里，梅蕾尔满足地叹息。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3091
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7da6b7aa:

    # Merel "This really is delicious! It might be one of the best things I’ve ever tasted!"
    Merel "真的太好吃了！可能是我吃过最好吃的东西之一！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3093
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ca202a4e:

    # Nienke "What about my mother’s apple pancakes? You were quick to sing their praises, too. I thought they were your favourites."
    Nienke "那妈妈的苹果煎饼呢？你当时也夸得厉害。我还以为那才是你最喜欢的。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3095
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_23990717:

    # Merel "Oh, right..."
    Merel "啊，对哦……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3096
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1a4e422e:

    # "Merel smiles bashfully (at least she has the good grace to blush)."
    "她不好意思地笑笑，至少还知道脸红。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3098
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_79f602c2:

    # Merel "Well, of course your mother’s cooking is delicious! I’m a huge, huge fan of her pancakes..."
    Merel "你妈妈做的当然好吃！我特别、特别喜欢她的煎饼……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3101
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bfcec3cc:

    # Merel "But this sundae is super sweet! It’s, like, on a whole other level! You can’t beat the feeling of sliding your spoon into this much ice cream, hehe."
    Merel "可这个圣代也太甜蜜了！完全是另一种感觉！勺子伸进这么多冰激凌里，没有比这更棒的，嘿嘿。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3102
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6da8b9ce:

    # Merel "It’s giving me a real rush!"
    Merel "吃得人都兴奋起来了！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3104
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1cfdf8e0:

    # Nienke "Well, if you say so."
    Nienke "嗯，你说是就是吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3110
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e6243725:

    # "I smile as I scoop a spoonful of ice cream and bring it to my mouth."
    "我笑着舀起一勺冰激凌，送进嘴里。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3111
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7063a98e:

    # "It tastes fine, but I think my mother’s food is even better. It’s homier..."
    "味道不错，可我觉得妈妈做的更好，有家的感觉……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3112
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a6b8b475:

    # "But, then again, I {i}am{/i} biased."
    "不过，我{i}确实{/i}偏心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3113
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c4388c31:

    # "I do wonder why Merel has been singing its praises so much..."
    "不禁有点好奇，她怎么夸得这么起劲……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3114
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_072176ab:

    # "But maybe she’s enjoying it because she’s sharing it with me?"
    "也许，是因为跟我分着吃，才这么开心？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3115
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8bc1d7e7:

    # "That’s...{w} a nice thought, I guess. In fact, it might be a little too nice."
    "这……{w}倒是个美好的想法。甚至美好得有点过头。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3116
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_54376ea5:

    # "Just turning the possibility of it over in my head is enough to make me flush."
    "光把这种可能在脑子里转一转，就足够让我脸红。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3117
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8c319111:

    # "Geez. H-How embarrassing. Since when did I turn into such a sappy maiden, anyway?"
    "真是的，好、好难为情。我什么时候变成这么肉麻的怀春少女了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3118
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d3d9d5b9:

    # "I know we elves always get typecast as the romantic sort, languishing after our loves after they go off to battle, but I don’t know if I’m like that."
    "我知道，精灵总被描绘成多情的种族，恋人出征，就只会相思成疾。可我不知道自己是不是那样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3119
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_91e83537:

    # "I like to think that I’m too stoic to swoon."
    "我宁愿相信，自己够冷静，不会动不动就神魂颠倒。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3120
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bcbe5ada:

    # "I’ve never given falling in love much thought before, but there’s something enticing about Merel."
    "以前没怎么认真想过恋爱，可梅蕾尔身上，确实有种吸引力。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3121
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b7fdf7bc:

    # "I guess it’s in the way she smiles. Her lips only need to curve up a couple of inches for her eyes to light up, just like semi-precious stones."
    "大概是她的笑吧。嘴角只要稍稍扬起，眼睛就亮了，像半宝石一般。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3122
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7fb8b2f9:

    # "Her eyes are positively sparkling right now, her face lightly flushed from happiness."
    "此刻，那双眼睛正闪闪发光，脸颊因为开心而微红。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3123
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4367cb0b:

    # "I’m happy for her, but..."
    "我替她高兴，可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3133
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b9a3db80:

    # Nienke "Hey. You should be careful."
    Nienke "喂，小心一点。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3135
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2424467c:

    # Merel "Of what?"
    Merel "小心什么？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3137
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_70bd5cef:

    # Nienke "If you eat too quickly, there’s a chance you might get brain freeze."
    Nienke "吃太快，可能会冰得头疼。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3139
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e4219c3e:

    # Merel "Ooh, right. That’s a good call, hehe..."
    Merel "哦，对。提醒得好，嘿嘿……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3141
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e4a570e1:

    # Merel "Or, at least, it {i}would{/i} be, if I wasn’t immune to that!"
    Merel "至少，如果我不是对这个免疫，那{i}确实{/i}提醒得好！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3143
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4bdb1cf4:

    # Nienke "Huh? Are you really?"
    Nienke "啊？真的免疫？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3145
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aba5da19:

    # Merel "That’s right! I’ve never experienced it before, even when I eat frozen fruits and berries, so don’t mind me."
    Merel "是呀！从来没疼过，吃冻水果、冻浆果都没事，所以别管我啦。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3147
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5121e53c:

    # Merel "Us elves from Mors Paravail are made of stern stuff! You don’t have to worry about me, wahaha!"
    Merel "莫尔斯·帕拉维尔出来的精灵，身板可硬实了！不用担心，哇哈哈！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3149
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f5024bef:

    # Nienke "...Right."
    Nienke "……好吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3151
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8b201fe7:

    # "Well, that’s interesting to know."
    "这倒是长见识了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3153
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6170eb58:

    # "I’m a little curious about why Merel has been eating frozen berries, but maybe it’s some sort of delicacy in Mors Paravail?"
    "有点好奇，她怎么会吃冻浆果。也许是故乡的什么美食？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3155
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8bdd9eb6:

    # "If it is, I wouldn’t remember it. My memories from those days are all a blur."
    "就算是，我也不记得了。那时的事，全都模模糊糊。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3157
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d68fc071:

    # "I can’t say I’m immune to brain freeze myself, though. I found that out the hard way, when I tried to cool down the summer before last with Cornelia by chewing my way through three ice lollies in one go."
    "反正我对冰得头疼可不免疫。前年夏天，跟科妮莉娅一起解暑，一口气啃了三根冰棍，就吃过苦头。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3159
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1127b3e8:

    # "Maybe I’m especially weak as far as dark elves go (well, I {i}was{/i} sick during my childhood), or Merel’s just unusually tough."
    "也许在暗精灵里，我算格外虚弱，毕竟小时候{i}确实{/i}病过。又或者，她格外结实。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3161
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_65c8e380:

    # Nienke "Well, putting that to one side, you also might end up swallowing your spoon if you eat too fast."
    Nienke "先不说这个，吃太快，也可能连勺子都吞下去。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3163
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ae3224cc:

    # Nienke "You might be a dark elf, but I don’t think being born in Mors Paravail would really help with that."
    Nienke "就算是暗精灵，出生在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔，对这事也没什么帮助吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3164
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_611fe19e:

    # Nienke "You’ll be just as susceptible to choking to death as anybody else, even if you don’t get brain freeze..."
    Nienke "哪怕不会冰得头疼，也一样可能噎死……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3166
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8c218fdc:

    # Nienke "And you should be careful about telling my parents that you came here."
    Nienke "还有，跟我爸妈说话时，小心别提来过这里。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3168
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a33c45ba:

    # Merel "Oh? Do your parents not like this place?"
    Merel "哦？他们不喜欢这家店？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3170
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f209ea5d:

    # Nienke "They don’t like any café which isn’t theirs. They see them all as competition: especially Astrolabe."
    Nienke "除了自己家，他们哪家咖啡馆都不喜欢，全当成对手，尤其星盘。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3172
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_08dc16f7:

    # Nienke "This place has been a thorn in my parents’ side ever since it opened. They’re always complaining that it’s been stealing their customers."
    Nienke "这家店开业起，就是他们的眼中钉。总抱怨它把客人抢走了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3173
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f219161d:

    # Nienke "It’s only been around for a couple of years, but it’s doing pretty well for itself, as you can see."
    Nienke "才开两年，你也看得见，生意已经挺不错。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3175
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2eee7926:

    # Nienke "Fleur de Lys, meanwhile, has been seeing a steady downturn in customers. My parents have been worrying about it."
    Nienke "百合花的客人却在慢慢减少，爸妈一直为这个发愁。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3177
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5dae35ff:

    # Merel "Oh no! I didn’t realise it was that bad. Will your parents be alright, Nienke?"
    Merel "啊！不知道已经这么严重。妮恩克，你爸妈没事吧？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3179
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3abeb0a1:

    # Nienke "I’m sure they’ll be fine. We’ve been getting on alright, and we don’t have too many expenses."
    Nienke "肯定没事。日子还过得去，开销也不多。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3180
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_080a2df2:

    # Nienke "My parents just like to complain. They always scowl whenever they pass this place, so we should keep our visit quiet."
    Nienke "他们只是爱抱怨。每次路过都要摆脸色，所以这次来，就别说了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3182
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2c37bc27:

    # Nienke "Don’t let them know that we ate at Astrolabe — and if you do happen to let it slip, please don’t tell them how much you’re enjoying this sundae."
    Nienke "别让他们知道我们在星盘吃东西。万一说漏嘴，也拜托别说你有多喜欢这杯圣代。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3184
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3d3fba51:

    # Nienke "I’m afraid that it’ll break my parents’ poor hearts..."
    Nienke "我怕他们可怜的心脏承受不住……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3186
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a8210a67:

    # "And I’m also concerned my parents might end up disowning me."
    "也有点担心，他们会不会跟我断绝关系。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3188
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0e2b47ca:

    # "This might sound like an exaggeration, but I don’t want to risk it. My parents can be quite sensitive, and while I doubt they’d actually kick me out on the streets, I think they would feel betrayed."
    "听着可能夸张，可我不想冒险。爸妈有时很敏感。倒不至于真把我赶上街，但肯定会觉得被背叛。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3190
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c0742620:

    # "Eating at a competitor’s café seems like a poor way to repay my parents for everything they’ve done for me."
    "他们为我做了那么多，我却跑到竞争对手的店里吃东西，这报答实在不怎么样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3191
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5e24d1ce:

    # "They might grate on me sometimes, but I don’t think my parents are bad people. I know they care about me..."
    "有时候是让我烦，可他们不是坏人，我知道他们关心我……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3193
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ed874cbf:

    # Merel "...Hehe. Well, alright."
    Merel "……嘿嘿，好吧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3195
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b766c037:

    # "And I think they care about Merel, too."
    "也关心梅蕾尔。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3197
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_103fe638:

    # "They’ve been good hosts, and maybe that’s why Merel relents. She smiles, gently nudging my foot beneath the tabletop with her own, as she says..."
    "他们招待得很好，也许因此，她答应了。她笑着，在桌下拿脚轻轻碰我的脚，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3199
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1066ce3d:

    # Merel "I don’t know if your parents would be all that upset. They seem like reasonable people to me..."
    Merel "不知道他们会不会那么生气。看着都挺讲道理的……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3201
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c7045f89:

    # "She can only say that because she doesn’t know how upset they were when Ezra, one of our waiters, defected to Astrolabe last year because it pays slightly better."
    "她会这么说，只是因为不知道，去年我们家的服务生埃兹拉，为了稍高一点的工资转去星盘时，爸妈有多气。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3203
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0eacdebe:

    # "They kept calling him a traitor, and they spat his name when it came up with real vitriol."
    "一直骂他叛徒，提起名字都咬牙切齿。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3204
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6c919568:

    # "My parents were so upset about his betrayal I wouldn’t be surprised if I uncovered a secret room in our house with a dartboard plastered with Ezra’s face hanging on the wall."
    "气成那样，就算哪天发现家里有个密室，墙上挂着贴了埃兹拉照片的飞镖靶，我也不会意外。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3206
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2ddac271:

    # Merel "Buuut if it’ll cause any issues, I’ll keep this to myself. I wouldn’t want to upset them: not when they’ve made me feel so welcome!"
    Merel "不——过，既然会惹麻烦，那我就不说啦。他们把我照顾得这么好，我可不想惹他们伤心！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3208
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_37dc54ab:

    # Merel "Your parents have been really nice to me, but so have you! I don’t wanna make your life any harder, so this can be our little secret!"
    Merel "你爸妈对我好，你也一样。我不想让你为难，就当是我们的小秘密吧！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3210
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2b2b05a0:

    # "Merel accompanies this jaunty exclamation with a wink: one which makes my heart flutter."
    "她欢快地说完，又眨了下眼，弄得我心口一颤。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3211
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_31b76d92:

    # "I should be used to Merel’s effusive cheeriness by now, and I suppose part of me is..."
    "按说，早该习惯她这股洋溢的热情了，心里有一部分，也确实习惯了……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3212
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_60eef8d1:

    # "But, for whatever reason, that wink gets to me."
    "可不知道为什么，这个眨眼还是击中了我。"

