# chapter3.rpyc:3459
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a867e4df:

    # Jenny "{i}And they’re such gorgeous dresses, I’m sure they’ll photograph so nicely!{/i}"
    Jenny "{i}裙子这么美，拍出来一定很好看！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3461
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5967611b:

    # Jenny "{i}I can pose you with bouquets, and stand in front of the church. I’m sure it’ll look gorgeous: especially with the setting sun coming through the stained glass. It’ll be like something from a fairytale.{/i}"
    Jenny "{i}让你们捧着花，站在教堂前，肯定漂亮！尤其夕阳透过彩绘玻璃的时候，简直像童话。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3463
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ffbd9cef:

    # Jenny "{i}Please say that you’ll both model for me! Please, please, please! It would mean the world to me!{/i}"
    Jenny "{i}答应给我当模特吧！求求你们，拜托拜托！这对我太重要了！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3464
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f67a84c6:

    # "Jenny wheedled like this for a good five minutes after I tried to turn her down."
    "我试着拒绝，她却这样软磨硬泡了足足五分钟。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3465
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5f17a1d6:

    # "I had a few misgivings about this whole thing, but Jenny continued to beg and plead until she wore me down."
    "原本还有不少顾虑，可她一直央求，最后把我磨得没脾气。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3466
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1e1defcb:

    # "She can be quite persuasive when she wants..."
    "真想说服人的时候，她还挺有本事……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3467
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dade8c4d:

    # "And I still feel guilty about making such a huge mess in her store a few days ago."
    "而且，前几天把她店里弄得一团糟，我还内疚着。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3478
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_25979d40:

    # "That’s why I end up acquiescing. I didn’t have much of a choice, and Merel {i}does{/i} seem rather excited by this, though I don’t really understand why."
    "所以最后还是答应了。也没多少选择，而且梅蕾尔{i}确实{/i}很兴奋，虽然我不太懂为什么。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3479
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_61f158f0:

    # "I help Merel lace up the back of her gown, in any case, while Merel grins."
    "总之，我帮她系着婚纱背后的带子，她则笑个不停。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3492
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_36b1e130:

    # Merel "Hey, doesn’t this one make me look kinda sexy? It shows off my back muscles, wahaha!"
    Merel "喂，这件是不是让我有点性感？背上的肌肉都露出来了，哇哈哈！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3493
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e42e8bef:

    # Nienke "Yes, but it’s not supposed to. I need to get you fastened up properly. Now, stand still."
    Nienke "是，可它本来不该露。得好好系上才行。站着别动。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3494
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e0eb2d48:

    # Merel "Aye, aye, ma’am! Whatever you say!"
    Merel "遵命，女士！您说了算！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3495
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e164c494:

    # "Merel giggles as I continue to attack the ribbons at the back of her gown. I pull and I pull and I pull, winching in her waist, until..."
    "她咯咯笑着，我继续跟背后的缎带较劲，一次次往紧里拉，收住她的腰，直到……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3496
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9616fe20:

    # Merel "Phew! This dress is kinda tight, wahaha~ Maybe I shouldn’t’ve eaten so much of that sundae earlier..."
    Merel "呼！这裙子有点紧啊，哇哈哈～刚才圣代也许不该吃那么多……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3497
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2da9d93a:

    # "I’m eventually able to get them tied shut, though not without a significant degree of force on my end."
    "最后总算系好了，可真没少费力。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3498
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e1c0ff36:

    # "Goodness. That was exhausting. I’d like to sit down now, and take a breather, but there’s even more work to be done. I have to fix my own dress next."
    "天哪，累死了。真想坐下来喘口气，可还有事没做，接着得整理自己的裙子。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3499
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_644095b3:

    # "I adjust my gloves, then fix my veil to my hair."
    "我调整好手套，把头纱固定在发间。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3500
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_76ea2377:

    # "I’m still fussing about the placement of my veil, and the way it falls over my hair (that seems like a better use of my time than thinking too deeply about how embarrassing it’ll be to pose with Merel later), when Jenny comes to check on us."
    "还在折腾头纱的位置和垂落的样子时，珍妮来查看了。纠结这个，总比细想待会儿跟梅蕾尔摆姿势有多害羞强。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3501
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_89d9c1c9:

    # "She grins at us both, then asks if we’re okay to start posing: something which Merel responds to with her usual enthusiasm."
    "她笑着问，能不能开始拍了。梅蕾尔照例热情地回答。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3502
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_93a9cca4:

    # Merel "That’s right! I’m as ready as I’ll ever be! What about you, Nienke?"
    Merel "当然！准备得不能再好了！妮恩克，你呢？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3503
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_06fcd96a:

    # "I’m not too certain myself. I’m more than a little self-conscious: not just about the placement of my veil, but something even more significant."
    "我可不确定。心里别扭得很，不光为了头纱，还有更重要的原因。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3504
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_78adf4ef:

    # "I’m worried that I look a fool, wearing an outfit like this."
    "怕穿成这样，自己像个傻瓜。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3505
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_dbf51814:

    # "I do like wearing dresses, and white {i}is{/i} one of my favourite colours, but this wedding gown is decidedly fancier than anything I’ve tried on before."
    "我喜欢裙子，白色{i}也是{/i}最喜欢的颜色之一，可这套婚纱比以前穿过的任何衣服都华丽。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3506
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b8bbfe7b:

    # "The bottom of the gown brushes the floor when I walk, and the skirt is rather heavy."
    "走路时裙底扫着地，裙摆又重。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3507
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_eb7d1a77:

    # "Since I’m so short, I’m worried that the dress swamps me. I’m afraid I must look like a young girl: one playing dress-up with her mother’s clothes..."
    "我个子小，怕整个人都被裙子吞没，像个偷穿妈妈衣服玩变装的小女孩……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3508
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2c730f12:

    # "But Jenny’s expression is gentle. She doesn’t look mocking, which does reassure me."
    "不过珍妮神情温柔，半点没有嘲弄，这倒让我安心了一些。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3509
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b4664ee2:

    # Nienke "...I’m alright. We can start the shoot now."
    Nienke "……我好了，可以开始。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3510
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d2f29ea4:

    # Jenny "Wonderful! Let’s go outside, then. We can take your photo in front of the church, by the big stained glass window!"
    Jenny "太棒了！那去外面吧，在教堂前那扇大彩绘玻璃窗旁拍！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3511
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_66ff4c07:

    # Jenny "I’m sure you’ll both look lovely together. You’re such pretty girls, and you suit those dresses so well! It’s like they were made for you!"
    Jenny "你们站在一起肯定很好看。人漂亮，裙子也合适，简直量身定做一样！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3527
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6cb139ac:

    # "Jenny keeps up a string of praise as she guides Merel and I out of the chapter house, and all of the way outside the church."
    "她一路夸着，领我们走出议事厅，来到教堂外。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3528
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0cd86065:

    # "She gives me a prop to hold — a large bouquet of white roses — and asks me to stand beneath the stained glass window, facing Merel."
    "递给我一大束白玫瑰作道具，让我站在彩绘玻璃窗下，面朝梅蕾尔。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3532
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_62ab6114:

    # "I look back at her, my face more than a little flushed."
    "我望回去，脸已经红得厉害。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3533
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b3e3a5ca:

    # "The hour is starting to get on, and the sun is beginning to set. Merel’s hair shimmers in the sunset, as do her eyes: large and red like jewels."
    "时候渐晚，太阳开始西沉。她的头发在夕照里闪光，那双又大又红、宝石般的眼睛也是。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3534
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0b9c25c9:

    # "My heart hammers in my chest as I look at Merel shyly, observing her beneath my eyelashes."
    "我羞怯地从睫毛下望着她，心脏在胸口重重跳动。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3535
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d619a42f:

    # "I don’t know if she’s ever looked more beautiful."
    "她好像从没这么美过。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3536
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_395e9844:

    # "She looks so pretty, in fact, there’s something almost intimidating about her."
    "美得甚至有点让人不敢靠近。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3537
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_82b7b24e:

    # "I feel afraid to stand so close to her, fearful that my flushed face might give away the depth of my feelings for her..."
    "站得这么近，我有些害怕。怕通红的脸，会把自己有多喜欢她，全都泄露出去……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3538
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3e07e62d:

    # Merel "Hey, Nienke, don’t hang back like that! Come a little closer, why don’t’cha? You can trust me!"
    Merel "喂，妮恩克，别躲那么远嘛！再靠近一点，好不好？相信我就行！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3539
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2a11aa83:

    # "But Merel’s smile is bright, and it’s reassuring."
    "可她笑得明亮，又让人安心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3540
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1353b090:

    # "I look up at Merel, my face flushed, while Jenny clicks away with her camera."
    "我红着脸抬头看她，珍妮在旁边咔嚓咔嚓地拍。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3549
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_05dbe39e:

    # Jenny "That’s right! Pose just like that. Look one another in the eye — and, yes, you can tip your head upwards, Nienke. That looks lovely!"
    Jenny "对！就这样。看着彼此的眼睛，嗯，妮恩克，头可以再抬一点。真好看！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3550
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6486f482:

    # Jenny "I have such a good angle right now, and the lighting is perfect! I couldn’t have dreamed of getting a better shot."
    Jenny "这个角度太好了，光线也完美！做梦都想不到能拍得这么好。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3551
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b99873dd:

    # Jenny "You two are naturals at this!"
    Jenny "你们俩天生就会这个！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3552
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_88235915:

    # "Jenny burbles away in the background, giving us instructions, but I’m hardly listening to her."
    "珍妮在旁边兴奋地指导，可我几乎听不进去。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3553
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bb3d421a:

    # "Her voice fades away, masked by the fluttering of my heart and the sensation of my own blood as it rushes through my head."
    "她的声音渐渐远去，被心跳和血液涌上头的声响盖住。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3562
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8d8b7d4f:

    # "While Jenny is clicking away, shifting this way and that to get better angles, Merel remains still. She looks at me, her eyes half-lidded, and says..."
    "她不停按快门，变换位置找更好的角度。梅蕾尔却站着不动，半垂着眼望我，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3563
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cb4544a6:

    # Merel "Now, this takes me back. Don’t you think this is kinda nostalgic, Nienke?"
    Merel "这可真让人想起从前。妮恩克，不觉得有点怀念吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3564
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d4247f0b:

    # Nienke "It is...?"
    Nienke "是吗……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3565
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_871b59b0:

    # Merel "Yeah! I never thought we’d actually be able to make good on that childhood promise. I mean, we were both little kids when we said all that stuff..."
    Merel "是呀！没想到真能兑现小时候的约定。说那些话时，我们还都是小孩子呢……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3566
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_563700df:

    # Merel "But it was a long time ago. Maybe you don’t remember?"
    Merel "不过已经过去很久，你也许不记得了？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3567
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c9db0766:

    # Merel "I had always wondered how you’d look in a wedding dress, though. I knew you’d be adorable!"
    Merel "可我一直想知道，你穿婚纱会是什么样。就知道一定可爱极了！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3568
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_30adfeed:

    # "A promise...?"
    "约定……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3569
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c30bb822:

    # "I frown. I don’t remember any promise, but..."
    "我皱起眉。什么约定，我不记得。可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3570
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c3af4807_4:

    # Nienke "Oh..."
    Nienke "啊……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3571
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_39faf7c1:

    # "Now that Merel mentions it, there is something familiar about this; something faintly nostalgic."
    "被她这么一提，还真有种熟悉的感觉，带着隐约的怀念。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3572
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b42421e5:

    # "It’s been buried in the annals of my memory, just out of reach, but this {i}does{/i} sound familiar."
    "它埋在记忆深处，总差一点够不着。可这{i}确实{/i}很熟悉。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3583
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d2023f25:

    # "I remember kneeling on the ground, sniffling, my skinned right knee oozing droplets of ruby red."
    "我想起自己跪在地上，抽着鼻子。右膝擦破了，沁出红宝石一样的血珠。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3584
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0463048f:

    # "Roan had pushed me over, and I’d started to bleed. I think he was perturbed himself about how much he’d hurt me, because he backed off a little after I fell, wide-eyed."
    "罗安推倒了我，我开始流血。他似乎也被伤势吓到，睁大眼睛，往后退了一点。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3585
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fd4faf6e:

    # "Typically, Roan would have hurled even more insults at me, but he kept his lips clamped together after that little incident played out."
    "平时他肯定还会骂个不停，可这次出事以后，嘴却抿得死紧。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3586
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_772405a1:

    # "He looked pretty ashen himself, some of the colour fading from his face."
    "脸也有些发白，褪了血色。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3587
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5441bc87:

    # "I’m certain that he regretted what he did, but he was too prideful to admit as much, or to apologise."
    "我敢说，他后悔了。可太骄傲，不肯承认，也不肯道歉。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3588
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4e74d4d0:

    # "I don’t think even Roan was callous enough to insult a young girl who was bleeding because of him, but he couldn’t leave well enough alone."
    "就算罗安，也没冷酷到继续辱骂一个被他弄得流血的小女孩。可他也不肯就这么算了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3589
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_627c9c4f:

    # "He didn’t scarper once I fell. Instead, he stood there, watching me from a distance: fixing me with those dark, slate grey eyes of his."
    "我跌倒以后，他没跑，只站在远处，那双深深的石灰色眼睛一直盯着我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3590
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_61571144:

    # "He watched me crouching in the dirt, watched me sobbing, my knee slowly oozing."
    "看我蹲在泥地里哭，看血从膝盖上一点点渗出来。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3591
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_71643956:

    # "He caused me pain, and while I don’t think it would be accurate to say that he didn’t care, he didn’t care enough to try and help me."
    "他让我受伤。说他完全不在意，也不准确，可那点在意，又不足以让他来帮忙。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3592
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2c5b6f3c:

    # "He stood there, frozen in limbo, when..."
    "他僵在原地，不知进退。这时……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3599
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9e3d95e8:

    # Merel "{i}Hey! You leave Niene alone! She didn’t do anythin’ wrong.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}喂！不许欺负妮妮！她又没做错什么。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3600
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_aed74ec7:

    # Merel "{i}You’re pathetic, picking on her because she won’t roll over and take your abuse! What’s wrong with you, anyway?!{/i}"
    Merel "{i}就因为她不肯任你们欺负，就专门找她麻烦，你们也太没出息了！到底什么毛病？！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3601
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7bacf829:

    # Merel "{i}Now, get lost! Scram! Shoo! Don’t let me catch you botherin’ Niene again, or I’ll make you sorry!{/i}"
    Merel "{i}滚开！走开！别再让我看见你们欺负妮妮，不然让你们好看！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3602
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_35dce83c:

    # "Merel appeared: my knight in shining armour, though she was dressed in a scruffy shirt and an equally scruffy skirt with uneven pleats and a rip up the side."
    "梅蕾尔出现了，我的骑士。虽然身上只是件邋遢上衣，配同样邋遢的裙子，褶皱不整齐，侧边还破了口。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3603
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0e82f29d:

    # "She confronted Roan on my behalf, and as soon as she arrived, Roan’s easy self-confidence began to slip."
    "她替我站出来对峙。一见她，罗安那副游刃有余的自信就开始松动。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3604
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1202f400:

    # "She must have intimidated him: not just because of her verbal threats, but because of the ominous way she cracked her knuckles."
    "他肯定怕她。不光因为嘴上的威胁，还因为她把指关节掰得咔咔响，听着就危险。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3605
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ac6f963c:

    # "Merel wasn’t exactly sparing when it came to physical violence. She’d used it before, when Roan was being especially awful, and he still had the bruises from their last altercation to prove it."
    "说起动手，梅蕾尔可不含糊。罗安特别过分时，她以前就打过。上次冲突留下的淤青，还在他身上。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3606
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ffd222d6:

    # "He must have known there was no sense in standing up to Merel. None of the kids in Mors Paravail could get the better of her."
    "他一定知道，跟她硬碰没意义。莫尔斯·帕拉维尔的小孩，谁都打不过她。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3607
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a9458e83:

    # "Merel was taller than everybody else, even the boys, and she was stronger, too."
    "她比所有人都高，男孩子也一样，而且力气更大。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3608
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_82849d88:

    # "Roan, realising there was nothing to be gained from hanging around, scowled."
    "明白留下来也讨不了好，罗安沉下脸。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3609
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0b30b728:

    # Roan "{i}...Whatever. There’s no point hanging around anymore.{/i}"
    Roan "{i}……随便，反正也没必要待着了。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3610
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fb891943:

    # Roan "{i}It looks like her majesty’s bodyguard is here. We wouldn’t wanna get on Merel’s bad side, so let’s scarper...{/i}"
    Roan "{i}女王陛下的保镖来了。可别惹梅蕾尔，我们走……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3611
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4cdc910a:

    # Roan "{i}But I’m not running away, you understand?! This is a tactical retreat. Army generals are doing it all the time! It doesn’t mean you’ve beaten me...{/i}"
    Roan "{i}可我不是逃跑，听见没有？！这是战术撤退。将军都常常这么干，不代表你赢了……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3612
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_252e8b60:

    # Roan "{i}And don’t get any funny ideas, you hear? It’s not my fault that stupid Nienke is sobbing! Sure, I might’ve pushed her, but I didn’t push her {/i}that{i} hard!{/i}"
    Roan "{i}还有，别想歪了！笨蛋妮恩克哭，可不是我的错！我是推了她，可又没推得{/i}那么{i}重！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3613
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c8915557:

    # Roan "{i}I didn’t mean for her to hurt her stupid knee. That’s all her fault! She should’ve stood her ground like you always do, Merel. She’s such a baby!{/i}"
    Roan "{i}我没想弄伤她那个破膝盖，是她自己不好！梅蕾尔，她该像你一样站稳才对。真是个小宝宝！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3614
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5d917230:

    # "It was with this dismissive remark that Roan finally departed, leaving Merel to shout a string of obscenities after him so colourful they made me blush."
    "丢下这句不负责任的话，他终于走了。梅蕾尔在身后骂了一串脏话，花样多得让我脸红。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3615
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a18a6db7:

    # "I knew that Merel was only cursing on my behalf, because she was worried about me, but even I was a little intimidated."
    "知道她是担心我，替我出气，可连我都被吓到了一点。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3616
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d9fe3995:

    # "Merel was my best friend — my knight in shining armour — but she could be pretty scary when she wanted."
    "她是我最好的朋友，我的骑士。但真想凶起来，也挺可怕。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3617
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_13fc6ffc:

    # "I knew that I could trust her, though."
    "不过，我知道能信任她。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3618
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2bbe6462:

    # "I knew that she would never betray me, and she would never turn on me; not like Roan."
    "她不会背叛我，不会像罗安那样，转头就跟我作对。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3619
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b6df30a1:

    # "He had once claimed to like me, but his fond feelings didn’t last all that long."
    "他也说过喜欢我，可那份喜欢没坚持多久。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3620
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b5eba126:

    # "They withered the moment I told him that I didn’t like him in the same way that he liked me. He turned against me the moment I refused to let him kiss me..."
    "一说我不以同样的方式喜欢他，那点好感就枯萎了。我不肯让他亲，他立刻翻了脸……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3621
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_465b3f20:

    # "But I knew that Merel would never do that."
    "可我知道，梅蕾尔绝不会那样。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3622
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0cc06536:

    # "She stopped cursing once Roan ran off, his proverbial tail between his legs, then glanced over her shoulder at me."
    "等罗安夹着尾巴跑走，她停下骂声，回头看我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3623
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_46d75cef:

    # "Maybe she realised she’d gone a bit too far in chasing him off because her smile was a little sheepish."
    "大概也意识到，刚才赶人时凶过了头，她笑得有点不好意思。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3624
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2942dc9d:

    # "She ran a hand through her hair, which was messy, as per usual, then said..."
    "手指穿过那头照例乱糟糟的头发，她说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3625
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_9f42aab2:

    # Merel "{i}Hey there, princess. Are you alright?{/i}"
    Merel "{i}喂，公主，没事吧？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3626
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b5df9b1b:

    # Nienke "{i}I, um... I don’t...{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}我，嗯……我不知道……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3627
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_476cc2e1:

    # "I sniffled, more tears beading in my eyes, sharp and salty."
    "我吸着鼻子，更多眼泪冒出来，咸咸的，刺得眼睛疼。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3628
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5d0ecc2e:

    # "Roughly, I rubbed my eyes with the back of my arm. I didn’t want to keep crying: not over Roan, of all people."
    "用手背粗粗擦过眼睛，我不想再哭了，尤其不想为罗安哭。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3629
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_740c76c9:

    # "He wasn’t worth wasting my tears on..."
    "他不值得我浪费眼泪……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3630
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_166c0f5b:

    # "Or, at least, that’s what I tried to tell myself."
    "至少，我努力这么告诉自己。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3631
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c2b3cde6:

    # "I inhaled wetly, then said..."
    "抽噎着吸了口气，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3632
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_24a42190:

    # Nienke "{i}I-I don’t know why they’re always so cruel to me! Wh-What did I even do wrong? Why are they like this...?!{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}我、我不知道他们为什么总对我这么坏！到底做错什么了？为、为什么要这样……？！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3633
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_70f43cd4:

    # Merel "{i}Hey there...{/i}"
    Merel "{i}好了……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3634
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_031074bf:

    # "Merel smiled at me softly. She reached to me, her arms widening, as she said..."
    "她温柔地笑着，向我张开双臂，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3635
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5b13cc04:

    # Merel "{i}It’s alright. You don’t need to worry about them. I’m here.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}没事了。不用怕他们，有我在。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3636
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5f527c6e:

    # "I knew that much, of course, but I had no way of knowing whether she would stay with me."
    "这个，我当然知道，可不知道她会不会一直留下。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3637
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7eaf1ecc:

    # "I didn’t want her to leave. She was the only friend I had, and I needed her. This need filled me, so intense it made me tremble. I wished that I didn’t rely on her so much..."
    "我不想她走。她是我唯一的朋友，我需要她。那份需要强烈得让人发抖，真希望自己别这么依赖……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3638
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3d8ed84b:

    # "But, despite that, I was still drawn to her. I had nobody else I could turn to..."
    "可还是不由自主地想靠近她。我没有别人可以依靠……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3639
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_66faac1f:

    # "So, I threw myself at her, my head smacking against her chest so hard I probably winded her."
    "于是扑进她怀里，脑袋重重撞上胸口，可能都把她撞得喘不过气。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3640
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a406c2a6:

    # Nienke "{i}Y-You won’t leave me, will you? You promise you’ll stay by my side?{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}你、你不会丢下我吧？保证一直陪着我？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3641
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_effdcc35:

    # Merel "{i}Well, of course I won’t leave you! Why would I, when I care about you so much? You’re my best friend in this place, Niene!{/i}"
    Merel "{i}当然不会！我这么在乎你，为什么要走？妮妮，你是我在这里最好的朋友！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3642
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ed20bdc2:

    # Merel "{i}I love you a lot, so I’m gonna look out for you. I swear.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}我特别喜欢你，会好好保护你的。我发誓。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3643
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_28c1b48f:

    # Nienke "{i}Y-You really mean it?{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}真、真的？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3644
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3683c112:

    # Merel "{i}’Course I mean it. Have you ever known me to break a promise?{/i}"
    Merel "{i}当然是真的。你见过我说话不算数吗？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3645
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c27f1a21:

    # Merel "{i}I said it once before, and I’ll say it again. I’m not gonna abandon you. We’ll always be together, and I ain’t gonna leave you.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}以前说过，现在再说一次。我不会丢下你。我们会一直在一起，我哪儿也不去。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3646
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e991d505:

    # Merel "{i}Now, don’t cry.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}好了，别哭啦。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3647
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_be843c97:

    # "Merel smiled at me, while resting her hand atop my head. Gently, she patted me, twining her fingers through my dark hair, as she said..."
    "她微笑着，把手放在我头顶，轻轻拍拍，手指穿过深色的发丝，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3648
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3e7ad734:

    # Merel "{i}There’s no need to sob over Roan and the others. They don’t deserve it.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}没必要为罗安他们哭。他们不值得。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3649
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8716bd92:

    # Merel "{i}They’re just stupid, smelly boys. You shouldn’t cry for them, Niene!{/i}"
    Merel "{i}就是一群又笨又臭的男孩子。妮妮，别为他们掉眼泪！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3650
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_184be8cd:

    # Nienke "{i}I-I know I shouldn’t — and I don’t want to. It’s not like I’m upset about Roan or anything...{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}我、我知道不该哭，也不想哭。才不是因为罗安难过什么的……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3651
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e223d249:

    # Nienke "{i}But I {/i}did{i} skin my knee. It hurts...{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}可膝盖{/i}真的{i}擦破了，好疼……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3652
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e2a0c3d8:

    # Merel "{i}I can imagine it would, you poor thing. I don’t think it’s a deep cut, but it still looks nasty.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}肯定疼，可怜的小家伙。伤口应该不深，不过看着也够难受的。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3653
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7ca4e08a:

    # Merel "{i}Did he do it on purpose?{/i}"
    Merel "{i}他是故意的吗？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3654
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_35f68372:

    # Nienke "{i}I-I don’t think so. He seemed surprised when I fell, and when I started to bleed. I think he felt at least a little bad about it...{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}应、应该不是。摔倒流血时，他好像也吓到了。我觉得，他至少有一点过意不去……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3655
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f5b89404:

    # Nienke "{i}B-But it still hurts!{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}可、可是，还是疼啊！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3656
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ca9fe872:

    # Merel "{i}I can only imagine. You poor thing.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}肯定很疼，真可怜。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3657
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_10ab5708:

    # Merel "{i}I’m sorry that I couldn’t have come to you sooner. As your prince, I’m meant to protect you, but I ain’t done too good at it.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}对不起，没早点过来。身为你的王子，本来该保护你，可我没做好。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3658
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_77db8aed:

    # Merel "{i}Will you be alright?{/i}"
    Merel "{i}能撑住吗？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3659
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0a427c8e:

    # Nienke "{i}Well, I do feel a little better, now I’m with you...{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}嗯，跟你在一起，已经好一点了……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3660
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7b988c2e:

    # Nienke "{i}A-And you really will stay with me?{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}而、而且，你真的会一直陪我？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3661
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_40f14151:

    # Merel "{i}Really, really! If you’re a princess, then {/i}I’m{i} your prince, and princes have gotta look after princesses. That’s their job!{/i}"
    Merel "{i}真的，真的！你是公主，{/i}我{i}就是王子。王子当然要照顾公主，这就是职责嘛！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3662
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_32cfe9da:

    # Nienke "{i}A job, hmm? I don’t know if I like that...{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}职责啊……我不太喜欢这样。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3663
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a3211bc9:

    # Merel "{i}You don’t?!{/i}"
    Merel "{i}不喜欢？！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3664
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_856a8e1e:

    # Nienke "{i}No. I don’t want you to look after me because it’s a job. Jobs are bad things. People do them because they have to, not because they want to.{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}不喜欢。我不想让你把照顾我当工作。工作不好，大家是不得不做，又不是因为想做。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3665
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_08303000:

    # Nienke "{i}I want you to stay with me because you like me — but I don’t want you getting tired of me, either!{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}我想让你因为喜欢我才留下，可也不想让你厌倦我！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3666
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_605a60f0:

    # Nienke "{i}I don’t want you to leave...{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}不想让你走……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3667
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7d4d976e:

    # Merel "{i}And I already said, I won’t! I like you, you dolt!{/i}"
    Merel "{i}都说了，不会走！我喜欢你呀，小傻瓜！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3668
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_067866db:

    # Nienke "{i}And yet, you called me a ‘dolt’.{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}可你还叫我“小傻瓜”。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3669
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5994a000:

    # Nienke "{i}You can be kind of mean to me sometimes too, Merel, even when you’re trying to be nice.{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}梅蕾尔，你有时候也挺凶的。想对我好时，也是。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3670
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_db25ace3:

    # Merel "{i}D’you really think so?{/i}"
    Merel "{i}真的这么觉得？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3671
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3eee68d6:

    # Nienke "{i}Yes, I do. You’re a bit of a bully...{w} which is probably why the other bullies are scared of you.{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}嗯。你也有点爱欺负人……{w}所以别的坏孩子才怕你吧。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3672
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a84aa5d5:

    # Nienke "{i}My daddy always says you should fight fire with fire, though I don’t get it. I think that’d make an even bigger fire. It doesn’t exactly sound safe...{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}爸爸总说，要以火攻火，可我不懂。那不是会烧得更大吗？听起来一点也不安全……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3673
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_87fbfd76:

    # Nienke "{i}But, if you want me to believe you, then you have to do something to prove that you care about me.{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}不过，想让我相信，就得做点什么，证明你真的在乎我。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3674
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_f8e5cb81:

    # Merel "{i}Oh, really? And how d’you think I can do that?{/i}"
    Merel "{i}哦？那你觉得，要怎么证明？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3675
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_772e6ee7:

    # Nienke "{i}I think it should be obvious. If you’re serious about looking out for me, then you have to marry me.{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}这不是很明显吗？真想照顾我，就得跟我结婚。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3676
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_003f7f43:

    # Nienke "{i}That way, we can always be together. Doesn’t that sound good?{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}这样就能永远在一起了，不好吗？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3677
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_cfa0a89b:

    # Merel "{i}Marriage, huh...?{/i}"
    Merel "{i}结婚啊……？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3678
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d30ebf54:

    # "Merel looked at me, her expression impassive. Her red eyes were wide and her head was tilted, her lips pursed."
    "她望着我，没什么表情，红眼睛睁大，头微微歪着，嘴唇抿起。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3679
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_6fbea4b5:

    # "I think my audacious request must have shocked her, because for once, she had nothing to say to me."
    "这个大胆的要求，大概真把她吓到了。难得的，她一句话也说不出。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3680
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_684cd62e:

    # "There was a long, unbroken silence: a silence during which I stared Merel down, my expression impassive."
    "长久的沉默没有被打破，我也面无表情地盯着她。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3681
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_77325403:

    # "I was so young, I don’t think I realised quite what I was asking from her. I didn’t know what demands I was making on Merel, or what marriage really entailed..."
    "那时太小，我大概根本不懂自己提出了什么。不了解这个要求有多大，也不知道结婚意味着什么……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3682
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_007723d3:

    # "But Merel, being two years my senior, probably did understand."
    "可她比我大两岁，或许懂得多一些。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3683
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1e63a6cc:

    # "She must have known that marriage required a wealth of feelings greater than a five year old girl could really understand, and yet..."
    "一定知道，婚姻需要的感情，远比五岁小女孩能理解的复杂。可她还是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3684
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_57929b77:

    # Merel "{i}Now, that’s quite the ask, wahaha~ Are you sure you wanna get married to a bad girl like me?{/i}"
    Merel "{i}这个要求可不小，哇哈哈～确定要跟我这种坏女孩结婚？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3685
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ef87f737:

    # Nienke "{i}Yes, I’m sure — and since when were you a bad girl? You’re much, much nicer to me than Roan and the others.{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}确定。而且，你哪里坏了？比罗安他们对我好多了。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3686
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0189d86e:

    # Nienke "{i}He said he liked me, but he was horrible to me. I don’t want to get married to Roan. I wouldn’t, even if he was the last boy in the land...{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}他说喜欢我，却又那么坏。我不要跟罗安结婚，就算全世界只剩他一个男孩子，也不要……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3687
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3f3ec364:

    # Nienke "{i}But you’re different. I like you, Mereltje, so we should stay together. You’re already my prince, so you can be my husband, too.{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}可你不一样。小梅蕾尔，我喜欢你，所以我们应该一直在一起。你已经是我的王子，也可以当我丈夫。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3688
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1c3524ce:

    # Nienke "{i}It’s that simple.{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}就是这么简单。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3689
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_11ce5eab:

    # Merel "{i}I’m not sure about that, but if that’s what you want...{/i}"
    Merel "{i}不知道有没有那么简单，不过，既然你想的话……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3690
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_026db7f1:

    # "Gently, Merel took my right hand in her own. She laced our fingers together, the gesture so tender that I trembled from it."
    "她轻轻握住我的右手，手指交扣。动作太温柔，让我微微一颤。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3691
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a7420fdb:

    # "Then, she brought my hand to her mouth."
    "然后，把我的手举到唇边。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3692
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5a94a407:

    # "She kissed my hand, grazing her lips against the small hillocks of my knuckles, and said..."
    "她吻了吻我的手，嘴唇轻轻掠过指节，说……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3693
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8109f40e:

    # Merel "{i}Alright then. I’ll hold you to that, Niene.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}好吧。妮妮，这可是你说的。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3694
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_49eab569:

    # Merel "{i}We can’t get married now, ’cause we’re both still kids. I think you’ve gotta be grown-ups for that...{/i}"
    Merel "{i}现在还不能结婚，我们都是小孩子，应该得长大才行……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3695
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_27c42d55:

    # Merel "{i}But when we both get older, we can do it. We’ll get married — and then I’ll never, ever leave your side.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}等我们都长大，就结婚。到时候，我永远、永远都不离开你。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3696
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_06a632cf:

    # Nienke "{i}And you don’t mind that...?{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}你真的不介意……？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3697
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4f127cae:

    # Merel "{i}’Course not! I mean, why would I? I already told you, silly Niene. I love you a lot...{/i}"
    Merel "{i}当然不介意！为什么要介意？都说过了，傻妮妮，我特别喜欢你……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3698
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_38c1b669:

    # Merel "{i}And, even if we wind up driftin’ apart, or one of us leaves Mors Paravail, that’ll never change.{/i}"
    Merel "{i}就算以后慢慢分开，或者谁搬离了莫尔斯·帕拉维尔，这一点也不会变。{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3699
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fd3d076a:

    # Merel "{i}It doesn’t matter if you leave me, or if I have to leave you. A lot might change, but that’s how the world is! Nothin’ lasts forever...{/i}"
    Merel "{i}不管是你离开我，还是我不得不离开你，都没关系。很多事会变，世界就是这样嘛，没有什么能永远不变……{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3703
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_737279fd:

    # Merel "{i}But my feelings for you will. I’ll honour them, so I’ll come back to you. I’m never gonna leave you alone. How could I?{/i}"
    Merel "{i}可我对你的心意不会变。我会守着这份心意，回到你身边，绝不让你孤零零的。怎么舍得呀？{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3704
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_3bd88239:

    # Merel "{i}If I do that, I’ll never be able to marry you!{/i}"
    Merel "{i}真那样，就没法跟你结婚了！{/i}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3716
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8473fbbc:

    # "I stare at Merel, blinking away the remnants from these memories; memories so finely, sharply formed that they threaten to lacerate me."
    "我望着梅蕾尔，眨眼驱散记忆的余影。那些回忆太清晰，太锐利，几乎要割伤我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3717
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1209b994:

    # "My heart flutters, my lips parting into a small, surprised circle."
    "心口轻颤，嘴唇惊讶地张成小小的圆形。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3718
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4bcff82a:

    # "I can hardly believe I forgot that moment. How could I?"
    "不敢相信，自己竟忘了那一刻。怎么能忘？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3719
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_546eb573:

    # "I asked Merel if she would marry me, and she agreed."
    "我问她愿不愿意跟我结婚，她答应了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3720
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b180e49e:

    # "In that sense, this ceremony is just reaffirming what Merel should already know."
    "这么说来，眼下这场仪式，不过是再次确认她本来就知道的事。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3721
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8c5d1dec:

    # "She should be aware that I care for her. I might even have loved her once, though I was so young, I didn’t really understand the nuance behind the word."
    "她该知道我在乎她。也许以前就爱过她，只是年纪太小，还不懂这个字里那么多细腻的意味。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3722
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c805655d:

    # "I doubt that the five-year-old me loved Merel in a romantic sense, but now...?"
    "五岁的我，大概不是以恋爱的方式爱着她。可现在……？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3723
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_e2c31b09:

    # "I feel like my feelings for Merel have come full circle."
    "我对梅蕾尔的感情，仿佛绕了一圈，又回到了原点。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3724
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_730f09fe:

    # "Once, she meant everything to me. She was my dearest friend and my closest confidant: the person I cared about more than anything."
    "曾经，她就是我的一切。最亲爱的朋友，最亲近的知己，比什么都让我在乎的人。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3725
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_47eca69d:

    # "I adored her. I might even have revered her. I cared for her, and I never wanted to leave her."
    "我喜欢她，甚至可能崇拜她。关心她，从没想过离开。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3726
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_996c5015:

    # "She meant so, so much to me..."
    "她对我那么、那么重要……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3727
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_7d6b412c:

    # "But, despite that, I still forgot her."
    "可即便如此，我还是忘了。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3728
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_4948ec71:

    # "I have no idea how I could have, but..."
    "不知道自己怎么会忘。可是……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3729
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_52761452:

    # Nienke "Oh, Merel..."
    Nienke "梅蕾尔……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3730
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c301b912:

    # "I sniff, newly overwhelmed by the depths of my own feelings."
    "我吸了吸鼻子，又一次被自己深深的感情淹没。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3731
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_c21b05b7:

    # Nienke "I remember now. I remember everything — or the things which matter, at least. I remember the things I said to you..."
    Nienke "想起来了。现在都想起来了，至少，重要的那些。我记得跟你说过什么……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3732
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_8500fc4d:

    # Nienke "And I remember how much I cared for you!"
    Nienke "也记得，那时候有多在乎你！"

# chapter3.rpyc:3733
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_fc9f90c3:

    # Merel "Nienke... No, Niene. Can I call you that now?"
    Merel "妮恩克……不，妮妮。现在可以这么叫你了吗？"

# chapter3.rpyc:3734
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_677c7f16:

    # Nienke "I-If you want. I remember. You always did call me that. It was your pet name for me. You... {w}were always so kind to me."
    Nienke "你、你想叫就叫吧。我记得，你以前一直这样叫我，是专门给我的昵称。你……{w}一直对我很好。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3735
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d8b4bd6b:

    # Merel "Hehe. Well, I did my best. I dunno if I was the best prince, but... Gee. I’m real happy you remembered."
    Merel "嘿嘿，我有努力啦。不知道是不是最好的王子，不过……哎呀，你能想起来，我真开心。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3736
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0bf48624:

    # Merel "I was hoping that you would, though I didn’t wanna push it. Like you said, it would mean more if you remembered it on your own."
    Merel "一直盼着你想起来，可又不想逼你。就像你说的，自己记起，才更有意义。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3737
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_19c90736:

    # Merel "I was worried I’d be swayin’ your feelings too much if I simply laid it all out for you. I wanted to wait to see if you remembered; if it’d all come rushin’ back..."
    Merel "我怕全告诉你，会太影响你的心情。想等一等，看你会不会自己想起来，看那些记忆会不会一下涌回来……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3738
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_56ea7356:

    # Merel "But seein’ you again like this feels almost like destiny. It’s almost like we were fated to be together..."
    Merel "可现在这样再次见到你，真像命运一样。好像我们注定就该在一起……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3739
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2aa75b22:

    # Merel "Or somethin’ like that, wahahaha! {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Merel "反正，差不多就是这种感觉，哇哈哈哈！{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# chapter3.rpyc:3740
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2e8fb2c7:

    # "Merel laughs openly, with abandon, flashing a mouthful of pearly whites."
    "她毫无保留地放声笑起来，露出一口白牙。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3741
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_5f4a9476:

    # "Her face is wreathed in smiles: so much so, it looks as though she’s glowing."
    "满脸都是笑，像整个人都在发光。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3742
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_2f9e753c:

    # "I’ve seen Merel smile before, of course, but this smile does something to me."
    "当然，以前见过她笑。可这个笑容，却触动了我。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3743
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_ff7b9ed7:

    # "I’m not sure why, but it makes my heart skip a beat."
    "说不出为什么，心跳漏了一拍。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3744
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_bfc52c3d:

    # "I’m not sure if I really believe in destiny, or in fate. These concepts feel a little too abstract to me."
    "我不确定自己信不信命运，或者缘分。这些概念太抽象。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3745
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_a055e115:

    # "They’re pleasant-sounding words, but they don’t carry any truth to them."
    "听起来美好，却没什么真实根据。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3746
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_61031288:

    # "I think they’re convenient lies people tell themselves for reassurance, when they want to soothe themselves into believing that the world is operating on some sort of grander plan than it is."
    "我一直觉得，那只是人们安慰自己的说法，让自己相信世界的运转背后，有一套宏大的安排。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3747
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_b6da4c5a:

    # "Believing in concepts like fate and destiny makes the big old world seem smaller than it is, and more manageable."
    "相信命运和缘分，就能让这个广阔的世界显得小一些，也更容易面对。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3748
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_14327c57:

    # "It imposes some sort of order onto our chaotic lives, and it helps us live peacefully."
    "给混乱的生活套上一点秩序，让人安心过日子。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3749
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_1f61b74b:

    # "That’s what I’ve always believed, at least..."
    "至少，我一直这么想……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3750
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_33f7efb4:

    # "But, when I see Merel smiling like this, I can’t help but wonder if there’s some truth to what she’s saying."
    "可看见她这样的笑，又忍不住怀疑，她说的也许有几分道理。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3751
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_d5d31d2f:

    # "Maybe destiny does exist...{w} and, if it does, maybe we really are destined to be together."
    "也许命运真的存在……{w}如果存在，也许我们真的是注定的一对。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3752
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_60af876c:

    # "I forgot about Merel for years and years. My memories of her had vanished: replaced, instead, by a featureless silhouette of a prince."
    "我忘了她那么多年。那些记忆消失了，只留下一位看不清面目的王子的轮廓。"

# chapter3.rpyc:3753
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_54d86f41:

    # "I had forgotten her smile; forgotten her bright red eyes; forgotten her voice, so full of life..."
    "忘了她的笑，忘了明亮的红眼睛，忘了那个充满活力的声音……"

# chapter3.rpyc:3754
translate zh_CN_portable chapter3_0bbc9a10:

    # "But, now that I’m standing before her, I know that I’ll never forget her again."
    "可现在站在她面前，我知道，再也不会忘记了。"

